<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">– Lokonda</book>
  <para style="h">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc2">LUKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nsango e bɔlɔti eki Luka</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luka</para>
  <para style="imt">Ibangako</para>
  <para style="ip">Nko nga boyali eka Matayo, Luka aolia Nsango e bɔlɔti ekɔtɔki nde nko nde bɔlɔngɔ bo bɔnɛnɛ bɔkɔtɔki Malako:</para>
  <para style="io1">– Bɔlɔkɔ booki Yowane Buuni, ndɔndi eeki Yesu (3, 1-20), nkamba nyunama la ndenge eelengolaki ibɔ Yesu (3, 21-4, 13).</para>
  <para style="io1">– Bosala booki Yesu bosalaki nde Ngalilayi, etaki nde yolaka la yobikya banto baayalaki la nkandi (4, 14-9, 50).</para>
  <para style="io1">Lɔkɛndɔ looki Yesu, loobotombi ima Ngalilayi tii Yelusalɛmɛ (9, 51-19, 28). Luka akobeya anɛ buuke bo mbo nde iyali eka Malako, nga we lwɛlya looki bohi Samalia, lɔnɛ loki bokulaka bopa la lianya, lɔnɛ loki bona obungaki mpe ahwɛnia, ngauko la ngauko, la mpe basolo nga inɛ iki Yesu itaaki nde yolenda Malata la Balia.</para>
  <para style="io1">Bosala booki Yesu bosalaki nde Yelusalɛmɛ (19, 29 21, 38),</para>
  <para style="io1">– Bosala bota yohuka nde Eelo yookaki Yesu (bɛnyɔkɔ beeki nde be nsuki la iwa ikinde nde ekulusu, bekapo 22-23).</para>
  <para style="io1">– Buku eeki Luka ehuka nde buuna bo Pasika (bok. 24), ndye etika nde ndenge eyaɛniaki Yesu eka bakɛndi la nde baataki Emausu lombuha lo nkundwa eeki nde mpe ntondo eki atepele mbo iiki Etwelo ekinde nde liko.</para>
  <para style="io1">Eya Luka yotikwana la Malako, wambɔ nde lombuha lo bɔlɔndɔ bo Nsango e bɔlɔti, ndye etohangela nde bonto ɔɔkɔtɛlɛki nde nkɔti ikɔ la mpe eelimbola nde ndenge ɛkɔtɔki nde ikɔ (1, 1-4), Luka abangɛ isolo iiki nde la empulu etepela nde mbo iilenda ndenge ebotwaki Yesu la Yowane Buuni (bek. 1-2). Otanɛ aiko basolo bae nga nsango ehangelaki bontomwa Balia, mbotwa eeki Yowane Buuni, mbotwa eeki Yesu mpe itotya iiki bahɛndjɛli ba mpata, ngauko la ngauko, la mpe Nyembo eeki Balia, eeki Zakalia, eeki Simeona. Nde empulu ɛkɔ elanɛ, Luka aɛniɛ botako lobo lo ntina looki nsango ekii nde: Yesu auma eka Ndjakomba (ayali Ndjakomba) mpe buuma nde nte nde bakila baaki bayuda (Isalaɛlɛ), boyali eyeelo lookii nde eyali ikambo yendjɛ bokili lonkundu. Luka aɛnia mpe lolango lo bɔnɛnɛ lolanga Ndjakomba banto bapa la nsango (baayahuloya, batonɛ ibɔ, bainto, bɛmbɔlɔ, babutu), aɛnia bosala bo bɔnɛnɛ booki Bolimo bo Ndjakomba, mpe lolenge lo ibulwako, lo itotya mpe lo lɔbɔndɔ loyalaka ndɔnge eyali Nsango e bɔlɔti.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nsango e bɔlɔti eeki Luka ependa yɛnia mbo ɛkɔtɔmɔki itina iiki banto baatanga lokota lo Ngeleki. Akɔtɛlɛ banto bapwebe mbo iiki bayuda buuke, ɛkɔiko elanga nde mbala la mbala aɛnie potya mpe alimbole bɔlɔti bakambo baapa ibɔ batingole. ekɔiko eyali mpe Nsango e bɔlɔti eeki nde ntute la banto baa lɔlɔkɔ lɔnɛ. Kaki ongoyelɛ lobo lɔmɔɔ la lɔmɔɔ, akooyeba ooyali hɔlɔ Bobikii boki banto bankuma.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ibangelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Bokulaka Teofili,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:1">Banto buuke bamekaki yɔkɔtɔ mbo ilekaki ekanso, <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />lolenge lɔnɛ lotoheneyaki banɛ baɛnɛki mbo ikɔ la baiho baakiibɔ ima ibangako mpe bakitɛ basali baaki Nsango e bɔlɔti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 2 </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Nsango e Bɔlɔti anɛ epolimbole bonkanda bo Ndjakomba, eyali wambɔ mbo itepela Ndjakomba itina iki banto.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Ekɔiko, la emi mpe ngotilɛ ndjebe bɔlɔti mpendja mbo ikɔ inkuma ilɛkɛ ima nde ibangako, kela nkɔkɔtɛle ikɔ lɔmɔɔ la lɔmɔɔ, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />olongi wɛ wɛne nguya eeki balako babataki wɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bontomwa ahwebya mbotwa eeki Yowane Buuni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Ntango eyalaki Elode nkumu eeki Bayuda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elode nkumu eeki Bayuda wambɔ nkumu eeki bokili bonkuma looko lombokihake Bayuda, ngoyali etuka e Yudeya la etuka e Samalia.</char></note>, eyalaki la nkanga eeki Ndjakomba ɛmɔ, lina ikiinde Yakalia, ɔmɔɔ oki nkanga iiki Ndjakomba nde bɔlɔngɔ booki Abia. Waali okinde aumaki nde bokundi booki Alona, lina ikinde Elisabɛti. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Ibɔ bayaape bayalaki banto ba semba nde baiho baaki Ndjakomba mpe bambooyelake bebeko la ntomo iiki Nkolo bɔlɔti. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Ɛpɛpɛli ɛmɔɔ nko tababota, itina Elisabɛti ayalaki ekomba mpe la nde la boome bakitaki bingambi.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Buuna bɔmɔɔ, Yakalia ayalaki nde bohala bookinde bo bonkanga ntondo eeki Ndjakomba, itina eyalaki ngala ekibɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Nga bokelaka ibɔ, balikaki bɛbɛlɛ, bɔbɔhɔlɔ nde aɔtwe nde ntei e Tɛmpɛlo eeki Nkolo kela atu yotumba mbaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yotumba mbaka. Lenda la nde Yol 30, 7.8.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Banto bankuma baayalaki nde lɔbɔndɔ nde bongala elaka iiko etumba ibɔ mbaka. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Nko nde elaka ɛkɔ, bontomwa booki Nkolo aolelɛ Yakalia, ayɛ yemala nde lɔbɔ lo loome loki etumbelo e mbaka. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Anɛ ɛbɔɛnɛki nde, Yakalia aotutuma mpe ayooka bɔɔmɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Bontomwa booki Nkolo abobelɛ: «Tookake bɔɔmɔ, Yakalia, itina Ndjakomba angookɛ lɔbɔndɔ lokiɛ: waali okiɛ Elisabɛti angookobotela bona o loondo onga wɛ opaa lina Yowane. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Bona uuko angookopa bohalangano la ibulwako baa mpe banto buuke bangooyala la ibulwako itina i mbotwa ekinde. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Itina bona uuko angooyala bonto o bɔnɛnɛ nde baiho baaki Nkolo. Tangɔmɛlɛ baana ba bootwa. Angooyoola la Bolimo bo Bɔyɛngwa ima nko ayali mpɔu nde ikundi i nyango ekinde. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Angooyunoya bana buuke baaki Isalaɛlɛ eka Nkolo Ndjakomba ekibɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Nde angooya lontondo nga bontomwa booki Ndjakomba, angooyala la bolimo mpe la nguya nga eyalaki la Elia, kela angokihye baihe la bana bɔkɔkɔ bɔmɔɔ, aunoye banɛ baundjwɛ nde lyanya iiki banto ba semba, itina iiki angɔbɔngyɛle Nkolo botonga.» <verse eid="LUK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Yakalia abelɛ bontomwa: «Yaa emi ngoyeba ɛkɔ ngamo? Emi nde ɔnɛ oyɛ ekota, waali okimi mpe ayɛ la nde engambi.» <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Bontomwa booki Nkolo abounoyelɛ: «Emi wambɔ Ngabilɛ, ɔnɛ wemalaka ntondo eeki Ndjakomba kela aohalele. Ndjakomba nde kiika antindaki yokobela la yokohangela nsango e bɔlɔti ɛkɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Lendaka, aiko epa wɛ tuumeya mbɔ mbo imba emi nkobele ingokelama nde elaka eeki ikɔ, wɛ ongoyala luumi, tongunwa lenkina yotepela tii nko buuna bongokelama mbo ikɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Banto baalilaki Yakalia bayɛnɛ ebubu ikɔlɔ yopenda ngina e botio mpiko yɔtwaki nde nde ntei e Tɛmpɛlo. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Anɛ yolaki nde, tayoyunwa yotepeya banto baayalaki aiko. Banto bahweba mbɔ angwɛnɛ ɛɛnɛlo mpiko nde ntei e Tɛmpɛlo. Aobatepeya nko nde behai mpe aookita luumi.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Anɛ eheyaki Yakalia ngala ekinde e bosala, ahunwa ekande. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Mbuha e biina, waali okinde Elisabɛti aɔpɔhwa lyemi. Sandja itano bonkundu auhɛ lyemi. Ayatepeyɛ nde ante: <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />«Lenda lobo lohonkelela Nkolo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anɛ Nkolo eyali wambɔ Ndjakomba Ihe, teyali Yesu (anɛ tabotwi la mbotwa).</char></note> anɛ enga nde andendɛ kela anyumole nsoni ɛnɛ eyalɛ la emi nde baiho ba banto.»<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bontomwa ahwebya mbotwa eeki Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Nde sandja ɛnɛ e botoba, Ndjakomba atindaki bontomwa Ngabilɛ nde ehe ɛmɔɔ e Ngalilaya, lina iiki ehe ɛkɔ Nazalɛti, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />eka eboha e buunto epa tɛkɛndi la beele, ayali nko ihɔkɛ iiki eboha e loondo lina Yosepu, nde bokundi booki Dawidi; lina iiki eboha e buunto ɛkɔ Balia. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Bontomwa booki Ndjakomba aɔtwɛlɛ eboha e buunto mpe abobelɛ: «Yala la bohalangano, Balia! Wɛ obatɛ bokako eka Ndjakomba. Nkolo ayali la wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Anɛ yokaki Balia bobekolo buuko, aotungyama, aoyaubola itina iiki bobekolo bo ngauko. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Bontomwa aobobela: «Tookake bɔɔmɔ, Balia, itina Ndjakomba akɔtɔmɛyɛ bokako. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Lenda, ɔngɔpɔhwa lyemi, ongobota bona o loondo, ongobopa lina Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Angooyala bonto o bɔnɛnɛ mpe bangooweta Bona ooki Ndjakomba ɛnɛ e lobola. Nkolo Ndjakomba angoobopa bokopo bɔnɛ we Dawidi nkɔkɔ-nyango ekinde, <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Angɔɔlɛ bokopo booki Isalaɛlɛ botako. Bokopo bokinde tabongohila la buuna bɔmɔɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Balia ayuubola bontomwa booki Nkolo: «Yaa lobo lɔkɔ longokelama ngamo, aiko epa emi la boome?» <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Bontomwa aobobela: «Bolimo bo Bɔyɛngwa bongoyala la wɛ, nguya eeki Ndjakomba e lobola engokwapema. Ekɔiko enga baetakɛ bona uuko ongobotwa bɔyɛngwa mpe Bona ooki Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Lendaka Elisabɛti, bohibotonga okyɛ, ayali la nde la lyemi, nde bonto ohokita engambi; lyemi yokita sandja botoba, nde ɔnwe ibɔ bahangake ayali ekomba. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Elimbola wambɔ teyali la la lobo lɔmɔɔ lopa Ndjakomba tangɔhɔ yokela.» <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Anɛ yokaki Balia ngauko, aohanga: «Emi nde ɔnɛ, ndjali bosali booki Nkolo; inkuma inkelamele nko nga omba wɛ ohange.» Aiko, bontomwa booki Nkolo aɔkɛndɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Balia atɛ yolenda Elisabɛti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Nko nde biina biiko, Balia aolangwa kela atu lobango lobango nde ehe ɛmɔɔ e Yudeya eyali looko lo ngomba. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Aɔtwɛ nde botumba booki Yakalia mpe abekolɛ Elisabɛti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Anɛ e Elisabɛti aokake bobekolo booki Balia, bɔna oyali nde ikundi ikinde aobulwa mpe Bolimo bo Bɔyɛngwa boowapema. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Elisabɛti aoboba: «Wɛ oyolɛ la bokako lontondo loki bainto bankuma, bokako boyali la la mpɔu eyali nde ikundi ikiɛ! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Yaa we emi nnɔ kela nyango eeki Nkolo ekimi aye ekami? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Anɛ emba emi ndjoke bobekolo bokyɛ, bona ɔnɛ oyali nde ikundi iiki emi aobulwa la bosalangano. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Ɛmɛngɔ eyali la wɛ bonto ɔnɛ umeyaki mbɔ inkuma ikolakoyaki Nkolo ingokelama.»<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyembo eeki Balia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Balia aotepela nde ambɔ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">«Botema bokimi bokumya bɔnɛnɛ booki Nkolo,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />Bolimo bookimi boyɛ la bosalangano itina iiki Ndjakomba e mbikya;<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />itina angondendɛ la bɔlɔti bonkuma, emi ema e bosali bookinde bopa la yoomba nde baiho ba banto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Ima lɔlɔkɔ tii nde bileko binkuma, banto bankuma bangoondjetakɛ buunto o ɛmɛngɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />La wengi mbɔ Ndjakomba ɛnɛ lobola ankelelɛ baoyi ba bɔnɛnɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Lina ikinde iyali bɔyɛngwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Bileko la bileko, aokelake banto banɛ babomangaka ihɛi.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Aɛniaki nguya ekinde</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:51">anɛ epandjaki nde banto banɛ ba ipolo,<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />apɔɔmɔlɔki nkumu ibekalaki bokopo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:52">aokondeya baapa la ntulu,<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />baawɛ la ndjala aobapa byomba buuke, baayalaki bekulaka aobaolya bapombo botoo.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Abikiɛ Bayuda, basali baakinde ba botema, tabopela yobaɛnia bɔlɔti bokinde<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />nko nga bolakoyaki nde ba nkaa ikinso Abalayama la bankana baakinde botako la botako.»<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Balia akihaki eka Elisabɛti ntute la sandja ihato, nkamba ayoyunwe ekabɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbotwa eeki Yowani Buuni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Anɛ ekitaki elaka eeki Elisabɛti yobota, aobota bona o loondo. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Banto bakiha la nde ntute la bahibotonga baakinde bahobata nsango mbɔ Nkolo angɔbɔɛniɛ nsuki e bɔlɔti mpe baobulwa ibɔ la nde. <verse eid="LUK 1:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Mbuha e bɛkɔlɔ mwambi, banto bayaki yopupola bona mpulu; balangaki babopaa lina iiki ihe, Yakalia. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Endaka, nyango eeki bona aohanga: «Nkola, lina ikinde Yowane.» <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Banto baayaki baobohangela: «Yaa nde bokundi bookinyo nga teyali la bonto oyali la lina iko nnɔ!» <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Ibɔ banɛ botilaka baubole ihe nde behai kaki alanga apa bona lina nnɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Yakalia ayoubola babopaa ɛkɔtɛlo e benkanda. Anɛ eha baboyela, aɔkɔtɔ bamɔlɔ banɛ: «Lina ikinde Yowane.» Banto bankuma nko byɔli. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />La mbala ɛmɔɔ, bonya boobolipwa mpe lolemu loobolitwa. Yakalia ayunwa lenkina yotepela, aokumya Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Bɔɔmɔ bobuta banto bankuma bayalaki aiko mpe banto bankuma bakihaki looko luuko lo ngomba e Yudeya baototepele nko nsango iiko. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Bankuma baokaki baokanena mpe baoyaubola: «Ilɛlɛngɛ inɛ angooyala nte nnɔ?» Itina nguya eeki Nkolo eyalaki mpendja la nde.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyembo eeki Yakalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Yakalia, ihe eeki bona ɔkɔ, aoyoola la nguya eeki Bolimo bo Bɔyɛngwa mpe nde ɔnɛ otepela:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />«Bokako boyale la Nkolo, Ndjakomba ɛnɛ eki Isalaɛlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:68">itina angoyɛ yolenda botonga bokinde mpe yobobikya.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Angotindɛ nguya e lobiko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:69">nde bokundi booki Dawidi, bosali bokinde.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Uuko lobo lwebyaki nde ima ndɛlɛ nde bonya booki ntepeli ikinde i bɔyɛngwa,<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />wambɔ lobiko lootuumola nde bɛbɔ beki banto baayali la nso ilanga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:71">la nde nguya eeki baatuuna.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Aɛniaki bɔlɔti bokinde eka ba nkaa ikinso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:72">aobopwa mpe boheka buuko bɔyɛngwa bɔkɔtɔki nde la ibɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />wambɔ elaka elakoyaki nde nkaa ekinso Abalayama,<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />mbɔ angootuumola nde bɛbɔ beki baayali la nso ilanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:74">mpe angootopa epoha kela tobokumye nkooka bɔɔmɔ,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />kela toyale banto ba bɔyɛngwa la semba nde baiho baakinde</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:75">biina benkuma beyali nso nde bolongo.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Nga la wɛ, bona, bangookweta ntepeli eeki Ndjakomba ɛnɛ e lobola,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">ongota lotondo loki Nkolo kela ɔbɔbɔngyɛle beboko,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />ongolakye botonga bokinde lobiko lɔnɛ looye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:77">nde ndjela e boliboli bahumu.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Uuko ndenge ɛtwɛnia Ndjakomba bɔlɔti la ihɛi ikinde:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">aɔtwɛlya la lwɛya lookinde lo bɔnɛnɛ nga lɔnɛ loki waane bo nkɛhɛ,<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />aɔyɛlya banto baayali nde buulima mpe ntutama la nyɔi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">kela atwɛnie lokolo lo yɔkɛndɛ nde ndjela etokitya nde hɛi.»<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Nga la bona, nde aolwaki mpe akitaki nguya, la nde byonge la nde bolimo. Akihaki nko nde bokili bo bɛkɔngɔ, tii elaka eyaolyaki nde nde baiho baaki banto ba Isalaɛlɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Mbotwa eeki Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mat 1, 18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Nko nde elaka ɛkɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elaka ɛkɔ wambɔ mbuha e mbotwa eeki Yowane Buuni.</char></note>, Nkumu Kaisalo Ogisito atindɛ bonkanda bo lotango itina iiki banto bankuma bakihi nde bokili booki ba Loma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bokili booki ba Loma elimbola bihe binkuma biyaki Kaisalo Ogisito bonkondi .</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Lotango lɔkɔ lo ntondo ntondo, lokelamaki elaka eyalaki Kilino bɔndɛlɛ-mboka booki etuka e Siliya. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Banto bankuma bataki yɔkɔtɔ baina, bonto la bonto nde imonga ikinde. <verse eid="LUK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Yosepu mpe alangwɛ nde imonga i Nazalɛti iyali nde etuka e Ngalilaya, atɛ nde imonga i Bɛtɛlɛmɛ ebotwa Dawidi, nde etuka e Yudeya, itina nde kiika ayalaki bonto o bokundi booki Dawidi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Ataki yɔkɔtɔ lina nde lotango lɔkɔ nde la Balia, ihɔkɛ ikinde iyalaki la lyemi. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Aiko eyalaki ibɔ mpiko, elaka yobota yoyela. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Balia abotɛ nsɔmi okinde e loondo. Abolingɛ la bitate bi bihenda, mpe abolalyɛ nde eleelo eeki nyama, itina tababata ndye yokiha nde botumba bo babutu.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bontomwa aolelɛ bahɛndjɛli ba mpata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Nko mpiko ɛkɔ, eyalaki la banto banɛ bahɛndjɛlɛkɛ mpata, ibɔ balekyaki botyo buuko nde bilanga yɔhɛndjɛlɛ bibwa bikibɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Bontomwa booki Nkolo abaolelɛ mpe lwɛya looki Nkolo lwɛlyɛ ndye iiko eyalaki ibɔ. Baokɛ ekola e bɔɔmɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Bontomwa booki Ndjakomba ababelɛ nde wante: «Talokake bɔɔmɔ, ngoloyelɛ nsango ɛmɔɔ e bɔlɔti, engopa banto buuke ibulwako: <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />nko nde botyo bɔnɛ bo lɔlɔkɔ, anɛ nde imonga inɛ iki Dawidi, bangolobotelɛ Bobikii, nde wambɔ Kilito Nkolo. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Ndembetelo enga lwebe ɛkɔ ɛnɛ: longotana ilɛlɛngɛ alingi la bitate bi bihenda, abeti nde eleelo e nyama.»<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Mpe nko aiko mbala ɛmɔɔ, bɛlɔngɔ be bentomwa be lobola byolinga bontomwa booki Ndjakomba ipɔmbɔ, baokumya Ndjakomba, baotepela:<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />«Lokumo eka Ndjakomba nde lobola<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lobola elakania ndye e nkɛmbɔ</char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:14">bokili boyale la hɛi itina iiki banto baalanga nde.»<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bahɛndjɛli bayoli Bɛtɛlɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Nko bentomwa beki Nkolo baobahenye kela baunwe nde lobola, bahɛndjɛli ba mpata baoyahangela ibɔ la ibɔ: «Lolangwa, lotuukole, totu Bɛtɛlɛmɛ, itolenda ingolekɛ mpiko, nga bomba Nkolo atwebye.» <verse eid="LUK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Bahɛndjɛli ba mpata batɛ lobango lobango; bataanɛ Balia la Yosepu, la ilɛlɛngɛ yoyume yobotwa alali nde eleelo e nyama. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Anɛ ɛnɛki bahɛndjɛli bona, baebyɛ inkuma ibahangelaki bontomwa booki Nkolo itina iiki ilɛlɛngɛ iiko. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Banto bankuma baokaki nsango eeki bahɛndjɛli ba mpata baitɛ nko byoli la inɛ ibahangelaki ibɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Nga la Balia, abombɛ ikɔ inkuma nde botema bokinde mpe aikanenake. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Bahɛndjɛli ba mpata baunwɛ eka ibɔ. Bakumyɛ bɔnɛnɛ booki Ndjakomba itina iiki mbo inkuma yokaki ibɔ la yɛnɛki ibɔ, inkuma ilɛkɛ nko ndenge ɛnɛ ebahangelaki bontomwa booki Nkolo.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batikɛ Yesu lina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Nde bɔkɔlɔ bo mwambi mbuha e mbotwa, buuna bo yopupola bona mpulu bokitɛ; batikɛ bona lina Yesu, nko ndenge etepelaki bontomwa booki Nkolo ntondo eeki nyango apɔhwe lyemi.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baɛniɛ Yesu nde Tɛmpɛlo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />La lombuha luuko, anɛ ekitaki elaka e mpɛtwa ndenge etinda bobeko booki Mose<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lenda nde Lewitiki 12, 2-4.</char></note>, ihe la nyango ibɔ banɛ bayobotombaka nde Tɛmpɛlo e Yelusalɛmɛ kela babolakye eka Nkolo. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Lolenge lokomi nde buku e bobeko booki Nkolo: «Nsɔmi enkuma e loondo engobotwe, bangoobokapela Nkolo.» <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Bapaake mpe mbeka ɛnɛ e ibola bobeko booki Nkolo, «bimpompo bipe laa mpe bimbenga bipe.»<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Nko nde elaka iiko, eyalaki la bonto ɔmɔɔ nde Yelusalɛmɛ, lina ikinde Simeyo. Ayalaki bonto ɔmɔɔ o semba mpe oyali la imɛmɔ eka Nkolo, aolile la botema bɔmɔɔ bonto ɔnɛ ongobikye Isalaɛlɛ. Bolimo bo Bɔyɛngwa mpe boyalaki la nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Bolimo bo Bɔyɛngwa bɔwɛniaki tangowa nkwɛnɛ Masiya, bontomwa booki Nkolo. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Nko aiko, Bolimo bobotindɛ atu nde Tɛmpɛlo. Elaka eyaki mboti iiki Yesu yokela mbo itinda bobeko itina ikinde, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simeyo akɔhɛ bona nde bɛbɔ bekinde, apɛɛ Nkolo bokako mpe ahangɛ ngɔnɛ:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />«Nkolo, aiko eha wɛ okokya elaka ekiɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">henyaka bosali bokiɛ akɛnde la hɛi.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Itina ngwɛnɛ emi kiika la baiho lobiko lokiɛ,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />lɔnɛ lɔbɔngyɛ wɛ ntondo eeki bekili benkuma:<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />lwɛya lɔnɛ lɔngɔkwɛnia eka bikolo binkuma nde bolongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:32">lokumo loki Isalaɛlɛ, botonga bokiɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Simeyo aebyɛ inɛ yoye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Ihe la nyango eeki bona bayuula nkimo anɛ yokaki ibɔ itepela Simeyo itina iiki bona. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Nko aiko, Simeyo aobatɔmɛya bokako mpe aohangela Balia, nyango eeki bona: «Lenda, bona ɔnɛ angooyala itina i ɛkwa la itina i elonga eeki banto buuke nde Isalaɛlɛ, angooyala itina i lɔmpɛnyɛ eka banto buuke; <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />ngauko bikanelo binɛ bihamaki nde betema beki banto buuke bingoyola nde bongala. Nga la wɛ, nyango, ongoyoka lyale nga wɛnɛ wɛ bangokobokɛ ikula nde botema.»<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ana, engambi e bainto ntepeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Nko nde elaka iiko, ntepeli ɛmɔɔ e buunto ayɛ la nde nko aiko, lina ikinde Ana, bona ooki Panwɛlɛ, nde bokundi booki Asɛlɛ. Akitɛ nte engambi e bainto. Abalaki nde boboha, mpe baokihi nde la boome nko mbula nsambo, <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />boome abowɛ mpe akityɛ mbula ntuku mwambi la inɛi. Ambooyalake nde Tɛmpɛlo, la waane la botyo aosalele nko Ndjakomba, bohala nko yoyakilya byomba la yɔbɔndɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Akitɛ nko nde elaka iiko mpe abangɛ yokumya Ndjakomba. Ahangelɛ nsango eeki bona uuko eka banto bankuma balilaki lobiko loki Yelusalɛmɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inwelo Nazalɛti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Anɛ eheyaki mboti iiki Yesu mbo inkuma iibola bobeko booki Nkolo, bayaunoyɛ ibɔ la nde Ngalilaya nde imonga ikibɔ i Nazalɛti. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Bona aolwɛ mpe abatɛ nguya. Wanya bopendɛ mpe lɔbɔ loki Ndjakomba lowapemɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nde Tɛmpɛlo la mbula liomu la ipe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Wengi mbula, mboti iiki Yesu bambootakɛ Yelusalɛmɛ nde ntɛkɔ e Pasika. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Anɛ ekityaki Yesu mbula lyomu la ipe, bobotombɛ la nde, nga wekehelɛ ibɔ yokela. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Nko ntɛkɔ yohile, bayaunoyɛ eka ibɔ, yaa nko bona o eboha Yesu atikalɛ Yelusalɛmɛ, ihe la nyango nkweba. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Bakambaki nko Yesu aoye nde la baninga mpe bakɛndɛ buuna lonkundu. Babotobotile eka bahi botonga la baninga baakiibɔ, <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />tawɛnɛ. Ekɔiko inwaki ibɔ Yelusalɛmɛ nko yotobotilaka. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Buuna bo behato, babotanɛ nde Tɛmpɛlo, akihi nde la belaki be bobeko, abaoka mpe abaibola mbo. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Banto bankuma bailɛ nkimo la lyanya ikinde mpe la mbuto yapa nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Anɛ ɛwɛnɛki mboti, bakulɛ bakoto mpe nyango abuubolɛ: «Bona okimi, itina inga wɛ otokelɛ ngɔnɛ nnɔ? Emi la ihe ekiɛ tomboyale la lɔkɛi baa aiko ekotila nso.» <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Ababelɛ: «Itina intila nyo nnɔ? Lopwebe mbɔ bɔlɔti ndandele mbo iiki Ihe ekimi?» <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Lendaka ibɔ, tababuteya itina i lobo lɔnɛ lobabelaki nde.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Lombuha luuko, Yesu aunwɛ Nazalɛti nde la ibɔ. Ambookelakɛ mbo inkuma imbobobelakɛ ibɔ. Mpe Nyango ekinde abombɛ mbo iiko inkuma ilekaki nde botema bokinde. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Yesu aolwɛ la wanya, nde byonge, mpe la Ndjakomba la banto bayalaki la ibulwako itina ikinde.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ilako iiki Yowane Buuni</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mlk 1, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yow 1, 19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Nde mbula e lyomu la itano ima ekondelaki Kaisalo Tibelio nde bokopo, aiko Posi Pilato ayali bɔndɛlɛ-mboka booki etuka e Yudeya, Elode abuti etuka e Ngalilaya mpe eboto ekinde Pilipo bonkondi bo Ituleya la Talakonitide, Lisaniasi abuti babu ba Abilɛnɛ, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />elaka iiko Ana la Kaifa bayali nkanga i benkondi, Ndjakomba aolelɛ Yowane, bona ooki Yakalia, nde bokili bo bɛkɔngo. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Yowane alingolɛ bokili bonkuma botuti la ndjale e Yɔlɔdani. Alikelɛ banto lobela lɔnɛ: «Lɔbɔngya bihɛlɛlo biikinyo, luunama, kela Ndjakomba angolibole bahumu baakinyo.»<verse eid="LUK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Yokelama nko ndenge ɛkɔtɔki ntepeli Isaya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">«Bonto ɔmɔɔ alika bobeki nde bokili bo bɛkɔngɔ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">Lobɔngya ndjela eeki Nkolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">lohembola bɛlɔli biiko.<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Bibɔkumela binkuma bingoyoyama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">ngomba la byɔngɔ benkuma bingohulwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">ndjela i bakumba ingohembwa mpe beboko be babɔkɔ benkuma bengoyalema. <verse eid="LUK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Nkamba banto bankuma bangwɛne lobiko lɔnɛ luuma eka Ndjakomba.»<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Banto buuke bambooyake eka Yowane kela abaune. Yowane aobabela ngɔnɛ: «Lenda ibɔ bongala nga batupa bapili! Ololakɛ lolote nkɛlɛ iiko eki Ndjakomba yoye nnɔ? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Loolya besala be bɔlɔti belakya mbɔ lwendjɛ bihɛlɛlo; talotake yohangaka nyo bamɛlɛ: “Abalayama ayali ihe ekinso.” Itina ndobela Ndjakomba aɔhɔ yɔkɔhɔ babɔkɔ banɛ baɛnɛ nyo anɛ, akitye bakɔ bana baaki Abalayama! <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Aiko wambɔ ihwa ingwɛlɛmɛ nde belubo: Bote bopobote mmuma i bɔlɔti bangoobopupola mpe baoboboka nde ntyɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Banto baayalaki aiko baoboubola: «Aiko tokele ngamo?» <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Aobabela: «Bonto oyali la bakakya bape, akapele opa tokati; okati byomba bi ndɛlɛ, akele nko ngauko.»<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Bataakoli ba mputi bayɛ la ibɔ yuunama mpe baibole Yowane: «Bolaki, tokele ngamo?» <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Aobabela: «Taloweyake banto bapute behɔlɔ beleka bɛnɛ bibola ibɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />La bahola mpe babuubolɛ: «Yaa nso tokele nnɔ?» Aobabela: «Talɔpɔɔmɔlɔke banto bɔhɔlɔ la longuya mpe talobalimbeyake bakambo, lɔlɛkɛkɛ nko bɔhɔlɔ bolongi la boputo bookinyo.»<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Banto balilaki elaka ɛmɔɔ ekokyame, ko bonto la bonto aoyaubola itina iiki Yowane: epoyali nde Masiya? <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Yowane abahangelɛ ibɔ bankuma: «Emi, nduuna nde bahi; bonto uuko oye mbuha ekimi, andeka emi la nguya: emi ntiɛli la la ilɛngɛ ilitola bonsinga nde bikote bikinde. Nde, angooluuna la nguya eeki Bolimo bo Bɔyɛngwa mpe la ntyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Abuti nde lɔbɔ lookinde inyongela yokapola mmuma la baɔmbi. Angooyoya mmuma nde boliko, nkamba aotumba bentembe nde ibeba i ntyɛ ipolimake.»<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Wambɔ la botindo bo balako baiko ba ngauko Yowane ahangelaki banto Nsango e Bɔlɔti. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Nko nde lolenge luuko mpe Yowane apɛlɛki Elode, oyalaki bonkondi nde etuka e Ngalilaya, itina ayobala Elodiade, waali oyalaki eboto ekinde, mpe la mpɔhɔ inkina ikelaki nde i bobe. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Elode aohangya lɔɔmɔɔ lobo lo bobe: aobuta Yowane mpe aobotika nde bɔlɔkɔ.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyunama eeki Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3, 13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mlk 1, 9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Anɛ ehilaki banto bankuma yunama, Yesu mpe aunamɛ. Elaka eyalaki nde nde lɔbɔndɔ, liko yolipwa <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />mpe Bolimo bo Bɔyɛngwa bobohulwelɛ lɔnsɛi embenga. Lyoi imɔɔ yokiɛ ima nde lobola: «Wɛ oyali bona okimi opendɛ emi yolanga; ibulwako ikimi inkuma iyali nko eka wɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɔlɔngɔ bo ba nkaa iiki Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 1:1-16">Mat 1, 1-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yesu akitaki la mbula ntute la ntuku ihato elaka ebangaki nde bohala bokinde. Banto bambookambakɛ ayali bona ooki Yosepu, Yosepu ɛnɛ e bona ooki Eliya, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Eliya bona ooki Mata, Mata bona ooki Lewi, Lewi bona ooki Mɛlɛki, Mɛlɛki bona ooki Yanai, Yanai bona ooki Yosepu, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Yosepu bona ooki Matatiasi, Matatiasi bona ooki Amosi, Amosi bona ooki Nahumu, Nahumu bona ooki Ehili, Ehili bona ooki Nangai, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Nangai bona ooki Maati, Maati bona ooki Matatiasi, bona ooki Nsɛmɛi, Nsɛmɛi bona ooki Ndjosɛkɛ, Ndjosɛkɛ bona ooki Yoda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Yoda bona ooki Yohana, Yohana bona ooki Lesa, Lesa bona ooki Yolobabɛlɛ, Yolobabɛlɛ bona ooki Salatiɛlɛ, Salatiɛlɛ bona ooki Neli, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neli bona ooki Mɛlɛki, Mɛlɛki bona ooki Adi, Adi bona ooki Kosama, Kosama bona ooki Elemada, Elemada bona ooki Ɛlɛ, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Ɛlɛ bona ooki Yesu, Yesu bona ooki Eliɛsɛlɛ, Eliɛsɛlɛ bona ooki Yolime, Yolime bona ooki Matati, Matati bona ooki Lewi <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Lewi bona ooki Simeyo, Simeyo bona ooki Yuda, Yuda bona ooki Yosepu, Yosepu bona ooki Yonami, Yonami bona ooki Eliakimi, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Eliakimi bona ooki Meleya, Meleya bona ooki Mena, Mena bona ooki Matata, Matata bona ooki Natana, Natana bona ooki Dawidi, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Dawidi bona ooki Yese, Yese bona ooki Obɛdɛ, Obɛdɛ bona ooki Boasi, Boasi, bona ooki Sala, Sala bona ooki Nasɔne, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nasɔne bona ooki Aminadaba, Aminadaba bona ooki Adimini, Adimini bona ooki Alini, Alini bona ooki Esɔlɔmɛ, Esɔlɔmɛ bona ooki Falɛsi, Falɛsi bona ooki Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yuda bona ooki Yakobo, Yakobo bona ooki Izaka, Isaka bona ooki Abalayama, Abalayama bona ooki Tela, Tela bona ooki Nahɔlɔ, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Nahɔlɔ bona ooki Seluku, Seluku bona ooki Langu, Langu bona ooki Falɛki, Falɛki bona ooki Ebɛlɛ, Ebɛlɛ bona ooki Sala, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Sala bona ooki Kaina, Kaina bona ooki Alafase, Alafase bona ooki Sɛmɛ, Sɛmɛ bona ooki Nowa, Nowa bona ooki Lamɛkɛ, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lamɛke bona ooki Matusalɛmɛ, Matusalɛmɛ bona ooki Ɛnɔki, Ɛnɔki bona ooki Yalɛtɛ, Yalɛtɛ bona ooki Malalaɛlɛ, Malalaɛlɛ bona ooki Kainame, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kainame bona ooki Ɛnɔsi, Ɛnɔsi bona ooki Sɛti, Sɛti bona ooki Adamo, Adamo, bona ooki Ndjakomba.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Satana aolengola Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat 4, 1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mlk 1, 12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yesu ahuma ndjale e Yɔlɔdani ebataki nde nguya eeki Bolimo bo Bɔyɛngwa. Bolimo botombɛ nde bokili bo bɛkɔngɔ. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Mpiko, satana abolengolɛ bɛkɔlɔ ntuku inɛi. Bɛkɔlɔ biiko benkuma, talɛ la yomba. Anɛ elekɛ bɛkɔlɔ bɛkɔ, aokɛ ndjala. <verse eid="LUK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Aiko ɛkɔ, satana abobelɛ: «Kaki oyali bona ooki Ndjakomba, bela ibɔkɔ inɛ ikalimwe ihɔɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yesu abuunoyelɛ: «Ɛkɔti nde Bonkanda bo Ndjakomba: “Bonto tangobika nko la byomba bi ndɛlɛ botoo.”»<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Lombuha luuko, satana abotombɛ nde ndye ɛmɔɔ e liko, abɔɛniɛ la mbala ɛmɔɔ bihe binkuma biyali la banto nde bokili <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />mpe abobelɛ: «Ngokopa bokopo bonkuma la lokutu loyali nde bihe biiko binkuma. Byomba biiko binkuma bampɛ emi, emi mpe ndjɔhɔ yopa bonto olanga emi mpa. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Nko bɔnkwɛlɛ wɛ bakulubɔngɔ, biiko binkuma biyɛ bikiɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesu abuunoyelɛ: «Bonkanda booki Ndjakomba botepela ngɔnɛ: “Ongokumya nko Nkolo Ndjakomba ekiɛ, mpe ɔngɔbɔbɔndɛlɛ nko nde kiika”.»<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Lombuha luuko, satana abɔkɔhɛ mpe aotombɛ Yelusalɛmɛ, abotikɛ nde liko i Tɛmpɛlo mpe aobelɛ: «Kaki oyali bona ooki Ndjakomba, yaboka ima anɛ tii nde nse; <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />ntina Bonkanda bo Ndjakomba botepela ngɔnɛ: “Ndjakomba angoopa betindo eka bentomwa bekinde bakobatele”. <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Mpe lenkina: “Bangookobila nde bɛbɔ bekibɔ kela lokolo lokiɛ talɔtɛke la ibɔkɔ imɔɔ.”» <verse eid="LUK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Yesu aobelɛ: «Bonkanda bo Ndjakomba botepela: “Tomekake yolengola Nkolo Ndjakomba ekiɛ.”» <verse eid="LUK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Anɛ eha satana aheya yolengola Yesu ndenge inkuma yɔhɔki nde, abohenyɛ tii nko buuna bo lohuo.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aobanga bohala bokinde Ngalilayi</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat 4, 12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mlk 1, 14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Yesu aunwɛ Ngalilaya, ayolɛ la nguya eeki Bolimo bo Bɔyɛngwa. Ahwebetana nde bihe biki etuka iiko enkuma. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Alakake nde betumba be lɔbɔndɔ beekibɔ mpe banto bankuma babokumya.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Banto ba Nazalɛti bootona Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 13:54-58">Mat 13, 54-58</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Yesu ayɛ Nazalɛti, ndye ɛnɛ yolwaki nde. Buuna bo sabata, aɔtwɛ nde botumba bo lɔbɔndɔ, nga wekehelɛ nde yokela. Aemalɛ kela atange Bonkanda bo Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Baopɛ buku eeki ntepeli Isaya. Alingolɛ lokaha mpe atɛ itɔkɔ nde ndye ɛkɔtɛ ibɔ ngɔnɛ:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />«Bolimo bo Nkolo boyali la emi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">itina andubolɛ mpe andɔtyɛ bontolo kela nsangele bɛmbɔlɔ Nsango e bɔlɔti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Antindɛ nsangele baatungi nde bɔlɔkɔ bangooyola,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">nsangele babolyɛ baiho bangooyunwa yɛnɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">banyokwa bangookita nsɔmi,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />ndjebye mbula enga Nkolo aokele banto ihɛi.»<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Nko aoheye, Yesu alingɛ lokaha lɔkɔ, aunoyelɛ bosali mpe atɛ itokiha. Banto bankuma baayalaki nde botumba bo lɔbɔndɔ baobolenda nko nde. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Nde mpe aobanga yobabela: «Iiko imba looke aiko, wambɔ lɔlɔkɔ ingokelamɛ itina ikinyo baandjoka.» <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Banto bankuma bahimɛ Yesu mpe baulɛ nko nkimo la mbo i bɔlɔti yola nde bonya bokinde mpe bayaubɔlɛ: «Ɔnɛ apa bɔna ooki Yosepu?» <verse eid="LUK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Ndjeba aiko lokontangela ekolongo ɛnɛ: “Nkanga, yabikyaka wɛ amɛlɛ”. Lokonsangela mpe: “Tookɛ nsango i mbo inkuma ikelɛ wɛ Kapalanaumu, kelaka ikɔ mpe anɛ eka wɛ.”» <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Aunwɛ yobabela: «Ndohangela nte nhɔhɔlɔ, nkola la ntepeli ɛmɔɔ ɛnɛ imeyɛ ibɔ ekabɔ. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Lolenda ndjolwebya nhɔhɔlɔ: nde eleko eeki Elia, bituka biyalaki buuke Isalaɛlɛ, anɛ eyalaki mbula ipunwe yɔlwa mbula ihato la sanza botoba mpe ndjala e bɔnɛnɛ yɔtwaki nde ehe. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Nkya ngauko, Ndjakomba tatinda Elia eka la ɔmɔɔ okibɔ, aobotinda nko eka etuka emboyalakɛ Salepeta, nde bokili bo Sido. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Lolenge lɔmɔɔ, banto ba behale bayalaki buuke Isalaɛlɛ elaka eeki ntepeli Eliseyo, lendaka nkola la ɔmɔɔ okibɔ ɔpɛtwamaki, nko Namana bohi Silia.»<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Banto bankuma nga boyalaki ibɔ nde botumba bo lɔbɔndɔ baokaki nkɛlɛ anɛ yokaki ibɔ ngauko. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Baemalaki, baotombi Yesu botale la ehe, nde liko i ngomba etongaki ibɔ Nazalɛtɛ, kela babolike nde nse. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Lendaka Yesu abapusumwɛ, atɛ ekande.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aoliɛ bolimo bo bobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mlk 1, 21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Nko aiko, Yesu atɛ Kapalanaumu, imonga imɔɔ i Ngalilaya, atɛ itolaka banto buuna bo sabata. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Banto bankuma nko byoli la yɛɛnɛ ndenge elaka nde, itina alaka la ipiki inkuma. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Mpiko nde botumba bo lɔbɔndɔ, eyalaki la bonto ɔmɔɔ oyalaki la bolimo bo bobe. Anɛ ɛnɛki nde Yesu, nde ɔnɛ oboba: <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />«Ah! lokinso la wɛ nnɔ Yesu e Nazalɛti? Omboye anɛ itina otolyake? Nkweba bɔlɔti: oyali bɔyɛngwa botindamɛ la Ndjakomba!» <verse eid="LUK 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yesu amamɛ la nguya enkuma bolimo bo bobe mpe abotamelɛ: «Lipa bonya bookiɛ mpe ola nde byonge biki bonto ɔnɛ!» Bolimo bo bobe akɔyɛ bonto uuko nde babu nde baiho baaki banto bankuma mpe aolɛ, nkobokela la lobo lɔmɔɔ lo bobe. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Banto bankuma nko byoli mpe bayaubolɛ: «Ɔnɛ botindo bo itepeli nnɔ? Bonto ɔnɛ atepeya belimo be bobe la ipiki inkuma mpe la nguya, mpe baola nde byonge biki banto!» <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Lokumu loki Yesu loho anga nde etuka iiko enkuma.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abikiɛ banto baayalaki la nkandi</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8, 14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mlk 1, 29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yesu aolɛ nde botumba bo lɔbɔndɔ, atɛ nde botumba booki Simo. Nyango e bokilo eeki Simo ayalaki la pɛpɛlɛ e nguya mpe babɔndɛlɛ Yesu akele bona o lobo itina ikinde. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Yesu ahunamɛ mpe ataamelɛ pɛpɛlɛ. Pɛpɛlɛ ebohilɛ, mpe la mbala ɛmɔɔ aemalɛ, nde nduuko aobapeka.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Anɛ eha ikɔlɔ ikita, baayalaki la banto ba nkandi ndenge inkuma babayelɛ eka Yesu. Ahangyɛ bonto la bonto bakata mpe ababikiɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Belimo be bobe byolɛ mpe eka buuke bo banto baayalaki la nkandi, byobobake: «Wɛ oyali Bona ooki Ndjakomba!» Yesu abamamɛ la nguya mpe abahukɛ batepele, itina ibo baebaki boyali nde Masiya.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu alaka nde betumba be lɔbɔndɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mat 4, 23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mlk 1, 35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Anɛ eha nkɛhɛ ɛkya, Yesu aolɛ, atɛ ndye ɛmɔɔ nko nde kiika. Buuke bo banto botilɛ; anɛ eha ibɔ babobata, balangaki atikale nko nde la ibɔ kela tatake looko lonkina. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Bɔlɔti nsangele Nsango e Bɔlɔti eeki Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba la nde bihe binkina, bantindaki itina iiki lobo luuko.» <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Ekɔiko etaki nde itolakaka nde betumba be lɔbɔndɔ beki etuka e Yudeya.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahweta bakɛndi laa nde ba ntondo</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4, 18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mlk 1, 16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 21:1-11">Yow 21, 1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Bɔɔmɔɔ buuna, Yesu ayalaki nde ibongo i ndeko e Yenesalɛtɛ, buuke bo banto bayalaki ntute la nde itina iiki baoke nsango e bɔlɔti eeki Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Aɛnɛki byato bepe nde ibongo; eyalaki byato beeki bahaki bahulwaki kela baɔhɔle bɛtɛi beekibɔ. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Yesu akondelɛ nde waato bɔmɔɔ. Eyalaki waato booki Simo, mpe abobelɛ ayaundje bona o botale la ibongo. Akihɛ nde waato mpe abangɛ yolaka banto.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Anɛ eheyaki nde yolaka, abelɛ Simo: «Indja waato looko lo bonino mpe lolika bɛtɛi bekinyo itina iiki lotungole nsi.» <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simo abuunoyelɛ: «Bolaki, tongohakɛ botyo bonkuma, tatobata yomba. Yaa nko aiko eha wɛ ombela, nkolika bɛtɛi.» <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Baunwɛ yolika bɛtɛi mpe batungɔlɛ nsi imɔɔ i buuke, bɛtɛi bekibɔ ntute la yatwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Ibɔ banɛ baetɛ baninga banɛ bayalaki nde wato bonkina baye yobabutya. Baninga bayɛ, mpe bayoyɛ byato beyape la nsi mpe byato beyɛ ndɛndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Anɛ e ɛnɛki Simo Petelo ngauko, akɔ bakulubɔngɔ ntondo eeki Yesu mpe nde ɔnɛ abobelɛ: «Nkolo, ima ntute la emi, itina emi ndjali bonto o bahumu.» <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />La Simo la ekambi enkuma eyalaki la nde bahoka bɔɔmɔ la yɛnɛ buuke bo nsi itungolaki ibɔ. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />La Yakɛ la Yowane, bana baaki Zebede, baninga baaki Simo baayalaki la nde baokɛ mpe bɔɔmɔ. Yesu nde ɔnɛ abelɛ Simo: «Tookake bɔɔmɔ; ima lɔlɔkɔ, ongotungolakɛ wante banto.» <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Nko aiko ibɔ banɛ baunoyɛ byato nde ibongo, bahenɛ byomba binkuma biyalaki la ibɔ, bayelɛ Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abikya bonto ɔkɔnɛ bohale</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 8:1-14">Mat 8, 1-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mlk 1, 40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Bɔɔmɔɔ buuna, Yesu ayalaki nde imɔɔ imɔnga, mpe bonto ɔmɔɔ ɔkɔnɛ bohale ayalaki aiko. Anɛ ɛnɛki nde Yesu, aɔkɔ bakulubongɔ mpe aɔbɔbɔndɛlɛ: «Nkolo, kaki olanga, ɔhɔ yɔmpɛtɔlɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yesu ahembolɛ lɔbɔ, abobutɛ mpe aobelɛ: «Ndanga, pɛtwa.» La mbala ɛmɔɔ, nkandi ehilɛ. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Yesu nde ɔnɛ abokokomyɛ tahangelake la bonto ɔmɔɔ: «Kɛndɛ toyaɛnie eka nkanga eeki Ndjakomba mpe opa ikapo itina inga wɛ ɔpɛtwɛ, botindo bɔkɔtɔki Mose, kela banto baɛne onga wɛ obikɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Lokumo looki Yesu loopenda yoanga; banto buuke bayɛɛ bayake yoka balako baakinde mpe yobika nde nkandi ikibɔ. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Nga la nde, ayɛɛ atake nko nde kiika ndye ipa la banto itɔbɔndɛlɛ.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aobikya entumbe</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mlk 2, 1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Buuna bɔmɔɔ boyalaki nde yopa balako, la bafalisaya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Banɛ beeta ibɔ bafalisaya, bayali banto baambɔ kɔkɔmɔkɛ la bobeko booki Mose mpe baambo ɛnɛke bapenda la imɛmɔ iki bɔkɔ. Banɛ bankina bapangano. </char></note> la balaki ba bobeko bayalaki aiko; baumaki ima bihe binkuma biki Ngalilaya la biki Yudeya tii Yelusalɛmɛ. Nguya eeki Nkolo eyalaki la nde itina iiki abikyake banto. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Nko aiko ɛkɔ, banto bayaki yobilaka entumbe ɛmɔɔ nde bobanga; batilaki babɔtɛye nde botumba mpe babohuloye ndye eyalaki Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Tabata epohe yɔbɔtɛyɛ itina banto bapendaki buuke. Ibɔ banɛ bayobokondeyaka nde nsamba, baotondola itundu mpe baohuloya bobanga nde boloyi bo banto, ntondo eeki Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Anɛ ɛnɛki Yesu nyumeya ekibɔ, aobela bɔkɔni: «Bahumu bakiɛ bangolibwɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Anɛ yokaki bafalisaya la balaki ba bobeko ngauko, baokanena: «Ɔkɔ bonto otola Ndjakomba nnɔ? Oki nnɔ ɔhɔ yolibola bahumu kaki teyali Ndjakomba nde kiika?» <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Nga boebaki Yesu botindo bo bikaneno biikibɔ, aobaubola: «Itina iyali nyo la bikaneno bi ngauko nnɔ? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Lobo loopa taloyali la lyale nnɔ? Yohanga: “bahumu bakiɛ bangolibwɛ” la mpe yohanga: “Emala mpe kɛndɛ”? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Lolendaka, ndanga lwebe mbɔ Bona ooki Bonto ayali anɛ nde bokili la nguya yolibola bahumu» , nde ɔnɛ aobela entumbe: «Nkobela, emala, kɔhɔ bobanga bookiɛ mpe inwa eka wɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />La mbala ɛmɔɔ, bonto uuko alangwɛ, aambolɛ bobongo bobetamaki nde mpe aunwɛ ekande mpe atɛ itokumyaka Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Banto bankuma bayalaki baitɛ byoli. Bakumyɛ Ndjakomba, bɔɔmɔ bobabutɛ mpe baototepele: «Lɔlɔkɔ tɔngwɛnɛ biɛnywa!»<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahweta Lewi akite bɔkɛndi la nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9, 9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mlk 2, 13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Mbuha eeki aiko, Yesu aolɛ mpe aɛnɛ botaakoli bo mputi bɔmɔɔ, lina ikinde Lewi, akihi nde ndye eputyaka ibɔ mputi. Yesu aobelɛ: «Ondjele.» <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Lewi aemalɛ, ahenɛ binkuma biyalaki la nde mpe aoyelɛ. <verse eid="LUK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Nko aiko, Lewi atɛ itokelela Yesu ekola e ilambo ekande nde botumba; buuke bo bataakoli ba mputi la banto bankina bayalaki la ibɔ nde ilambo iiko. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Bafalisaya la balaki ba bobeko baayalaka la ibɔ lwɛmbɛ lɔmɔɔ baokɛ bobe; ibɔ banɛ bahangelɛ bakɛndi la Yesu: «Itina nnɔ ilɛ nyo mpe imɛlɛ nyo la bataakoli ba mputi la banto baiko bankina ba bahumu?» <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Banto baapa tabayali la nkandi bapoyalake la mpoha la nkanga, nko banto baakɔnɔ bayalaka la mpoha laa nde. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Emi ntiya yotila banto ba bɔlɔti, ndjaki yotila banto banɛ ba bahumu kela baɔhɔle betema.»<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yokila byomba</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 9:14-15">Mat 9, 14-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-20">Mlk 2, 18-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Nko ibɔ banɛ baobohangela: «Banto bakɛndɛ la Yowane la banɛ baakinso bakilake byomba mbala la mbala; banɛ baakiɛ, bokibɔ bohala nko yɔlɛkɛ la yɔmɛlɛkɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yesu aobabela: «Nyo nko lokihya banto baambwete ibɔ nde ntɛkɔ e ibala ndjala elaka iiko eyali ibɔ la mbali? La bonwema poo. <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Yaa, buuna bongoyale mbɔ mbali tayali lenkina la ibɔ, aiko bangoolala ndjala.»<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Byomba bii kala la bii ntɛmu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 9:16-17">Mat 9, 16-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:21-22">Mlk 2, 21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yesu nde ɔnɛ obapa mpe lwɛlya lɔnɛ: «Bapwatolake etate e ehenda e ntɛmu kela baɔhɔle ehenda e kala; kaki okela ngauko, aiko opita ehenda ɛnɛ e ntɛmu mpe etate e ehenda ɛnɛ e ntɛmu tengoyakɔhɔ la ɛnɛ e kala. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Bapotikake baana ba bɔntɔngu nde ekutu e kala, baana ba bɔntɔngu baobola ekutu e kala: bana baoyutumwa mpe ekutu yobolya. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Batikake baana ba bɔntɔngu nko nde bikutu bi ntɛmu. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Bonto ɔhɔmɛlɛ baana ba kala apuunwake yolanga ahangye banɛ ba bɔntɔngu. Ɛkɔiko ehangaka ibɔ: “Baana ba kala balekola bɔlɔti.”»<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu la sabata</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mlk 2, 23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Buuna bɔmɔɔ bo sabata, Yesu alekaki nde ngonda i bele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bele eyali mmuma (nga boyali bakɔngɔ) inɛ ikelaka ibɔ mampa.</char></note>. Bakɛndi la nde bayaki yonikaka mmuma, baomukolake nko nde bakata mpe baɔlɛke. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Bafalisaya bankina bayalaki aiko, baobaubola: «Itina ikela nyo mbo iihuka bobeko nde buuna bo sabata nnɔ?» <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yesu abainoyelɛ: «Talotanga iikelaki Dawidi buuna bookaki nde la bakɛndi laa nde ndjala? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Botindo bɔnɛ bɔɔtwaki nde nde botumba booki Ndjakomba, aɔkɔhɔ mampa ikapelaki banto Ndjakomba, aɔlɛ nde kiika mpe aopa la bakɛndi la nde, eke ngɔkɔ mampa iiko banto bankina tabaɛlɛmɛ bale ikɔ, iyalaki nko itina iiki nkanga iiki Ndjakomba ibɔ kiika» <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Nkamba ayunwa yobabela: «Bona ooki bonto ayali bonkondi booki sabata.»<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bonto oyalaki la bobuka nde lɔbɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12, 9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mlk 3, 1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Bonkina buuna bo sabata, Yesu aɔtwaki nde botumba bo lɔbɔndɔ mpe alakaki. Bonto ɔmɔɔ ayalaki aiko la bobuka nde lɔbɔ lo loome. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Balaki ba bobeko la bafalisaya bayalaki aiko. Baiho baakiibɔ nko nde Yesu itina baɛne nga akobikya bonto uuko buuna bo sabata, nkamba babopɔtye ikambo. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Yesu aebaki bikaneno bikiibɔ. Nde ɔnɛ aobela bonto oyali la bobuka: «Langwa mpe emala aiko ntondo eeki banto bankuma.» Bonto uuko alangwɛ mpe aemalɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Yesu nde ɔnɛ obabelɛ: «Ndanga nduubole kaki buuna bo sabata elongi yokela bɔlɔti la mpe yokela bobe, elongi yobikya bonto la mpe yobohenya abu?» <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Yesu abakɛ bonto ɔmɔɔ la ɔmɔɔ baiho, la lombuha abelɛ bonto ɔnɛ oyali la bobuka: «Hembola lɔbɔ lokiɛ.» Bonto ɔkɔ ahembolɛ lɔbɔ mpe lɔbɔ lohembwɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Balaki ba bobeko la bafalisaya baulwɛ la nkɛlɛ mpe bayaubolɛ lobo lɔhɔ ibɔ yokela Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aɔhɔlɔ benkɔmwa lyomu la bape</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10, 1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mlk 3, 13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Nko nde biina biiko, Yesu akondelɛ nde ngomba itɔbɔndɛlɛ mpe alekyɛ botyo lonkundu yɔbɔndɛlɛ Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Anɛ ɛhɔkya nkɛhɛ, aetɛ bakɛndi laa nde mpe ahɔlɛ lyomu la bape, abapɛ lina bɛnkɔmwa: <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Simo, ɔnɛ obekyaki nde Petelo, la Andele wakume okinde, Yakɛ la Yowane, Pilipo la Batɛlɛmi, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matayo la Toma, Yakɛ, bona ooki Alafe, la Simo, ɔmɔɔ oki banɛ batila epanda eeki Isalaɛlɛ, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yuda, bona ooki Yake, la Yudasi Isikaliɔtɛ, ɔnɛ ɔngɔtɛkɛ Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu alaka mpe abikya banto buuke</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 4:24-25">Mat 4, 24-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:7-11">Mlk 3, 7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yesu aohulwa ngomba nde la bɛnkomwa bekinde, baokita nde ndye ɛmɔɔ e palaa, eyalaki buuke bo bakɛndi laa nde, la mpe buuke bo banto baimɛ looko la looko: banto ba Yudeya, banto ba Yelusalɛmɛ, la banto ba ibu i bahi, looko lo Tilɛ la Sido. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Ibɔ bankuma bayaki nko yobooka mpe la yotila babike la nkandi iyalaki la ibɔ. Baayalaki la belimo be bobe mpe babikaki. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Bonto onkuma atilaki nko abute Yesu, itina nguya ɛmɔɔ yola nde byonge bikinde mpe ebabikya ibo bankuma.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛmɛngɔ la ihɛi</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat 5, 1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yesu nde ɔnɛ olenda bakɛndi laa nde mpe aobabela nde wambɔ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">«Ɛmɛngɔ laa nyo bɛmbɔlɔ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba boyali bookinyo.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Ɛmɛngɔ laa nyo baayali la ndjala aikekeko: longo kinda byomba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Ɛmɛngɔ laa nyo baalela aikekeko: lɔngɔyɔlɔ ntɔɔlɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />«Ɛmɛngɔ laa nyo kaki banto baluuna, kaki balotona, kaki balotoola mpe batepela bitepela tepela itina ikinyo, itina iiki Bona ooki bonto. <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Lohulaka nde buuna buuko mpe lobulwaka, itina boputo bookinyo bongoyala bɔnɛnɛ nde lobola. La bankaa ikibɔ banyɔkɔlɔki ntepeli nko ngauko.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Nyo banɛ bayali bekulaka, ihɛi laa nyo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:24">lohilɛ yobata boputo bookinyo.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Ihɛi laa nyo baayali la kuukuu la ngɛɛngɛɛ aikekeko:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">longowa la ndjala !</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Ihɛi laa nyo banɛ bɔɔlɔ aikekeko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">longokiha nde batale mpe longolela.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Ihɛi laa nyo kaki banto bankuma balototya, la ba ihe baakiibɔ bambookelake la ntepeli inɛ i boyanga nko botindo buuko.»<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lolangaka baayali laa nyo ilanga</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mat 5, 38-48</ref>. <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7, 12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />«Aiko mpe emi ndjolobela, nyo baandjoka: Lolangaka banto baayali la nyo ilanga; banto baalunaka, luakelaka bɔlɔti. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Banto baalolimya, lwatɔmɛyaka bekako, baalɔnyɔkɔlɔ, lɔbɔndɛlɛkɛ itina ikibɔ. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Mbɔɔkɔ bonto angokokulɛ lotaka nde itama imɔɔ, ɔwɛniaka inɛ inkina. Kaki angɔkɔpɔmɔlɛ kasaka, ohenaka akɔhe la ikakya. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Bonto onkuma ohokobondela yoomba, obopaaka, ɔngɔkɔpɔmɔlɛ yoomba ekyɛ, tobuubolake akounoyele. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Ndenge elanga nyo banto balokelele, nyo mpe lobakelelaka nko ngauko. <verse eid="LUK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />Kaki nyo lolangake nko banto baalolanga, yoomba e mpondo etila nyo lobate nnɔ? La banto ba bahumu balangake mpe banɛ balanga! <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Kaki nyo lokelake bɔlɔti nko banto balokela bɔlɔti, yoomba e mpondo etila nyo lobate nnɔ? La banto ba bahumu bakelake nko ngauko. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Kaki mpe nyo lɔhɔmbyake nko banɛ baɔhɔ yoluuta, yoomba e mpondo etila lobate nnɔ? La banto ba bahumu bahɔmbyake banto ba bahumu kela bangobaute botuya bobapaki ibɔ. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Nga la nyo, lolangaka banto bapololangake, lobakelaka bɔlɔti mpe lɔhɔmbyaka nkolila baluute. Aiko longobata boputo bɔnɛnɛ mpe longoyala bana baaki Ndjakomba ɛnɛ e lobola, nde oyali bɔlɔti la itina iiki banto bapobumeye la itina iiki banto ba bobe. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Nyo, lookelaka banto ihɛi nko nga bookelaka Ihe ekinyo banto ihɛi.»<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Talohambyake baninga</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mat 7, 1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />«Talohambyake banto, la nyo mpe Ndjakomba tangolohambya; talɔkɔyɔke baninga nde bakambo, Ndjakomba mpe tangɔlɔkɔyɔ; losabinyaka baninga, nyo mpe bangoolosabinya. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Lokapaka mpe bangoolokapela: bangooluutumoyela nde bihaka biikinyo babondo bamɔɔ ba buuke, baanyongyɛ ibɔ mpe bayolɛ nte mɛkɛ tii byomba biyutumwa. Lwɛli lootikela nyo baninga byomba, bangoolotikela la nyo kiika nko nde lwɛli lɔkɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yesu aobabela lenkina lwɛlya lɔnɛ: «Bonto obolyɛ baiho nko aolakya onkina obolyɛ la nde baiho ndjela? Tabangɔkɔ ibɔ bayaape nde ipoku? <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Bonto olaka ibɔ apolekake ɔnɛ olaka, yaa kaki babolakaki bɔlɔti, angookita nga bolaki bokinde. <verse eid="LUK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />Itina ilenda wɛ lopumbu nde liho iiki boninga nnɔ? Empulu e bote eyali nde liho ikiɛ ɔpwɛne? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Ndenge nnɔ ɔhɔ yohangela boninga okiɛ: “Ondile nyumole lopumbu luuko loyali nde liho ikiɛ”, wɛ bonto opwɛne bote boyali nde liho ikiɛ? Wɛ boyanga, imola laino bote boyali nde liho ikiɛ, kela uɛne bɔlɔti, nkamba uumole lopumbu loyali nde liho iiki boninga.»<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bote la mmuma ikinde</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mat 7, 16-20</ref>. <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12, 33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />«Bote bo bɔlɔti bopobotake mmuma i bobe, nko nga boyali mpe bote bo bobe tabongobota mmuma i bɔlɔti. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Bote la bote boebetanake la botindo bo mmuma ikinde: tonguba balala nde weenge mpe tongotana nyanga nde bokungu. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Bonto o bɔlɔti aumyake bɔlɔti nde mbo i bɔlɔti ibombi nde botema bokinde, bonto ɔnɛ o bobe aimyake bobe bokinde nde inɛ i bobe ibombi nde botema bokinde. Itina bonya booki bonto boolyake nko baoyi baayolɛ nde botema bokinde.»<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Botumba bootonga bonto o lyanya la bootonga etula</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat 7, 24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />«Londjetake Nkolo, Nkolo, yaa itina ipa lokelake ilobela emi nnɔ? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Bonto onkuma oya eka emi, ɔnɛ ooka mbo itepela emi mpe okela ikɔ, ndjolohangela kaki aɛli la nnɔ. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Aɛli la bonto ɔnɛ otonga botumba: atimɔlɛ ekole e ipoku tii nde nse e babu kela botumba bobakeme nte nde babɔkɔ. Anɛ eyɛ mpela, bahi baaki botema bo bɔkɛli bakondelɛ tii nde ndye epiki botumba, yaa tabɔɔhɔ yɔkɔyɔ botumba, itina botumba botongamɛ bɔlɔti. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Yaa bonto onkuma ɔnɛ ooka mbo itepela emi mpe apokele ikɔ, aɛli la bonto ɔnɛ otongɛ botumba nko nde liko i bɔkɔngɔ nkobutya bitutu tii nde babɔkɔ. Anɛ ekondelɛ bahi ba mpela tii ndye eyali botumba, botumba bɔkɔɔ bongulu: bopitanɛ bonkuma.»<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aobikya bohali booki bonkondi bo bahola ba Loma</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat 8, 5-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:46-54">Yow 4, 46-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Anɛ eheyaki Yesu yopa balako baakinde ntondo eeki banto, atɛ Kapalanaumu. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Mpiko, bonkondi bɔmɔɔ bo bahola, bohi Loma, ayalaki la bohali bokinde bopendaki nde yolanga. Bohali bɔkɔ akɔnɔki nkandi, ihambi i iwa la lobiko. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Anɛ yokaki nde nsango eeki Yesu, bonkondi bo bahola atindɛ baome ba bihe baki Bayuda, batu yɔbɔbɔndɛlɛ aye yobikya bosali bokinde. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Anɛ ekitaki ibɔ eyalaki nde, baome ba bihe babɔndɛlɛ Yesu la botindo bonkuma: «Bonkondi bo bahola buuko ayali nsuki e bonto o bɔlɔti, ɛɛli nko obokambole, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />itina alangake Bayuda buuke, nde bonto ototongelaki botumba bo lɔbɔndɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Yesu nde ɔnɛ otaka nde la ibɔ. Bakitɛ nko ntute la botumba, bonkondi buuko bo bahola aunwɛ yotinda baninga bankina kela babohangele: «Nkolo, toyatungyake. Emi wambɔ mpwɛli la yokwamba nde botumba bokimi; <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />ɛkɔikɔ epa ntiɔhɔ yoya emi kiika eyali wɛ; wɛ tepela nko lyoi imɔɔ, mpe bosali bokimi akoobika. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Lenda, la emi wambɔ ndjali nde lonse loki benkondi bempenda, ndjali mpe la bahola baayali nde lonse lokimi. Kaki ngobelɛ ɔmɔɔ: “Kɛndɛ”, akɔkɛndɛ, mpe ɔnɛ onkina: “Yaka”, akoya; mbɔ mpe nsangele bosali bokimi: “Kela ngɔnɛ”, akokela.» <verse eid="LUK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Anɛ yokaki Yesu ngauko, aohima bonkondi bo bahola buuko, aolenda banto baayaki yooyelaka mpe aobabela: «Ndobela, la boha nkɛndɛ anɛ Isalaɛlɛ, laino ntitani bonto oyali la nyumeya botindo bɔnɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Anɛ e inwaki baataki itweta Yesu nde botumba booki bonkondi bo bahola, bataanɛ bosali bɔkɔ angobikɛ.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aobikya bona ooki etuka e Naimi owaaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />La lombuha luuko, Yesu ataki nde imonga imɔɔ i lina Naimi. Ayalaki nde la bakɛndi laa nde mpe la buuke bo banto. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Anɛ ekitaki nde ntute la bɔtwɛlo bo ehe, aɛnɛ baoli la bolyo nde ngelo: eyalaki ɛtɔi e loondo eeki etuka ɛmɔɔ. Banto buuke baaki ehe iiko bayalaki ibɔ la nde. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Anɛ ɛnɛki Nkolo etuka, abokelaki ihɛi mpe aobobela: «Tookolela.» <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Ayɛ ntute mpe abutɛ ibaya. Banto baayaki yobilaka ibaya baemalɛ. Yesu aotepela: «Bona o eboha, nkobela, emwa!» <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Bonto owaki aokihi mpe aotepela. Mpe Yesu aobounoyela nyango ekinde. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Banto bankuma bohoka bɔɔmɔ, baokumya Ndjakomba mpe baotepela: «Ntepeli ɛmɔɔ e bɔnɛnɛ angoolɛ eka nso !» mpe: «Ndjakomba angoyɛ yobikya banto baakinde.» <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Nsango iiko eki Yesu etyangwɛ nde etuka e Yudeya lonkundu mpe nde bihe biiko bi ntute.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yowane atindɛ banto eka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mat 11, 2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Bakɛndi la Yowane babohangelɛ mbo iiko inkuma. Yowane aetɛ bakɛndi laa nde bape <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />mpe abatindɛ eka Nkolo baboubole: «Wɛ oyali Bonto ɔnɛ oye laa mpe tolile bonto onkina?» <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Anɛ ekitaki ibɔ eka Yesu, baobohangela: «Yowane Buuni amboototinde eka wɛ tokuubole: “Wɛ oyali ɔnɛ ooye laa mpe tolile bonto onkina?”» <verse eid="LUK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Nko nde elaka iiko, Yesu abikya buuke bo banto baayalaki la nkandi, la batungya, la belimo be bobe mpe alipola baiho baaki bapwɛne. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Nko aobela bakɛndi la Yowane: «Talohangele Yowane bakambo baamba nyo lwɛne la baamba looke: banto babolyɛ baiho baɛnɛ, bɛlɛmɛ bakɛndɛ bɔlɔti, baayali la behale bapɛtwa, bikinda baoka, baawɛ bakundwa, bɛmbɔlɔ baoka Nsango e bɔlɔti, <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />ɛmɛngɔ eka banto baapa tangobungya nyumeya ekibɔ itina ikimi.»<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Anɛ eha banto banɛ baumaki eka Yowane baunwa, Yesu nde ɔnɛ otepela la banto baayalaki aiko itina ikinde: «Lotaki yolenda nde bokili bo bɛkɔngɔ nnɔ? Ibundja inyonga la bɔmpɛmpɛ? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Lotaki yolenda mpendja nnɔ? Bonto ɔmɔɔ angɔlɔɔtɛ bihenda bi botuya? Banto baalɔtɔkɔ bihenda bi botuya mpe baayali la ikulaka bakihake nde betumba beeki nkumu. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Yaa nyo lotaki yolenda nnɔ? Ntepeli? Ɔnde, ndobela, nde apenda la ntepeli. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Nkɔti itepela itina ikinde ngɔnɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">“Ngotinda bontomwa bokimi lontondo lokiɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">angotu yɔbɔngya ndjela lontondo lokiɛ ”.»<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />«Ndobela: nde banto baabotaki bainto, teyali la openda Yowane la bɔnɛnɛ. Yaa bonto openda bɔkɛ nde Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba abopenda nde la bɔnɛnɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Banto bankuma baaya yoboka, eyale la bataakoli ba mputi, baɛnɛ bosembo booki Ndjakomba mpe bayɛ yɔkɔhɔ buuni booki Yowane. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Nko bafalisaya la balaki ba bobeko, ibɔ tabalanga yoomba elangaki Ndjakomba abakelele mpe bayotona bauname eka Yowane.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yesu nde ɔnɛ oyuubola: «Banto baaki ekeke ɛnɛ e lɔlɔkɔ, bayali nga ba nnɔ? Baɛli la ba nnɔ? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Bayali nga bana baakihi nde bongala mpe bayalika beendo: “Tolokulelaki bokwaha, talolanga lwembe nsambo! Twembaki nyembo i bahɛi, talolela.” <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Itina Yowane Buuni ayaki, apɔle la mampa, apɔmɛle baana, mpe nyo lohangaki: “Ɔnɛ ayɛɛ la bolimo bo bobe.” <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Bona ooki bonto mpe aoya, alɛ la banto mpe amɛlɛ, nyo baiko lohanga: “Enda nde mpendja la bɔmɛlɛlo, boninga ooki bataakoli ba mputi la banto ba bahumu.” <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Ɔmwɛnɛkɛ ngauko, waanya booki Ndjakomba boyali semba eka banto bankuma baboumeya.»<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu eka bofalisayi Simo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Bofalisaya bɔmɔɔ aetaki Yesu atu itɔlɛ ekande. Yesu nde ɔnɛ otaka ekande ko baobanga yɔɔlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Buunto ɔmɔɔ o bahumu ayake nde imonga iiko. Anɛ yokaki nde Yesu angotɛ itɔlɛ eka bofalisaya buuko, ayɛɛ la bolangi bɔmɔɔ bo bɔlɔti boyoli la balahi, <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />aokihi la lombuha lo bekolo beki Yesu. Aobanga yolela, aɔbɔbya bekolo beki Yesu la biihɔni bekinde; nkamba abiɔndɔlɔke la bayo baakinde, aobelinga ekɔpi mpe aobeutumola balahi. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Anɛ ɛɛnɛki bofalisaya bɔnɛ boetaki Yesu ngauko, aoyahangela nde kiika: «Bonto ɔnɛ apoyala mpendja ntepeli, ntiki angwebɛ buunto uuko obobuti mpe oyali nde buunto o bahumu.» <verse eid="LUK 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yesu aobela bofalisaya: «Simo, ndjali la bona o lobo lo yokobela.» Simo aobuunoya: «Nkolo, tepela.» <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yesu nde wante: «Bonto ɔmɔɔ ayalaki la banto bape baayalaki la bembale bekinde. O ntondo ayalaki la mpata benkama betano, ɔnɛ o bape mpata ntuku itano. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Ibɔ bayaape nko ɔnɛ ɔhɔki yoputa bombale. Nde mpe aobabela tababokoputa lenkina bembale biiko. Nde ibɔ bayaape, okopenda yolanga bonto uuko nnɔ?» <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simo ayunoya: «Nkamba ɔnɛ oliboyaki ibɔ bombale bopenda bɔnɛnɛ.» Yesu aobela Simo: «Ongotepele bɔlɔti.»<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Yesu nde ɔnɛ olenda buunto mpe aobela Simo: «Ɔngwɛnɛ buunto ɔnɛ? Enda, emi ngɔtwɛ nde botumba bokiɛ, wɛ tompa bahi ndjakole nkya bekolo; endaka buunto ɔnɛ angokolɛ bekolo beekimi la biihɔni bekinde mpe angɔbyɔndɔlɛ la bayo baakinde. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Wɛ tompa bobekolo bo lokumu; yaa nde, ima nko ɛmbɔtwe nde anɛ, angolingɛ bekolo beekimi ɛkɔpi yompa bobekolo bo imɛmɔ. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Wɛ tompa bohuku bo mpimbo ndjahinge nde byonge; yaa nde, angondjutumolɛ balahi bamɔɔ ba botuya nde bekolo beekimi! <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Endaka emi ndjokobela: kaki buuke bo bahumu baakinde bangolibwɛ, itina wambɔ angwɛniɛ lolango lopenda. Bonto ongolibolɛ ibɔ bahumu bɔkɛ, aɛniake nko lolango lonkɛnkɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Nde ɔnɛ mpe ohangela buunto uuko: «Bahumu bakiɛ bangolibwɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Baalɛki laa nde, bonto la bonto aoyaubola: «Bonto ɔnɛ ayali mpendja nnɔ, nde ɔnɛ okita tii yolibola bahumu?» <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Nkamba Yesu aobela buunto uuko: «Nyumeya ekiɛ engokobikyɛ. Kendɛ bɔlɔti.»<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Bainto bambooyelakɛ Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />La lombuha luuko, Yesu ataki itɔkɛndɛkɛ nde bamonga la bihe; aolake mpe aoyebye Nsango e Bɔlɔti eeki Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba. Ataki itɔkɛndɛkɛ nde la bɛnkɔmwa bekinde lyomu la bepe, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />la mpe bainto baamɔɔ babikyaki nde la belimo be bobe mpe la nkandi: Balia, banɛ baetaka ibɔ Balia ba Bangandala, ɔnɛ o umolaki ibɔ belimo be bobe nsambo, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Yaane, waali ooki Kuza, bosali bolenda byomba biiki Elode, la Suzana la buuke bo bainto bankina baambookambolake Yesu la bakɛndi laa nde la byomba bikibɔ.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwɛlya looki booni</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13, 1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mlk 4, 1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Banto bauma bamonga bankuma mpe baya eka Yesu. Aiko eyalaki boloy bo bɔnɛnɛ, Yesu aopa lwɛlya lɔnɛ: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />«Booni bɔmɔɔ ataki itolikaka byopo nde ngonda ekinde. Aiko yolike nde, byopo benkina bɛkɔɔ nde ndjela; banto banyatɛ bɛkɔ mpe mpulu baheyɛ yɔɔlɛ bɛkɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Byopo benkina bɛkɔɔ nde ndye e babɔkɔ: byopo bɛmɛnɛ mpe tabɛtɛmɛ yoma, itina babu tabayala la bahi. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Byopo benkina bɛkɔɔ nde ndye e nsɛndɛ. Byɔbɛlɛ byolwɛ bɔlɔngɔ la nsɛndɛ mpe nsɛndɛ iminyɛ byɔbɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Byopo benkina bɛkɔɔ nde babu ba bɔlɔti; byɔbɛlɛ byolwɛ bɔlɔti mpe bebotɛ, bɔɔbɛlɛ bɔmɔɔ la bɔmɔɔ bobotɛ mmuma bonkama.» Yesu aohangya: «Bonto oyali la batoyi ba yoka, aoke.»<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Itina Itepela Yesu nde ndjɛlya</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13, 10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mlk 4, 10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Bakɛndi la nde babuubolɛ kaki lwɛlya luuko lolimbola nnɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Aobabela: «Nyo, balopɛ lyanya i iyeba babomba baaki Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba; nga la bankina, ibɔ baokake nko nde ndjɛlya, kela “balendake nkwɛnɛ, baokake nkobuteya itina”.»<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndimbo eeki lwɛlya</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13, 18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mlk 4, 13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />«Lookaka ndimbo eeki lwɛlya luuko: boopo, wambɔ Lyoi iiki Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Banto baayali nde bokili bo ndjela, wambɔ banɛ baoka, anɛ eha bolengoli aya, ahumola Lyoi nde betema bekibɔ, tabaoyamba Lyoi babike. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Banto bankina bayali nga babu banɛ bayolɛ la babɔkɔ: baokake Lyoi mpe baambake iikɔ la bosalangano. Yaa nko Lyoi ipobate belubo, ɛkɔiko baambake nko bonwema, mpe nko la bɔkɛkɛ baotona kaki bolengoli booya. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Boopo bɔɔkɔ nde babu baayali la nsɛndɛ, wambɔ banto banɛ baoka Lyoi, yaa nko lyale iiki bokili, byomba la mpoha e bokili ebabutɛ nde ndjela, ɛkɔikɔ bapokite yobota mmuma inɛ yɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Boopo bɔɔkɔ nde babu ba bɔlɔti elakya banto banɛ baoka Lyoi mpe baobomba nde botema bo bɔlɔti mpe bo ipiki, ibɔ babombake mbo mpe babotake mmuma la itingɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwɛlya lo moinda</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mlk 4, 21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />«Bapɔpɛtyake moinda kela babombe nde mpoke la mpe nde nse e ntange; baemyake nde ikondi kela banto banɛ baɔtwa nde botumba baɛne. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Itina nkola la yoomba ɛmɔɔ ebombi engoyala nko ola nde boponga, nkola la ɛmɔɔ iihi engoyala nko ebetana mpe nko ola nde bongala. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Nga la nyo, luumaka nkulupa lokite mbɛngɛlɛ nde inɛ yoka nyo. Itina bonto okati bangoobopa lenkina; opa tokati bangɔɔbɔpɔmɔlɔ la yoomba iiko ekamba nde akati.»<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyango la bahi botonga baaki Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Nyango eeki Yesu la bahi botonga baakinde bayɛ yobotilaka, yaa nko tababata epoha e yokita tii ndye eyalaki nde itina boloy boyalaki bɔnɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Baobobela ngɔnɛ: «Nyango ekiɛ la bahi botonga baakiɛ bayali aiko nde bongala, balanga bakwɛne.» <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Yesu aobela baayalaki aiko: «Nyango ekimi la bahibotonga baakimi, eyali banto banɛ baoka Lyoi iiki Ndjakomba ko baahalela ikɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Bɔɔmɔɔ buuna, Yesu akondelɛ nde waato nde la bakɛndi laa nde mpe ababelɛ: «Topendye loko loni lonkina lo ndeko.» Ibɔ banɛ batɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Aiko yoluke ibɔ, Yesu aɔngɔlɛ ilɔ. La mbala ɛmɔɔ, bonketi bɔmɔɔ bɔnɛnɛ bobaolelɛ nde ndeko; waato boyaki ibɔ booyoola la bahi, bayɛɛ nde ikuma nkɔlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Bakɛndi laa nde bayɛ ntute laa nde mpe baboemolɛ ibɔ baambɔ: «Bolaki, Bolaki, toowa!» Yesu aemwɛ, aangwelɛ bɔmpɛmpɛ la buula. La bɔmpɛmpɛ la buula beyahuloyɛ mpe ndeko enkuma ekitɛ way. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Nde ɔnɛ obabelɛ: «Nyumeya ekinyo eyali nko?» Bɔɔmɔ boobabuta, bakulɛ nko bakoto mpe bayahangelɛ: «Bonto ɔnɛ ayali mpendja nnɔ? Aangoya la bɛmpɛmpɛ la bahi mpe bebookela!»<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aleka belimo be bobe la nguya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Yesu la bakɛndi laa nde bakitɛ nde ibongo iiki bokili bo Ngelaza, ibu i mboka la Ngalilaya. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Anɛ ehulwa Yesu nde waato, bonto ɔmɔɔ oki imonga iiko ayɛ yoponana la nde. Bonto ɔkɔ ayalaki la belimo be bobe. Ima kala, tatindeya yɔlɔtɔ bihenda mpe apokihake nde botumba, nko nde baombo. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Anɛ ɛnɛki nde Yesu, aulɛ waandje mpe ayalikɛ nde bekolo bekinde, abobɛ la longuya: «Lokimi la wɛ nnɔ, Yesu, Bona ooki Ndjakomba ɛnɛ e lobola? Nkɔbɔndɛlɛ, tontungyake!» <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Atepela ngauko itina wambɔ Yesu atindaki bolimo bo bobe buuko aole nde byonge biki bonto uuko. Mbala la mbala aɔtwake nde byonge bikinde. Mpe ɔmbwɛnɛkɛ bangotungyɛ bɛlɔkɔ, apupolake nko mpupola mpe bolimo bo bobe bobotindake nko nde bipoka. <verse eid="LUK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesu abuubolɛ: «Lina ikiɛ nnɔ?» Abuunoyelɛ: «Botonga.» Itina belimo be bobe buuke bɛbɔtwɛlɛ nde byonge. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Belimo bɛkɔ be bobe bebɔbɔndɛlɛ tabatindake nde ipoku i lyale ipa la nsuki.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Ndye eyalaki ibɔ, botonga bɔmɔɔ bo ngulu boyaki yɔɔlɛ baɔmbi nde liko i ngomba. Belimo bɛkɔ be bobe bɛbɔndɛlɛ Yesu abapa ndjela batu yɔɔtwa nde ngulu iiko. Yesu abapɛ ndjela. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Belimo be bobe byolɛ nde bonto uuko, betɛ itɔɔtwa nde ngulu. La mbala ɛmɔɔ, botonga lonkundu boyabilingolɛ ima nde ngomba tii nde ndeko mpe boninɛ nde ndeko. <verse eid="LUK 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Anɛ ɛnɛki baahɛnjɛlɛ ngulu ehanha iiko, bayabɛlɛ lobango mpe batɛ itohangelaka banto ikambo iiko nde imonga mpe nde bahala batuti aiko. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Banto bayɛ yolenda ilekaki aiko. Bakitɛ loko loyalaki Yesu. Bataanɛ bonto ɔnɛ ombolye ibɔ belimo be bobe akihi nde bekolo beki Yesu, alɔti bihenda mpe bolimo bo bonto bongobuunwɛ. Banto baokɛ bɔɔmɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Banto banɛ baɛnɛki mbo inkuma ilekaki bahangelɛ banɛ bayaki la mpe ndenge ebikaki bonto uuko oyalaki la belimo be bobe. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Ɛkɔiko banto bankuma baaki Ngelaza babelɛ Yesu aume eka ibɔ, itina baokɛ epapo e bɔɔmɔ. Yesu akondelɛ nde waato mpe ayaunoyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Bonto ɔnɛ oolyaki ibɔ belimo be bobe abɔndɛlɛ Yesu ayale la nde. Yesu talanga mpe abobelɛ: <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />«Inwa ekanyo mpe hangela banto inkuma ikelɛ Ndjakomba itina ikiɛ.» Bonto uuko aunwɛ ekabɔ, atɛ itɔlɔndɔlɔkɔ nde imonga lokundu bɔlɔti bonkuma bokelɛ Yesu itina ikinde.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aleka nkandi la iwa la nguya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Anɛ inwɛ Yesu, boloy bɔnɛnɛ boyɛ yowamba, itina babolilaki. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Loondo lɔmɔɔ ayɛ, lina ikinde Yailo, ayalaki bonkondi bo botumba bo lɔbɔndɔ. Ayakɔyɛ nde bekolo beki Yesu la yɔbɔndɛlɛ atu nde botumba bokinde, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />itina mbɔ bona okinde o buunto nko ɔkɔ ɔmɔɔ, okitaki la mbula ntute la lyomu la ipe alangaki awu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Aiko etaki Yesu mpiko, banto buuke bayaki yoboyelaka, mpe yobotikaka mpika. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Nde banto baiko, eyalaki la buunto ɔmɔɔ ɔkɔnɛ nkandi yotanga bakila, akelɛ la ɛkɔ mbula lyomu la ipe. Aheyɛ lokutu lokinde eka benganga mpe nkola la ɔmɔɔ ɔɔhɔki yobobikya. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Ayaindjɛ nde lombuha loki Yesu, abobutɛ nde lolemba lo ehenda, mpe la mbala ɛmɔ, bakila batenɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yesu aubolɛ: «Ombombute nnɔ?» Nga opa la bonto ɔmɔɔ taumeya, Petelo abobelɛ: «Bolaki, uuko wambɔ boloy bongokolingɛ bokotika mpika.» <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Yesu aunoyɛ: «Bonto ɔmɔɔ amboombute. Ngɔɔkɛ nguya ɛmɔɔ engondjolɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Anɛ ɛnɛki buunto uuko bangowebɛ, ayɛɛ yotutumaka yoyakɔyɔ nde bekolo beki Yesu. Alɔndɔlɛ nde baiho ba banto bankuma itina ibutaki nde Yesu mpe ndenge ebikaki nde la mbala ɛmɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yesu nde ɔnɛ obohangelɛ: «Eboha e buunto, nyumeya ekiɛ engokobikyɛ. Kɛndɛ bɔlɔti.»<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Nko atepela, bonto ɔmɔɔ aumɛ eka bonkondi bo botumba bo lɔbɔndɔ mpe abohangelɛ: «Bona okiɛ o buunto angowɛ. Tunwake yotungya Bolaki.» <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Yesu aokaki ndenge etepela ibɔ, aohangela Yailo: «Tookake bɔɔmɔ, yala nko la nyumeya, mpe bona akoobika.» <verse eid="LUK 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Anɛ ekitaki ibɔ nde botumba booki Yailo, akɔhɛ nko Petelo, Yowane la Yakɛ, la mpe ihe la nyango eki bona baɔtwɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Banto bankuma balelaki mpe bayalaki la ihɛi itina iiki bona. Yesu abelɛ: «Lwambya yolela, bona tawei, alali nko ilɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Banto baɔlɛ Yesu nko ntɔɔlɔ, itina ibɔ baeba mbɔ bona angohilɛ yowa. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Yaa Yesu abutɛ bona nde lɔbɔ mpe aboetɛ la lyoi i boolo: «Eboha e buunto, emwa!» <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Bona loyomo luunwɛ mpe la mbala ɛmɔɔ aemalɛ. Yesu ababelɛ babopaa byomba bi ndɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Ihe la nyango eki bona uuko o buunto baɛnɛ byɛnywa; nkamba Yesu aobakokomya tabahangelake la bonto ɔmɔɔ ikambo iiko yoyume yokelama.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Lotomo looki bentomwa lyomu la bepe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yesu aetɛ bɛnkɔmwa bekinde lyomu la bepe, abapɛ nguya la bonkumu nde liko iiki belimo be bobe la mpe nguya yobikya banto la nkandi. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Abatindɛ bahangele Nsango e Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba mpe babikye banto bayali la nkandi. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Ababelɛ ngɔnɛ: «Talɔkɔhɔke la yoomba ɛmɔɔ itina iki lɔkɛndɔ: bontuma nkola, mango nkola, mpaki nkola, bɔhɔlɔ mpe nkola; bonto ɔmɔɔ takɔhɔke bihenda bipe. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Lokihaka nko nde botumba boonga balwambe, tii nko enga nyo lohenye ndye iko. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Kaki banto bangotonɛ yolwamba, loolaka nde imonga iiko, lopupola la buutu bokibɔ nde bekolo bekinyo: engoyala lolambo itina iiki ibɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Ibɔ banɛ bayotaka, baolekake nde ehe ɛmɔɔ la ɛmɔɔ yohangelaka Nsango e Bɔlɔti la mpe yobikyaka banto baayali la nkandi nde bihe binkuma.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Itungya iiki Elode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Nkumu Elode aokɛ bakambo bankuma baleka mpe ayatungyɛ buuke, itina banto baamɔɔ bahangɛ mbɔ Yowane akundwɛ, <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />bankina bahangɛ mbɔ Elia ayɛ, bankina laino mbɔ ntepeli ɛmɔɔ e kala akundwɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Elode ayaubolɛ: «Yowane, emi bonto otindaki bopupole bɔtɛ. Yaa ɔkɔ ɔmɔɔ wa emi ndjoka batepela mbo iko inkuma nnɔ?» Nde uuko otila aɛne Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aolehya banto nkoto itano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Anɛ inwaki bɛnkɔmwa beki Yesu, bayɛ yɔbɔkɔtɛlɛ wamba nde ikelaki ibɔ. Yesu abakohɛ mpe abatombɛ nde ekele looko lo imonga inɛ yeta ibɔ Besaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Anɛ yokaki banto ngauko, baoyelɛ. Yesu abaambɛ, abalakɛ itina iiki Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba mpe abikiɛ baayalaki la mpoha babike. <verse eid="LUK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Anɛ eha ikɔlɔ ilinga, bɛnkɔmwa lyomu la bepe bayɛ ntute la Yesu mpe babobelɛ: «Inoya banto baiko bankuma, batu itotilaka ndye yokiha nde bihe la bahala baayali ntute la anɛ, batu itotilaka la byomba bi ndɛlɛ, itina anɛ toyali nde ekele.» <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Lwapa nyo kiika byomba bi ndɛlɛ.» Babobutolɛ: «Toyali nko la mampa itano la nsi ipe. Mɔɔnde olanga totu yohomba byomba itina iiki banto bankuma ?» <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Banto baayalaki aiko, nko beele botoo, ntute la nkoto itano. Yesu abelɛ bakɛndi laa nde: «Lokihya banto bihoke bi ntuku itano ntuku itano.» <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Bakelɛ nko ngauko mpe babakihyɛ ibɔ bankuma. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Yesu akohɛ mampa ikɔ itano la nsi ikɔ ipe, aileyɛ baiho nde liko, abɔndɛlɛ lɔbɔndɔ lo bokako nde byomba bikɔ, apupolɛ bimpulu bimpulu mpe apɛɛ bakɛndi laa nde kela ibɔ bakapele banto. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Balɛ byomba lɛkɛ lɛkɛ mpe bakindɛ. Baambolɛ bimpulu bitikalaki, bayoyɛ bihaka lyomu la bipe bonkundu.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo ahanga Yesu ayali Kilito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Buuna bɔmɔɔ, Yesu ataki nde lɔbɔndɔ ndye ɛmɔɔ e mbombama. Bakɛndi la nde mpe bayalaki ibɔ la nde. Yesu abaubolɛ: «Banto bahangake emi ndjali nnɔ?» <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Babounoyelɛ: «Baamɔɔ bahangake wɛ Yowane Buuni, bankina wɛ Elia, bankina mpe bahanga wɛ oyali ntepeli ɛmɔɔ nde inɛ i kala angokundwɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Yesu abaubolɛ: «Yaa nyo, lohangake emi ndjali nnɔ?» Petelo aambolɛ: «Wɛ oyali Kilito eeki Ndjakomba.»<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahwebya iwa la nkundwa ekinde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Yesu abakokomyɛ la boolo tabahangelake la bonto ɔmɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Abalimboyɛ: «Bona ooki Bonto angɔɔyɛnɛ lyale i bɔnɛnɛ, bangoobotona la baome ba bihe, la nkanga i benkondi mpe la balaki ba bobeko, bangoobolyaka mpe nde bɔkɔlɔ bo behato, angookundwa.» <verse eid="LUK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Nkamba ahangelɛ banto bankuma: «Bonto olanga aye mbuha ekimi, ayatonaka nde kiika, abilaka ekulusu ekinde biina benkuma mpe andjelaka. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Itina bonto otila abikye lobiko lokinde angoolobungya; bonto ɔnɛ oumeya abungye lobiko lokinde itina ikimi, angoolobikya. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Intomba nnɔ ikobata bonto kaki atila akɔhe bokili lonkundu nko nde kiika mpe la mbuha ayundjwa nde kiika mpe aopita lobiko lokinde? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Bonto ondjoka la emi la baoyi bakimi nsɔni, Bona ooki Bonto angoobooka la nde nsɔni anɛ enga nde aunwe la nkɛmbɔ ekinde, la eeki Ihe ko la ɛnɛ eki bentomwa be bɔyɛngwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Ndobela nte nhɔnhɔlɔ, banto bankina bayali anɛ tabangowa nko ɛnɛ Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba.»<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aokengwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Bɛkɔlɔ nga mwambi mbuha yotepela ngauko, Yesu akohɛ Petelo, Yowane la Yakɛ, akondelɛ nde la ibɔ nde liko i ngomba itɔbɔndɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Aiko ebɔndɛlɛ nde, lɔbɔ loki elongi ekinde lokengwɛ mpe bihenda bikinde byɛlɛ mpɛmbɛ nga bokalyali. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Lendaka nko aiko ɛkɔ, banto bape bayɛ yoholola la nde: eyalaki Mose la Elia; <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />bangwɛlɛ la lwɛya looki Ndjakomba mpe batepela itina iiki etwelo ekiinde engokelame Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Aiko Petelo la ekambi ekinde bangokindɛ ilɔ. Anɛ eha baemwa, bahwɛnɛ lwɛya lonkuma loki Yesu la banto bape baayalaki ntute la nde. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Anɛ ya banto baiko bape bakapwa la Yesu, Petelo aohangelɛ: «Bolaki, eyali bɔlɔti toyale anɛ; totonge benganda behato: bɔmɔɔ itina ikyɛ, bɔmɔɔ itina iiki Mose, bɔmɔɔ itina iiki Elia.» Petelo wambɔ taeba la itina i lobo lotepela nde. <verse eid="LUK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Nko aiko etepela nde ngauko, ekola e itute iimɛ nde liko, iyɛ yobapema. Baokɛ bɔɔmɔɔ aiko yɔtwa ibɔ nde itute iiko. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Lyoi imɔɔ iimɛ mpiko nde itute ikɔ, ihangɛ: «Ɔnɛ ayali Bona okimi ɔhɔlɛ emi, lobookaka!» <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Aiko eha lyoi yokya, Yesu atikalɛ nko nde kiika. Bakɛndi la Yesu babombɛ ikambo ikɔ nko ibɔ banɛ bayalaki, tabahangela la bonto ɔmɔɔ, biina biiko, inkuma yɛnɛki ibɔ.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aobikya bɔna otungyamaki la bolimo bo bobe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Pukya, anɛ ehulwaki ibɔ nde ngomba, banto buuke bayɛ yoponanaka la Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Nde boloy buuko, bonto ɔmɔɔ abobɛ: «Bolaki, nkɔbɔndɛlɛ, ondendele bona onɛ okimi, bona nko ɔkɔ ɔmɔɔ oyali la emi. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Mbala la mbala, bolimo bɔmɔɔ bobotungyake. Nga boobobuta, bona aoboba la mbala ɛmɔ, aokatwa mpe aotanga nko bɛlɛlu. Bolimo bɔkɔ bopobohenake kwa mpe mbɔkɔ bomboobobute, bobohololake byonge! <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Mbɔndelɛ bakɛndi la wɛ baboolye, tabakondwa.» <verse eid="LUK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yesu nde ɔnɛ otepela: «Nyo elele e banto epa la nyumeya mpe e bahumu. Ngoyala lenkina la nyo bikeke binga mpe ngolumeya la bihɛlɛlo bye ngauko tii lainga?» Nkamba aobela ihe eeki bona: «Yaka la bona okiɛ anɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Nko bona aokite, bolimo bo bobe bɔbɔkɔyɛ nde nse mpe bobopukuhɛ la nguya mpendja. Yesu aangwelɛ bolimo buuko bo bobe, abikiɛ bona mpe abounoyelɛ ihe ekinde. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Banto bankuma nko byɔli la yɛnɛ bɔnɛnɛ booki Ndjakomba.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu ahwebya iwa ikinde mbala ɛnɛ e bape</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Nga boyalaki banto bankuma nko nkimo la yɛnɛ mbo inkuma ikela nde, Yesu abelɛ bakɛndi laa nde: <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />«Lookaka bɔlɔti iko yolohangela emi aikekeko: Bangookapa Bona ooki Bonto nde bɛbɔ beki banto.» <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Yaa nko ibɔ bapotingole mbo inɛ ibabela nde; bababombɛ batina baaki ikɔ tabaoyeba; ibɔ mpe baokɛ bɔɔmɔ yobuubola ikambo ikɔ.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ooleka bɔnɛnɛ nnɔ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Bakɛndi la nde bawɛ lɔmpɛnyɛ kela baebe oleka baninga. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yesu aebɛ bikaneno bikibɔ, akɔhɛ bona o nkɛnkɛ, aboemyɛ ntute la nde, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />mpe abahangelɛ: «Bonto ongwambɛ bɔna ɔnɛ nde lina ikimi, angonyambɛ emi kiika; mpe bonto ongonyambɛ, angwambɛ bonto onsokolaki; itina bonto openda bɔkɛ aiko eyali nyo, uuko wambɔ oyali bonto o bɔnɛnɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Opolotone ayali bonto okinyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Nko aikɛkɔ, Yowane nde ɔnɛ obobela: «Bolaki, twɛnɛki bonto ɔmɔɔ apandja belimo be bobe nde lina ikiɛ; mpe nso totilaki tobohuke, itina nde apoyali nde bɔlɔngɔ bokinso banto baakoyela.» <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Yesu abuunoyelɛ: «Talobohukake, itina bonto opolotone, ayali looko lɔmɔɔ la nyo.»<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ehe e Samalia yootona yamba Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Anɛ ekitaki elaka baumole Yesu nde bokili bɔnɛ, Yesu aangɛ atu nko ndjela e Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Atindɛ bentomwa lontondo looki nde. Bentomwa batɛ, baɔtwɛ nde ehe ɛmɔɔ eki ba Samalia kela batu itɔhɔlɔ eyeelo ekinde. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Banto baiko tabalanga baboambe, itina nko aoleke Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Anɛ ɛnɛki ibɔ ngauko, bakɛndi laa nde Yakɛ la Yowane bahangɛ: «Nkolo, olanga twete ntyɛ yuume nde liko kela lobatumbe?» <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Yesu abalendɛ mpe abapɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Nkamba ibɔ banɛ bayotaka nde ehe enkina.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baalanga bayele Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Nde ndjela, bonto ɔmɔɔ abelɛ Yesu: «Emi ngookoyela ndjoko inkuma inga wɛ otu.» <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesu abobelɛ: «Bebanga bayalake la bankunda ba yoyaiha mpe mpulu nde liko iyalake la baimbu; Bona ooki bonto, nde, apokati nkya la ndye yolalya bɔtɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 9:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Ahangelɛ bonto onkina: «Ondjeele.» Bonto uuko abuunoyelɛ: «Onhenye laino ntu itokunda ihe ekimi.» <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesu abobelɛ: «Hena baawɛ bakunde baakiibɔ baawɛ; nga la wɛ, kɛndɛ itwebya Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="LUK 9:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Bonto onkina abobelɛ: «Nkookoyeela, Nkolo, yaa onhenye ntu laino yoheha botonga bokimi.» <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesu abunoyelɛ: «Bonto ohobuta loongo mpe ayunwa yolenda lombuha, apwɛli la Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba.»<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Lotomo lotindaki Yesu Bakɛndi la nde ntuku nsambo la bape</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />La lombuha luuko, Nkolo ahɔlɛ bakɛndi laa nde ntuku nsambo la bape bankina mpe abatindɛ bapee la bapee balɔndye nde bamonga la bihɛ biinga nde kiika aleke. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Abahangelɛ: «Muma ingɔtɔɔ mpe ingwɛlɛ buuke nde ngonda, yaa basali bayali bɔkɛ. Lɔbɔndɛlɛkɛ bɔmɛlɛ ngonda atinde basali nde ngonda ekinde. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Lɔkɛndɛ! Lolenda emi nde ɔnɛ ongolotindɛ nga wɛnɛ nyo mpata eka nkɔy. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Talɔkɔhɔke bɔhɔlɔ, mango nkola, bikote nkola, taloyabekolake la banto nde ndjela. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Nde botumba bonkuma bɔngɔtwe nyo, lobangaka yobabela: “Bɔlɔti booki Ndjakomba boyale la nyo”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bɔlɔti boki Ndjakomba boyale la nyo eyali wambɔ yeeta wai eeki Nkolo eka banto baakinde. </char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Kaki bonto o bɔlɔti ayali aiko, bɔlɔti bookinyo bongoyala la nde; kaki tayali, bongolunwela nyo bamɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Lokihaka nko nde botumba buuko, lɔlɛkɛ, lɔmɛlɛkɛ binkuma bilopa ibɔ, itina bosali aɛli nko la boputo bokinde. Talumake nde botumba bɔmɔɔ lopendya nde bonkina. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Kaki lɔngɔtwɛ nde imonga imɔɔ mpe bangolwambɛ, lɔlɛkɛ byomba binga balopɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Lobikyaka banto ba nkandi baanga lotane mpiko, mpe lobahangelaka: “Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba bongolokitelɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Kaki lɔngɔtwɛ nde imonga mpe tabayolwamba, loolaka nde betalimbo mpe lohangaka: <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />“Tongopuupolɛ la buutu booki imonga ikinyo boongobakemɛ nde bekolo beekinso, kela toloheneye bɔkɔ. Yaa nyo lwebaka: Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba bongokitɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Ndohangela: Buuna buuko bo bɔntɛndi, etumbo engobata imonga iiko engoleka eeki Sodoma la boolo.<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bamonga baatonaki yuumeya</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mat 11, 20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />«Ihɛi ingoyala eka wɛ imonga i Kolazini! Ihɛi eka wɛ imonga i Besaida! Itina kaki biɛnywa binɛ bingokelamɛ anɛ eka nyo bikelamaki nde bamonga ba Tilɛ la Sido, ntiki ima kala, bamonga baiko babɔngyɛ bihɛlɛlo, balɔɔtɛ bahaki mpe bakihɛ nde betoko. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Ndohangela, nde buuna bo bɔntɛndi, etumbo ekinyo engopenda eeki Tilɛ la Sido. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Yaa wɛ, Kapalanaumu, okamba bangookokondeya nde liko? Po! Ongohulwa tii nde bokili booki baawɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Aunwɛ yohangela bakɛndi laa nde: «Bonto ongolookɛ angondjokɛ, ongolotonɛ, angontonɛ, mpe ongontonɛ, angotonɛ la bonto ɔnɛ onsokolaki.»<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inwelo eeki bakɛndi ntuku nsambo la bape</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Anɛ inwaki bakɛndi ntuku nsambo la bape, bayɛ la ibulwako baa mpe bahangɛ: «Nkolo, la belimo be bobe betookela kaki tobapa betindo nde lina ikiɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yesu abaunoyelɛ: «Nyɛnɛki bokakwa Satana ima nde liko nga bokalyali. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Lolenda: Emi ndopɛ nguya lonyate ndjɔ la nkoto, lopite nguya inkuma iiki banto bapololange, mpe la yoomba ɛmɔɔ tengolokela bobe. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Nkya ko ngauko, talohulake itina belimo be bobe belookela, lohulaka itina baina baakinyo bakɔtɔmɛ nde lobola.»<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibulwako iiki Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat 11, 25-27</ref>. <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13, 16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Nko nde elaka iiko, Yesu aokɛ ibulwako la nguya eeki Bolimo bo Bɔyɛngwa mpe ahangɛ: «Nkokumya, Papa, wɛ Nkolo eeki liko la nse, itina obombelɛ banto ba wanya la ba lyanya bakambo, mpe oebyɛ bakɔ eka balɛɛlɛngɛ. Ɔnde Papa, eyali nko ngauko ee wɛ mongo olangake eyale.»<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />«Ihe ekimi ampɛ byomba binkuma, mpe nko bonto ɔnɛ oeba Bona kaki teyali Ihe, mpe nko ɔnɛ oeba Ihe kaki teyali Bona la mpe bonto onga Bona alangɛ aebye.»<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Nkamba nde ɔnɛ oolenda bakɛndi laa nde mpe aobabela nko ibɔ kiika: «Ɛmɛngɔ la baiho banɛ baɛnɛ mbo iiko yɛnɛ nyo! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Itina, ndjolohangela, ntepeli buuke, nkumu buuke bayalaki la mpoha baɛne iiko yɛnɛ nyo mpe tabaɛnɛ ikɔ, balangaki baoke iiko yoka nyo mpe tabaoka ikɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwɛlya looki Bosamalia bo bɔlɔti</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mat 22, 34-40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:28-31">Mlk 12, 28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Bolaki booki bobeko bɔmɔɔ aemalɛ mpe aubolɛ Yesu itina iki yobolenga: «Bolaki, nkele ngamo itina iiki mbate lobiko lo botako?» <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesu abobelɛ: «Nde buku e bobeko bakɔtɛ nnɔ? Otangake mpiko ngamo?» <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Bolaki booki bobeko abunoyelɛ: «Olangaka Nkolo Ndjakomba ekiɛ, la botema bokiɛ bonkuma, la nguya ekiɛ enkuma mpe la bikaneno bikiɛ binkuma mpe la lyanya ikiɛ inkuma, olangaka mpe boninga okiɛ lolenge loyalanga wɛ mɛlɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yesu abuunoyelɛ: «Ongopɛ mbuto e bɔlɔti. Kela ngauko mpe ongobata lobiko.» <verse eid="LUK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Bolaki atilɛ abate elonga, aunwɛ yuubola Yesu: «Yaa oyali boninga okimi nnɔ?» <verse eid="LUK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesu abounoyelɛ: «Bonto ɔmɔɔ aumaki Yelusalɛmɛ, aoli Yeliko. Nde ndjela, aponanɛ la banto ba bobe, babɔpɔɔmɔlɛ byomba, babokulɛ lolii, mpe bakɛndɛ, babohenɛ ntute la iwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Nko nde elaka iko, nkanga ɛmɔɔ eki Ndjakomba ahulwaki nko nde ndjela iiko. Aɛnɛ bonto uuko, apendyɛ ibu i mboka mpe alekɛ ekande. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Bolewi bɔmɔɔ alekɛ la nde nko aiko. Aɛnɛ bonto uuko mpe alekɛ ekande. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Endaka, Bosamalia bɔmɔɔ oyalaki nde lɔkɛndɔ lokinde akitɛ mpe aiko eyalaki bonto uuko; aboɛnɛ mpe abookelɛ ihɛi. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Ayɛ ntute la nde, akolɛ mpota ikinde la vino, autumolɛ bohuku mpe akandɛ ikɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eka Bayuda, bambootutake mpota la vino mpe la bohuku.</char></note>. Akondeyɛ bonto uuko nde mpunda ekinde, abotombɛ nde botumba bo babutu mpe abotutɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Pukya, akɔhɛ mpata ipe apɛɛ bɔmɛlɛ botumba bo babutu mpe abobelɛ: “Tuta bonto ɔnɛ bɔlɔti; kaki ɔngɔkɛndyɛ bɔhɔlɔ bonkina nde liko, emi kiika ngokunoyela bɔkɔ anɛ enga emi nyunwe.” <verse eid="LUK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Nde banto baiko bahato, ɔnɛ wɛnɛ wɛ oyaɛniɛ boninga ooki bonto uuko okulamaki la banto ba bobe nnɔ?» <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Bolaki booki bobeko ahangɛ: «Eyali ɔnɛ obookelaki ihɛi.» Yesu abobelɛ: «Kɛndɛ, la wɛ mpe okele nko ngauko.»<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu eka Malata la Balia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Nko aiko eyalaki Yesu la bakɛndi nde boboko, Yesu aɔtwɛ nde ehe ɛmɔɔ mpe buunto ɔmɔɔ lina ikinde Malata aboambɛ nde botumba bokinde. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Balia, bohibotonga okinde, ayɛ yokiha ntute la Nkolo, aokake itepela nde. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Nga la Malata, ayapɛ la besala benkuma beki botumba. Ayɛ la lobango mpe abelɛ Yesu: «Nkolo, aiko oɛnɛ bɔlɔti ndenge enga bohibotonga okimi anseneyɛ besala? Bela nde aye yonsalya.» <verse eid="LUK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Nkolo abuunoyelɛ: «Malata, Malata, oyatungya mpe oyanyɔkɔlɔ la bakambo buuke. <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Eyali nko la ikambo imɔɔ iyali la itina. Balia bonto ɔngɔhɔlɛ ipenda bɔlɔti, mpe nkola la bonto ɔmɔɔ ɔngɔbɔpɔɔmɔlɔ ikɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu atepela itina iki lɔbɔndɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat 6, 9-13</ref>. <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7, 7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Bɔkɔlɔ bɔmɔɔ, Yesu ayalaki nde lɔbɔndɔ looko lɔmɔɔ. Anɛ eheyaki nde yɔbɔndɛlɛ, ɔmɔɔ oki bakɛndi laa nde aobelɛ: «Nkolo, otolake yɔbɔndɛlɛ nga bolakaki Yowane bakɛndi la nde.» <verse eid="LUK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Nga lɔbɔndɛlɛ, lotepelaka ngɔnɛ: Papa, banto baebe oyali Boyɛngwa, Bonkumu bokiɛ boye, <verse eid="LUK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />otopaka wengi buuna ilɛ yɛɛli la buuna buuko, <verse eid="LUK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />otolibole bahumu baakiinso itina nso kiika tolibolake baaki banto batokela bobe. Totohenyake tɔkɔ nde bolengoli.» <verse eid="LUK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Yesu aunwɛ yobabela: «Kaki ɔmɔɔ okinyo ayali la boninga mpe ayoli yootila la nginangina e botyo mpe aobobela: “Boninga la emi, ɔnsɔmbya mampa ihato, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />itina boninga ɔmɔɔ okimi ayali nde lɔkendɔ aoyume yonkitela mpe mpokati yoomba yobopa.” <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Mpe kaki boninga uuko oyali nde botumba aobobela: “Tontungyake! botumba bongolipamɛ; emi la bana tongolalɛ; mpɔɔhe yolangwa kela nkopa mampa.” <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Ndobela: la kaki talangwa itina i ininga ikibɔ kela aopa mampa iikɔ, akolangwa nko ndangwa kela aopa byomba binkuma biyali la nde mpoha itina boninga aopenda itungya. <verse eid="LUK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Ekɔiko emi ndjolobela: Lobondelaka, bangoolopa; lotilaka, longobata; lɔkɔkɔmɔkɔ ekuke, bangoololipoya. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Itina bonto onkuma obondela bopake, otila abatake, mpe ɔkɔkɔmɔ babolipolake. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Nga boyali nyo aiko, ihe lina nnɔ epɛɛ bona ikati<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nde buku bakɔtɛ ndjɔ, nga nyama e bobe mpe mbindo itina iiki yɔlɛ. Ekanso Ekonda, tɔlɛke ndjɔ. Ɛkɔiko etikɛ nso ikati nde ndye eeki ndjɔ itina ikati ayali nyama e bobe.</char></note> nga akana nsi? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />la mpe ɔnɛ opɛɛ bona nkoto nga akana bokele nnɔ? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Ɛkɔiko, kaki nyo baayali banto ba bobe, lweba yopa bana baakinyo byomba bi bɔlɔti, Ihe ekinyo eyali nde lobola tangopa Bolimo bo Bɔyɛngwa eka banɛ bobondela?»<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu bohangema booki Bezebule ?</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat 12, 22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22-27">Mlk 3, 22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Buuna bɔmɔɔ, Yesu apandjaki bolimo bo bobe bokityaki bonto luumi. Anɛ eha nde abopandja, bonto oyalaki luumi aobanga yotepela mpe banto bayuula nko nkimo. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Yaa nko baamɔɔ banto bayalaki aiko baohanga: «Nde apandja belimo be bobe la nguya eeki Bezebule, bonkondi booki belimo be bobe.» <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Bankina balangaki balenge Yesu baoboubola abaɛnie elembetelo mbo nde auma eka Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Yesu aebaki bikaneno bikibɔ, nde ɔnɛ oyobabeleka: «Bonkumu bonkuma boyakapolɛ bongotyangwa mpe betumba bɛngɔkɔ bɔmɔɔ la bɔmɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Kaki Satana aoyamunia, bonkumu bokinde bongoyemala ngamo? Itina nyo lohanga mbɔ emi mpandja belimo be bobe la nguya eeki Bezebule. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Yaa kaki emi mpandja belimo be bobe la nguya eeki Bezebule, aiko bakɛndi la nyo babapandja la nguya eeki nnɔ? Ibɔ kiika bangooyala ntɛndi ikinyo. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Kaki emi mpandja belimo be bobe la nguya eeki Ndjakomba, aiko wambɔ Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba bongolokitelɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Kaki bonto o nguya ahɛndjɛlɛ botumba bokinde la bakɔngɔ la ngwa ikinde, byomba bikinde bibombi bɔlɔti. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Yaa kaki bonto ɔnɛ obopenda nguya aoya yobomunia mpe aobolonga, aobɔpɔmɔlɔ bakɔngɔ la ngwa baamba nde atikelake botema, mpe lokutu loomba nde atane aokapa. <verse eid="LUK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Bonto opa toyali la emi looko lɔmɔɔ ayali bonto oontila la ikambo mpe bonto opohanganie la emi, ootyangola.»<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bainwelo baaki bolimo bo bobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mat 12, 43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />«Kaki bolimo bo bobe bohola nde byonge biki bonto, botolyaleke nde batungu baapa la yomba, yotilaka looko lɔɔhɔ nde yɔlya. Kaki bohwɛnɛ bopobate ndye yɔlya, bayabelɛ: “Bɔlɔti nyunwe nko nde botumba bokimi, bɔnɛ boyalaki emi.” <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Anɛ eha bolimo bo bobe buunwa, botana baɔmbɛ botumba mpe babɔngyɛ bɔlɔti. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Nde ɔnɛ otaka yɔkɔhɔ belimo benkina nsambo byopenda la bobe, bɛyɔtwa mpe byokihi mpiko. Byonge biki bonto uuko byoyunwa yokita bobe epapo, penda ndenge eyalaki ntondo.»<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɔmɛngɔ bo nhɔhɔlɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Nko atepela, buunto ɔmɔɔ auleyɛ lyoi nde ngina e banto baiko mpe abobelɛ: «Ɛmɛngɔ la nyango ekobotaki mpe ɛkɔlɔmyaki.» <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Yesu abekolɛ: «Ɛmɛngɔ ependa eka banto banɛ baoka Lyoi iiki Ndjakomba mpe bakela itinda Lyoi ikɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Banto batila Yesu abaɛnie mbo i mpapo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Banto buuke bayaki yoka Yesu, aobabela: «Ekeke ɛnɛ e lɔlɔkɔ eyali bobe. Baibola babaɛnie mbo i mpapo. Tabangwɛne mpapo enkina nko ɛnɛ ekelamelaki Yona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Itina, nko nga boyalaki Yona elembetelo eka banto ba Niniwe, Bona oki bonto angooyala mpe elembetelo eka ekeke ɛnɛ e lɔlɔkɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Buuna bo bɔntɛndi, buunto oyalaki bonkondi booki Saba angoohamba nde la ekeke ɛnɛ e lɔlɔkɔ mpe angɔɔbɔkɔyɔ, itina nde aumaki nde nsuki eeki bokili yoka wanya booki Salɔmɔ. Lolendaka, bonto oyali anɛ apenda Salomo kwali. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Buuna bo bɔntɛndi, banto ba Niniwe bangooyemala ibɔ la ekeke ɛnɛ e lɔlɔkɔ mpe bangoobɔkɔyɔ, itina ibɔ babɔngyaki bihɛlɛlo bikibɔ anɛ yokaki ibɔ ilako iiki Yona. Lolendaka, bonto oyali anɛ apenda Yona kwali.»<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Liho, lwɛya loki byonge</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5, 15</ref>. <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6, 22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />Yesu aunwɛ yobabela: «Bapopɛtyake moinda kela batike nde nongi e mbomama, batikake nde ikondi kela banto banɛ baɔtwa nde botumba baɛnɛ lwɛya.» <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />«Liho ikiɛ iyali moinda eeki byonge bikiɛ. Kaki baiho bakiɛ baɛnɛ bɔlɔti, byonge bikiɛ binkuma mpe biyali nde lwɛya. Yaa kaki liho ipwɛne bɔlɔti, la byonge bikiɛ mpe biyali nde buulima. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Ɛkɔiko, lenda bɔlɔti kaki lwɛya loki byonge bikiɛ taloyali buulima. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Kaki byonge bikiɛ binkuma biyali nde lwɛya, nkola la endjwa ɛmɔɔ nde buulima, bingoyala binkuma nde lwɛya nga ndenge ɛkwɛlya moinda la lwɛya lokinde.»<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahwemalela bafalisaya la balaki ba bobeko</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23, 1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mlk 12, 38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Nko Yesu atepela, bofalisaya bɔmɔɔ aboetɛ atu yɔɔlɛ ekande. Aɔtwɛ nde botumba mpe akihɛ nde mesa. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Bofalisaya aulɛ nkimo liyɛnɛ mbɔ Yesu takola bakata ntondo yɔlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Yesu abobelɛ: «Nyo bafalisaya, lokolake bakɔpɔ la saani nde bongala, yaa nde betema loyolɛ la iiba mpe la bobe. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Bitula! Lokamba uuko okelaki bongala takela la ntei? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Lopaka byomba biyali nde betema bekinyo, nkamba binkuma bingɔpɛtwa ekanyo.»<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />«Ihɛi la nyo bafalisaya, nyo baapaaka eteni e lyomu eeki nholo la batungulu la binkuma bitɔkɔ nde ngonda, yaa lwɛnɛke bosembo la lolango loki Ndjakomba nko itina. Lopokelaka lontondo bosembo la lolango nko bopela biiko bipaka nyo.»<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />«Ihɛi la nyo, bafalisaya, nyo baalangaka lokihe nde bikili bi ntondo nde betumba be lɔbɔndɔ, mpe lolangake banto balolikelake nsako nde beloy. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Ihɛi la nyo baayali nga bapoku ba banto baapa la ndembetelo mpe banto banyatake bakɔ itina bapwebe.»<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Bolaki booki bobeko bɔmɔɔ aobela Yesu: «Bolaki, aiko eya wɛ otepela ngauko, ototola la nso!» <verse eid="LUK 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesu nde ante: «La nyo mpe, balaki baaki bobeko, ihɛi la nyo, nyo babilyaka banto bekumba be bolito mpendja, mpe nyo kiika lɔpɔbɛnge nkya bona o ema. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Ihɛi la nyo batongelaka ntepeli baombo, eke ngɔkɔ ba ihe baakinyo banto banɛ babalyakaki. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Lwɛnia mbɔ luumeya mbo ikelaki ba ihe baakinyo, itina ibɔ balyakaki ntepeli, mpe nyo lobatongela baombo. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Ɛkɔiko Ndjakomba, la wanya bokinde, ahangaki: “Ngobatindela ntepeli la bɛnkɔmwa; bangoolyaka baamɔɔ mpe bangɔɔnyɔkɔlɔ bankina”. <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Ɛkɔiko bakila baaki ntepeli inkuma iwɛ ima ibangakako iiki bolongo bangooyala nde bɛtɛ beki banto ba ekeke ɛnɛ e lɔlɔkɔ, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />ima nko bakila baaki Abɛlɛ tii bakila baaki Yakalia olyakaki ibɔ ihambi i etumbelo la Ilɔngɔ i Ndjakomba. Ndobela nte hɔlɔ, bakila baiko bangooyala nde bɛtɛ beki banto ba ekeke ɛnɛ e lɔlɔkɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />«Ihɛi la nyo, balaki baaki bobeko, itina nyo lohekyɛ yɔtwɛlo eeki ndjebi: nyo kiika talɔtwa mpe balangaki baɔtwe, lobahukaki.»<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Anɛ yolaki Yesu nde botumba buuko, balaki ba bobeko la bafalisaya babookelɛ nkɛlɛ mpe baboubole buuke bo biibo belenda bakambo ndenge la ndenge, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />bolengɛ kela bobate la mbo i bobe nde inɛ itepela nde nkamba babopunde.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Boyanga booki bafalisaya</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mat 10, 26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Nko aikɛkɔ, nga boyalaki boloy bɔ bɔnɛnɛ mpe banto bobanga yoyanyata, Yesu abangɛ yobela bakɛndi laa nde: «Loyalaka la nkɛpɔ la baanya bape baaki bafalisaya, eyali nga bote bɔnɛ boamyaka mampa. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Nkola la yoomba ɛmɔɔ yuuhi epa tengoyala nko uhwa, nkola la yoomba ɛmɔɔ ebombi epa tengoyala nko ola nde bongala. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Itina inkuma inga lotepele nde buulima ingoyokya la nkatala e waane; inga loyahangele nde ndenge ndjuhama ingoyokya tii nde nsamba i betumba.»<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bonto ɔnɛ oɛli looka bɔɔmɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mat 10, 28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />«Ndobela, nyo baninga bakimi: banto balyaka byonge mpe, la lombuha, baapa la lobo lonkina lo mpondo lɔhɔ ibo yokela, talobaokake bɔɔmɔɔ! <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Ndjolwɛnia bonto ɔnɛ ɔhɔ nyo yoka bɔɔmɔ: lookaka bɔɔmɔɔ bonto oyali la nguya yoloboka nde ntyɛ i botako lombuha lo yololyaka. Ndohangela mpendja, uuko wambɔ ɔnɛ oɛli nyo looka bɔɔmɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />«Bapotɛkɛke bihɔya bitano la mpata ipe? Nkya ngauko, Ndjakomba apobopele nkola la ehɔya ɛmɔɔ <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Aeba la botango bo bayoo bankuma bayali nde bɛtɛ bekinyo. Talokake bɔɔmɔ, nyo loleka bihɔya binkuma la botuya.»<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bonto ɔnɛ uumeya Yesu la ɔnɛ obotona</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mat 10, 32-33</ref>. <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12, 32</ref>. <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10, 19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />Ndobela: «bonto onkuma ongonyumeya nde baiho baaki banto ayali bonto okimi, Bona ooki Bonto mpe angoobumeya nde baiho baaki bentomwa beki Ndjakomba; <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />yaa bonto ongonyangana nde baiho baaki banto, emi mpe ngoboangana nde baiho baaki bentomwa beki Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Bonto onkuma ongotepele bobe itina iiki Bona ooki Bonto, bangoobookela ihɛi, yaa ongotole Bolimo bo Bɔyɛngwa, tangobookela ihɛi.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />«Kaki bangotɛ itolohambya nde betumba be lɔbɔndɔ, eka nkumu la benkondi, taloyatungyake yotila lwebe ndenge enga nyo losambe la mpe ndenge enga lotepele. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Itina Bolimo bo Bɔyɛngwa angoololakania elaka iiko iinga nyo lotepele.»<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwɛlya looki bokulaka bopa la lyanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Bonto ɔmɔɔ oyalaki nde boloy abelɛ Yesu: «Bolaki, bela bohibotonga okimi atokapoye lokutu lɔnɛ lwe ihe ekinso atoheneyake.» <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yesu abobelɛ: «Bonto oontikɛ ntɛndi kela ndokapele lokutu lokinyo nnɔ?» <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Nko nde ɔnɛ obabela ibɔ bankuma: «Loyalaka la nkɛpɔ ! Talopendake yoyapa la mpoha e lokutu; teyali itina bonto ayolɛ la ikulaka, wambɔ bɔmɛngɔ buuko bohekya lobiko lokinde.»<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Nko nde ɔnɛ obahangelɛ lwɛlya lɔnɛ: «Bokulaka bɔmɔɔ ayalaki la bilanga bikinde bibobotelɛ byomba buuke. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Ɛkɔiko ayaubolɛ: “Nkele ngamo? Ntiyali lenkina la nongi yotika byomba binɛ bikimi binkuma bitɔyɛ emi nde bilanga.” <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Aoyahangela nko nde kiika: “Bɔlɔti nkele ngɔnɛ: nkɔye beliko bɛnɛ beekimi kela nɔnge bependa bɔnɛnɛ, ntike mmuma ikimi inkuma la byomba bikimi.” <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Nkamba ndjoyabela emi mɛlɛ: “Wɛ nde ɔnɛ oyɛ la buuke bo lokutu nde beliko mpe lokutu lo mbula la mbula; yakihya, lɛkɛ, mɛlɛ, kela ntɛkɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Eke ngɔkɔ Ndjakomba aobobela: “Lenda etula ɛnɛ! Nko la botyo bo lɔlɔkɔ, bakooya yɔkɔkɔhɔ. Yaa oongotikala la biko binkuma bibombaki wɛ nnɔ?” <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Uuko wambɔ ikambo ibata bonto obomba lokutu itina ikinde kiika ndye eki ayale bokulaka nde baiho baaki Ndjakomba.»<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elaka nko Ndjakomba</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat 6, 25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Yesu nde ɔnɛ obela bakɛndi laa nde: «Ɛkɔiko elobela emi: Taloyatungyake itina iiki byomba bindɛlɛ nde lobiko lokinyo, la mpe itina iiki bihenda byɔhɔ nyo yɔlɔtɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Lobiko loki bonto loleka byomba bi ndɛlɛ la itina mpe byonge biki bonto bileka bihenda la itina. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Lolenda byanganga: biponake la yomba, biponikake mmuma, bipa la bibombelo bi muma, bipa mpe la boliko bobomba ibo byomba bi ndɛlɛ; nko Ndjakomba ɔnɛ obalehya. Endaka nyo lopenda mpulu. <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Aiko eyali nyo la batungya baakinyo, bonto ɔnɛ ɔhɔ yohangya nkya empulu e buuna nde lobiko lokinde nnɔ? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Kaki nyo lɔpɔhe yokela nkya yoomba e nkɛnkɛ, boyatungya nyo itina iiki binɛ binkuma nnɔ? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Lolenda ndenge yolwa pulɛlɛ iiko: ipokelake bosala, ipotongake bihenda; yaa ndohangela, nkya Salɔmɔ nde kiika, la ikulaka ikinde inkuma, ɔmbwɛne bomboyahɔnɔkɛ nde, takita nga pulɛlɛ ɛmɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Kaki Ndjakomba alɔɔtya ngauko baɔmbi baiko bayali lɔlɔkɔ nde ngonda bangobokama lobi nde ntyɛ, loopa nde tangɔhɔ yokela itina ikinyo nnɔ, nyo banto ba nyumeya bɔkɛ? <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Nga la nyo, taloyatungyake la bindɛlɛ la bimɛmɛlɛ; talopendake yoyatungya. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Iiko inkuma, wambɔ banto ba bokili bapenda yotilya-tilya bikɔ. Ekanyo, Ihe ekinyo aeba bɔlɔti mbɔ loyali la mpoha la bikɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Nyo, lotilaka lontondo Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba, nkamba binɛ binkuma bangoolohangyela nde loliko.»<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikulaka nko nde lobola</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mat 6, 19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />«Tookake bɔɔmɔ, wɛ botonga bo nkɛnkɛ, itina Ihe ekinyo aokɛ bɔlɔti yolopa Bonkumu. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Lɔtɛkɛkɛ byomba biyali la nyo, lokapelaka bakelela bɔhɔlɔ bokaa lobata. Loyakelelaka mango ipotondwake, lotilaka lokutu lopopitanake nde Lobola, mpiko epokite bonto onɛ o iba la nsɛlɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Itina looko loyali bɔmɛngɔ bokiɛ, botema bokiɛ bongoyala mpe nko mpiko.»<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bahali baakɛngɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />«Loyalaka la bihenda bi bohala mpe meinda bekinyo bɛpɛtɛke. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Loyalaka nga basali balila buuma nkolo nde ntɛkɔ e ibala, kela babolipole nko aokitele mpe aokɔkɔme. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Ɛmɛngɔ la basali baanga nkolo atane bahɛndjɛlɛ anɛ enga nde akite. Ndohangela nte nhɔhɔlɔ mpendja, nkolo angɔɔlɔɔtɔ bihenda bi bosala, angoobakihya nde mesa mpe angooya yobatandela byomba. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Nkolo akite la koko e botio la mpe la ikya i nkɛhɛ, kaki angotaanɛ bahɛndjɛlɛ, ɛmɛngɔ eyali la ibɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />«Lwebaka bɔlɔti, kaki bɔmɛlɛ botumba aebaki elaka ɛnɛ yoye buubi, tapohena abole etutu e botumba bokinde. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Nyo mpe loyɔhɔlɔkɔ, itina Bona ooki Bonto angooya elaka ɛpa nyo talongwepwa.»<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bosali bo lyanya la bopa la lyanya</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mat 24, 45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Petelo aubolɛ Yesu: «Nkolo, otepela lwɛlya luuko itina ikinso laa mpe itina iiki banto bankuma?»<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Nkolo abuunoyelɛ: «Uuko bɔhɛndjɛli bo lokutu bo semba mpe bo lyanya botikɛ nkolo lontondo loki basali baakinde bankuma kela abakapelake byomba nde elaka ɛnɛ ɛɛli nnɔ? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Ɛmɛngɔ eka bosali buuko nga nkolo angoobotane akela bohala buuko elaka enga nde aunwe! <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Ndohangela nte hɔlɔ mpendja, nkolo angoobotika ahɛndjɛlɛ byomba bikinde binkuma. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Yaa kaki bosali buuko aoyahangela nde kiika: “Nkolo ekimi angɔtɛmɛ nde lɔkɛndɔ lootɛ nde” mpe aobanga yokula basali, la beele la bainto, yɔlɛ, yɔmɛlɛ la yootwa, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />nkolo eeki bosali buuko angooya buuna boopa nde aolile mpe nde elaka epa nde aebe; angoobopandja mpe angoobotika ndye ɛmɔɔ la banto banɛ ba bobe. <verse eid="LUK 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />Bosali bɔnɛ weba mpoha eeki nkolo ekinde mpe tabɔngya la yoomba ɛmɔɔ mpe takela mpoha eeki nkolo ekinde, bangoobokula bebambo; <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Bosali bopa taeba mpoha eeki nkolo mpe aokela bakambo banɛ baɛli la etumbo, bangoobokula bebambo bɔkɛ. Bonto opaki ibɔ byomba buuke, bangooboubola mpe buuke; bonto obutyaki ibɔ byomba buuke, bangoobootya mpe buuke.»<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu, itina i bokapwani</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat 10, 34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />Yesu aunwɛ yotepela: «Ndjaki yɔpɛtya ntyɛ nde bokili, mpe ndjali la mpoha nyɛne bɔpɛtɛ ntyɛ ikɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Ndjali la mpoha mbate nyunama ɛmɔɔ, mpe ndjali botema nko ntyɛ-ntyɛ aiko epa lobo lɔkɔ talokelami. <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Nyo lokambake emi ndjaki yotika nyɛ nde bolongo? Nkola, ndjaki yokapola. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Itina, ima lɔlɔkɔ, kaki banto bayali batano nde botumba bɔmɔɔ, bangookapwa: bahato loko, bape loko. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Ihe ayuna bona okinde o loondo, bona mpe ayuna ihe; nyango ayuna bona okinde o buunto, bona mpe ayuna nyango, nyango e bokilo ayuna waali ooki bona, waali ooki bona mpe ayuna nyango e bokilo.»<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeba itina iiki bileko</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat 16, 2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yesu abelɛ mpe boloy boyalaki aiko: «Kaki lɔngwɛnɛ bailu bangoolɛ looko loolalaka inyɛlɛ, lohangake mbala ɛmɔɔ: “Mbula ɛkɔlwa”, mpe ekelamake nko ngauko. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Kaki lohoka bɔmpɛmpɛ buuma looko lo nse, lohangake: “Ngangeli ekoyala”, mpe ekelamake nko ngauko. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Nyo banto ba bilongi bipe! Lwebake yolimbola mbo inɛ yɛnɛ nyo nde bokili la nde liko, itina ipa lwebe yɔkɔtɔlɔ ekeke ɛnɛ e lɔlɔkɔ nnɔ?»<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeba yobɔngya la opoyaoke la wɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mat 5, 25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />«Itina mpe ipa lwebake yɛnɛ nyo kiika bakambo ba semba nnɔ? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Kaki ooli wɛ la bonto ongokopundɛ eka ntɛndi, otilaka loyaoke wɛ la nde aiko eyali nyo nde ndjela. Kaki ngauko nkola, angokohenya eka ntɛndi, ntɛndi aokobutya bapulusi mpe bapulusi baokotika nde bɔlɔkɔ? <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Nkobela: Tongoola nde bɔlɔkɔ kaki toheyi yoputa bɔhɔlɔ bonkuma.»<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Opolange abongya bihɛlɛlo alanga iwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Nko nde elaka iiko, banto bankina bayɛ yohangela Yesu ikambo iiki banto ba Ngalilaya banɛ bae Pilato alyakake nko nde elaka ɛnɛ etumbelaka ibɔ Ndjakomba mbeka. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yesu abaunoyelɛ: «Lokamba banto baiko ba Ngalilaya baawaki nyɔi e bobe ngauko bayalaki bahumuki penda banto ba Ngalilayi bankuma? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Nkola, emi ndobela; yaa nga talɔbɔngya betema, nyo bankuma longowa nko ngauko. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Mpe banto lyomu la mwambi baawaki anɛ yakɔyɛlɛki eliko e Silowe, lokamba ibɔ bapenda banto bankuma ba Yelusalɛmɛ la bobe? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Nkola, emi ndobela; yaa nga talɔbɔngya betema, nyo bankuma longowa nko ngauko.»<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwɛlya looki bopela bopa bobote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Mpe Yesu aobapa lwɛlya lɔnɛ: «Bonto ɔmɔɔ ayalaki la bompela<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nde buku bakɔtɛ Figi, nga bopa nso tokati bote buuko totikɛ bompela.</char></note> bokinde boonaki nde nde elanga. Atɛ itotila mmuma nde bote bɔkɔ, tabata la lommuma lɔmɔ. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Ahangelɛ bonto ɔhɛndjɛlɛkɛ elanga: “Lenda, ɛyɛ mbula ihato lonkundu iya emi yotila mmuma nde bolala bɔnɛ, mpe mpobatake yomba. Pupola bɔkɔ. Itina nnɔ ɛlɛ bɔkɔ babu nko intomba?” <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Bɔhɛndjɛli bo elanga abelɛ bɔmɛlɛ: “Nkolo, opohenyakɛ laino mbula ɛnɛ, ntimole babu nde itina, ndjutumole luula. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Ɛmɔɔ mbala nko bobota mmuma mbula iiko yoye. Kaki mpe tabobota, okataka.”»<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abikiɛ buunto o bɔlɛmɛ buuna bo sabata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Buuna bɔmɔɔ bo sabata, Yesu alakaki nde botumba bo lɔbɔndɔ. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Buunto ɔmɔɔ oyali la bɔlɛmɛ ayalaki aiko. Bolimo bo bobe bobuunɛ betiti ima mbula lyomu la mwambi mpe apɔɔhe yoyahembola bɔlɔti. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Anɛ ɛboɛnɛki Yesu, aoboeta mpe aobobela: «Buunto, ongobikɛ la bɔlɛmɛ bokiɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Yesu aboapyɛ bɛbɔ, mpe la mbala ɛmɔ, betiti byohembwɛ mpe buunto ɔkɔ atotyɛ Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Bonkondi bo botumba bo lɔbɔndɔ aokɛ bobe mpendja itina Yesu abikiɛ bonto nde buuna bo sabata. Ɛkɔiko, abelɛ boloy boyalaki aiko: «Toyali la biina botoba be bosala. Loyaka nde biina biiko yotila balobikie, nde buuna bo sabata nkola!» <verse eid="LUK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Nkolo abuunoyelɛ: «Nyo banto ba bilongi bipe! Aiko eyali nyo, opoolyake ngɔmbɛ ekinde laa mpunda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyama ɛnɛ eebetana itina iiki yobila banto eyali mpunda ɛkɔiko eumolɛ nso anɛ.</char></note> ekinde nde elongo buuna bo sabata aobotombi yɔmɛlɛ bahi nnɔ? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Yaa buunto ɔnɛ, bona ooki Abalayama, otungyɛ Satana mbula liomu la mwambi lonkundu, tɛɛli babotungole bɛlɔkɔ biiko buuna bo sabata?» <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Aiko etepelaki nde ngauko, banto bankuma bapobolangake baokɛ nsɔni epululu; yaa boloy bonkuma boyalaki la ibulwako la yɛnɛ mbo i mpapo iiko ikela nde.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwɛlya looki boopo bo nsɛmbɛ e lobambo</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13, 31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mlk 4, 30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Nkamba Yesu aubolɛ: «Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba bɔɛli la nnɔ? Ndjɔhɔ yoɛlya bɔkɔ la nnɔ? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Bɔɛli la boopo bo nsɛmbɛ e lobambo bɔnɛ boonɛ bonto ɔmɔɔ nde ngonda ekinde. Lomuma lɔkɔ loolɛ, lokitɛ bote bo bɔnɛnɛ mpe mpulu iiyaaka nde liko batongɛ baimbu baakiibɔ nde bitape biki bɔkɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwɛlya looki bote bɔnɛ buuleya lopate lo mampa</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mat 13, 33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yesu aunwɛ yuubola: «Ndjɛlie Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba la nnɔ? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Boɛli la bote bo mampa bɔhɔpɔ buunto la katini ihato i falini mpe boyuuleya lopate lonkuma.»<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mboka e lobola, buuho bo nkaka</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat 7, 13-14</ref>.<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yesu ataki yolekaka nde bamonga la bihe, aolakake ilako mpe aotake looko lo Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Bonto ɔmɔɔ abuubolɛ: «Nkolo, banto baangobika bangooyala bɔkɛ?» Yesu ababelɛ: <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />«Lokelaka nguya lɔɔtwe nde buuho bo nkaka, itina, ndobela, buuke bangotila baɔtwe, yaa tabangɔhɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />«Elaka engoyala bɔmɛlɛ botumba ahwemala mpe aolipa ebala, nyo baangotikala nde bongala, longobanga yokɔkɔmɔ ebala mpe yuubola: “Nkolo, otolipole”, nde angoluunoyela: “Emi mpolwebe”. <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Aiko longotila lohange: “Yaa nso nga tɔlɛki mpe tɔmɛlɛki nso la wɛ nnɔ, wɛ mpe ombolakake nde beboko beekinso!” <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Nde angoolobela lenkina: “Emi mpolwebe. Luuma aiko ntute la emi, nyo bankuma banto baapa la sembo.” <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Mpiko, engooyala la baangolela mpe la baangolamata baino, elaka enga loɛne Abalayama, Izaka, Yakobo la ntepeli inkuma nde Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba, mpe nyo bangolobokɛ nde bongala. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Nde elaka iiko, banto bangooyuma looko loolaka inyɛlɛ mpe looko loolalaka ikɔ, bangooyuma nde liko mpe nde nse, bangooya nde ntɛkɔ e Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Ɛkɔiko, baamɔɔ banto batikalaki mbuha bangooleka ntondo, bankina mpe baataki ntondo bangooyunwa mbuha.»<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aabela Yelusalɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat 23, 37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Nko elaka iiko, bafalisaya bankina batɛ eka Yesu mpe babohangelɛ: «Ima anɛ, kɛndɛ looko lonkina, itina Elode atila akolyake.» <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Talohangele bobanga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nde buku ɛkɔti Lenalɛ, nso totikɛ bobanga.</char></note> buuko: Mpandja belimo be bobe mpe mbikya banto lɔlɔkɔ la lobi, nde buuna bo behato, nhoheya bohala bookimi. <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Yaa, ntondo ntondo nkela laino lɔkɛndɔ lokimi lɔlɔkɔ, lobi mpe laipe, itina ɛpɔɔhe yokelama mbɔ ntepeli ɛmɔɔ awu botale la Yelusalɛmɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />«Yelusalɛmɛ, Yelusalɛmɛ, wɛ ɔkɔ olyakaka ntepeli mpe olikaka banto baatindaka Ndjakomba babɔkɔ, ntilaki mbala la mbala nsanganie baaha bakiɛ nga bokukaka nkɔkɔ e waali bana baakinde nde nse e bapapu baakinde, lendaka nyo talolanga. <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Aiko ekeeko, balohokokyela botumba bɔkɔ bookinyo. Mpe ndobela, talongunwa yɔnyɛnɛ tii buuna bonga lohange: “Bokako boyale la ɔnɛ ooye nde lina iiki Nkolo!”»<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu abikiɛ bonto o nkandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Bɔkɔlɔ bɔmɔɔ bo sabata, Yesu ataki itɔlɛ eka bonkondi bɔmɔɔ boki bafalisaya, mpe bafalisaya bayeela inkuma ikela nde. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Lontondo lokinde, eyalaki la bonto ɔmɔɔ ɔkɔnɛ nkandi e ndjɔu. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yesu aubolɛ balaki ba bebeko la Bafalisaya: «Bobeko bokinso bopake ndjela yobikya bonto buuna bo sabata la mpe nkola?» <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Ibɔ tabalanga babutole. Yesu abutɛ bonto oyali la nkandi, abobikiɛ mpe abunoyɛ ekabɔ. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Nde ɔnɛ aobabela: «Nga boyali nyo aiko, kaki bona okiɛ, la ngɔmbɛ ekiɛ ɛngɔkɔ nde ipoku, opa tangotila abolye nnɔ, nkya buuna bo sabata?» <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Nko bonto ɔnɛ ɔhɔki yobuunoyela mbuto.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɔhɔlɔ ndye e nkihi nde ntɛkɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yesu aɛnɛ bohwela banto banɛ baetaki ibɔ nde ntɛkɔ ndye i ntondo mpe abapɛ lwɛlya lɔnɛ: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />«Kaki bangokwetɛ nde ntɛkɔ e ibala, totaake itokiha nde ekili e ntondo, ɛmɔɔ mbala baetaki mpe bonto okopenda la lokumu, <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />mpe bonto olwetaki la wɛ la nde, taoya yokobela: “Heneya nde ekili iiko”; aiko ongota itokiha nde nsuki la nsɔni enkuma. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Kaki bangokwetɛ nde ntɛkɔ, otaaka itokiha nde nsuki, kela kaki bonto ombolwete aoya, akobele: “Boninga la emi, yaka yokihe ondoko nde lontondo.” Aiko engoyala itotya itina ikiɛ, ntondo loki banto bankuma bakihi la wɛ nde mesa. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Itina bonto onkuma oyauleya bangoobohuloya mpe oyahuloya bangoobuuleya.»<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Yesu ahangelɛ mpe bonto oboetaki nde ntɛkɔ: «Kaki okela ntɛkɔ kela banto baye yɔlɛ, twetake baninga bakiɛ, la bahi botonga bakiɛ, la mboti ikiɛ, la bekulaka bekihaka ntute la wɛ; baiko bangookweta la ibɔ ekibɔ elonga mpe ngauko bangookounoyela bɔlɔti bobakelaki wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Kaki okela ntɛkɔ, oetaka bɛmbɔlɔ, bintumbe, bɛlɛmɛ, banto babolyɛ baiho, <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />aiko ongoyala la ibulwako itina ibɔ tabayali la yoomba enga bakuunoyele: ongobata nko buuna bongokundwa banto ba sembo.»<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwɛlya looki ilambo bɔnɛnɛ nde ntɛkɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mat 22, 1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Anɛ yokaki bonto ɔmɔɔ nde baayaki aiko ngauko, abelɛ Yesu: «Ɛmɛngɔ la banto baangoyeta ibɔ nde ntɛkɔ e Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba!» <verse eid="LUK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesu abunoyelɛ: «Bonto ɔmɔɔ alangaki akele ekola e ntɛkɔ, mpe aetɛ banto buuke. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Elaka e ndɛlɛ yokita, atindɛ bosali bokinde atu itohangela banto banɛ baetaki nde: “Loyakaka, elaka yoyela.” <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Endaka, ibɔ bankuma baubolɛ babasabinye itina tabangokita nde ntɛkɔ. Bonto o lontondo abohangelɛ: “Ndjoyume yohomba elanga, ndjoli yolenda ɛkɔ; nkootya, onsabinye.” <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Bonto ɔnɛ o bape ahangɛ: “Ndjoyume yohomba ngɔmbɛ ikimi lyomu. Ndanga ntu itoimeka; nkootya, onsabinye.” <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Bonto onkina ahangɛ: “Ndjoyume yobala waali, ntingɔhɔ yokita.” <verse eid="LUK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Bosali atɛ itohangela Nkolo mbuto iiko inkuma. Nkolo aokɛ nkɛlɛ ɛmɔɔ ɛnɛnɛ mpe ahangelɛ bosali: “Kɛndɛ kwa nde bengala la nde ndjela iiki imɔnga, mpe ondjele anɛ bɛmbɔlɔ, bintumbe, banto baawɛ baiho la bɛlɛmɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Bosali atɛ mpe ahangelɛ Nkolo: “Nkolo, ngokelɛ ndenge emba wɛ ontinde, yaa botumba taboyoli.” <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Nkolo aunwɛ yohangela bosali: “Kɛndɛ nde ndjela la nde bensonga, tinda ibɔ la nguya baɔtwe, ndanga botumba bokimi boyole.” <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Ndobela, nkola la bonto ɔmɔɔ nde banɛ baetaki emi ɔngɔɔlɛ byomba bi ntɛkɔ iiko ekimi.»<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaki olanga oyale ooki Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mat 10, 37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Banto buuke bayaki yɔkɛndɛkɛ ibɔ la Yesu. Yesu aɛbwɛ mpe ababelɛ: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />«Kaki bonto aondjele mpe apondange penda ihe ekinde, nyango ekinde, waali okinde, bana baakinde, bahibotonga baakinde, la bele la bainto, mpe penda la lobiko lokinde kiika, bonto uuko apɔɔhe yoyala bɔkɛndi la emi. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Bonto opobile ekulusu ekinde mpe oopondjele, apɔɔhe yoyala bɔkɛndi la emi. <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Nga boyali nyo aiko, kaki ɔmɔɔ okinyo alanga atonge eliko itina yohɛndjɛlɛ, tangobanga laino yokiha kela aebe bɔhɔlɔ bɔɛli yoheya bohala buuko? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Itina, kaki takela ngauko, aobanga nko yotika babɔkɔ banɛ babuta botumba nde nse e babu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eyali etutu ɛnɛ ebangaka yotonga botumba.</char></note> mpe apɔyɔɔhɔ yoheya bohala, banto bankuma bangɔyɛnɛ bangɔɔbɔɔlɔ <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />mpe bangoohanga: “Lenda bonto ɔnɛ obangaki yotonga botumba mpe taɔhɔ yoheya bohala.” <verse eid="LUK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Nko ngauko, kaki bonkondi bɔmɔɔ alanga atu itomuna nde la bonkondi bonkina, tangobanga laino yolenda kaki la banto nkoto lyomu aɔhɔ yomuna la boninga ɔnɛ ooye la banto nkoto ntuku ipe? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Kaki tangɔhɔ, nko bonkondi bɔnɛ bonkina ayali laino botale, aobotindela banto kela batile bayaoke. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Nko ndenge ɛmɔ, aiko eyali nyo, bonto opa totona binkuma biyali la nde, apɔɔhe yoyala bɔkɛndi la emi.»<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bokwa bohilɛ ngɛngɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat 5, 13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mlk 9, 50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />«Bokwa boyali mɔngɔ e yomba. Yaa kaki bokwa bohila ngɛngɛ eeki bɔkɔ, bangoobounoyela ngɛngɛ ɛkɔ ngamo? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Aiko bohamba itina, eyale itina iiki babu, eyale itina iiki yɔbɔngya bilanga; yotiki nko baboboke. Otaki bonkanga, olangaka lotoy.»<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Lwɛlya looki mpata ebungaki mpe ɛhwɛnia</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat 18, 12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Bataakoli ba mputi la bahumuki bayaki ibɔ bankuma ntute la Yesu itina iiki baoke iitepela nde. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Bafalisaya la balaki ba bobeko bayɛɛ balikake bɛnsɛkɔ mpe bahangake: «Bonto uuko ayɛɛ aambake bahumuki mpe alɛke nde la ibɔ!» <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Ɛkɔiko, Yesu abapɛ lwɛlya lɔnɛ: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />«Nga boyali nyo aiko, kaki ɔmɔɔ ayali la mpata ikinde bonkama mpe ɛmɔɔ yobunga, tangohenya mpata ntuku ibwa la ibwa nde bokili bo bɛkɔngo kela atu yotilaka iiko ɛmɔɔ engobungɛ tii nko akyɛne? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Kaki mpe ahwɛnɛ ɛkɔ, aoketika nde nhanga la ibulwako inkuma. <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Mpe kaki ahunwa nde botumba bokinde, ayeeta baninga la banto baakiha la nde ntute mpe aobahangela: “Loyaka tobulwe itina ngwɛnɛ mpata ekimi ebungaki.” <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Ndobela, ibulwako ingoyala nko ndenge ɛmɔɔ nde liko itina iiki bohumuki bɔmɔɔ angohenyɛ mbo i bobe, ipenda la ibulwako itina iiki banto ntuku ibwa la ibwa baapa la mpoha bahenye bobe.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpata ebungaki mpe ɛhwɛnia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />«Lenkina, kaki buunto ɔmɔɔ ayali la mpata lyomu mpe aobungya ɛmɔɔ, tangopɛtya moinda, ayɔmbɔ botumba mpe aotila bɔlɔti tii atu yɛnɛ nkɛhi ɛkɔ? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Kaki ahokyɛnɛ, ayeeta baninga la banto bakiha ntute la nde mpe aobahangela: “Loyaka tobulwe itina ngwɛnɛ mpata ekimi ebungaki!” <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Ɛkɔiko ndobela, ibulwako iyake eka bentomwa beki Ndjakomba itina iiki bohumuki bɔmɔɔ angohenyɛ mbo i bobe.»<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bona obungaki mpe ahwɛnia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesu aunwɛ yohanga: «Bonto ɔmɔɔ ayalaki la bana bape. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Bona ɔnɛ o eboha abelɛ ihe: “Papa, ompa ekimi ndambo e lokutu.” Ihe mpe abakapolelɛ lokutu lokinde. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Mbuha e biina, bona ɔkɔ o eboha akɔhɛ lokutu lokinde lonkuma, atɛ ehe ɛmɔɔ e buuli. Mpiko, apitɛ lokutu lokinde lonkuma la boyongo. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Anɛ eheyɛ nde yɔkɛndya byomba binkuma, ndjala enɛnɛ yɔtwɛ nde ehe ɛkɔ, mpe akitɛ nde bokelelo. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Atɛ itɔɔtwa nde bohala eka bonto ɔmɔɔ nde ehe iiko. Bonto uuko aotindɛ nde ngena ikinde itolehya ngulu. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Atilaki ale nkya byomba bilɛkɛ ngulu, tabata bonto ɔnɛ opaa bikɔ. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Ayakɔtɔlɛ nde kiika mpe ayabelɛ: “Buuke bo basali baaki Ihe ekimi balɛ byomba nga bolangi botema mpe bitikalake; lendaka emi anɛ mbwa la ndjala! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Ntunwa eka ihe ekimi, ndjoli yohangela: Papa, nkelɛ ihumu nde baiho baaki Ndjakomba mpe nde baiho bakiɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Ntyɛli lenkina yetama bona okiɛ; onkɔhe nko nga bosali bokiɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Abutɛ ndjela yunwa eka ihe ekinde.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">«Nko ayali botale, ihe ekinde awɛnɛ mpe abookelɛ ihɛi: apuhwɛ itoponana la nde, ayalikɛ nde byonge biki bona mpe aolingɛ ɛkɔpi. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Bona abelɛ ihe: “Papa, nkelɛ ihumu nde baiho baaki Ndjakomba mpe nde baiho bakiɛ. Ntyɛli lenkina yetama bona okiɛ...” <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Ihe abelɛ basali baakinde: “Lokela kwa, londjele bonkoto bopenda ilɔ, lɔɔlɔtye; lɔɔlɔtya ikɛtɛ nde bohai, bikote nde bekolo. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Loyaka la ngɔmbɛ e baita baita, lolyake, tɔle mpe tokele ntɛkɔ. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Itina, bona ɔnɛ okimi wɛnɛ nyo anɛ, awaki, anguunwɛ la lobiko, abungaki mpe angwɛniɛ.” Babangɛ mpe ekola e ntɛkɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />«Nde elaka iiko, bona ɔnɛ o engambi ayalaki laino nde bilanga. Anɛ inwɛ nde mpe ekitɛ nde ntute la botumba, aokɛ ngɔmɔ ikula mpe banto baemba nsambo. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Aetɛ bosali bɔmɔɔ, abuubolɛ uuko lobo nnɔ? <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Bosali abohangele: “Yaa uuko nga wakume okiɛ angoyɛ nnɔ, mpe ihe ekiɛ angolyakɛ ngɔmbɛ e baita baita, itina angwɛnɛ onga nde aunwɛ byonge bɔlɔti.” <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Eboto aokɛ nkɛlɛ mpe talanga aɔtwe nde botumba. Ihe ekinde aolɛ itina abɔbɔndɛle aɔtwe. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Bona aunoyelɛ ihe ekinde: “Lenda buuke bo mbula inɛ ikosalelɛ emi, ntitona la lotomo lɔmɔ lokiɛ, mpe la mbala ɛmɔɔ tompa nkya bona o ntaba ɛmɔɔ nkele ntɛkɔ emi la baninga bakimi. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Yaa anɛ eha bona ɔnɛ ɔkiɛ o loondo aunwa, nde bonto opitɛ lokutu lokiɛ la bainto, ongolyakɛ ngɔmbɛ e baita baita itina ikinde.” <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Ihe nde ɔnɛ obohangela: “Bona okimi, wɛ oyalake elaka inkuma ntute la emi mpe binkuma bikimi biyali bikiɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Anɛ, emboyale bɔlɔti tokele ntɛkɔ mpe toyale la ibulwako, itina wakume ɔnɛ ɔkiɛ awaki mpe anguunwɛ la lobiko, abungaki, nduuko ɔngwɛniɛ.”»<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Lyanya iiki banto ba bokili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesu aunwɛ yobela bakɛndi laa nde: «Bokulaka bɔmɔɔ ayalaki la kalaki yolendelaka lokutu lokinde. Baoboloba apiita byomba biki bokulaka buuko. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Bokulaka awetɛ mpe abobelɛ: “Iiko nsango eyoka emi itina ikiɛ nnɔ? Ɔnyɛnie ndenge ebutaki wɛ lokutu lokimi, itina ima lɔlɔkɔ, tonguunwa yobuta lokutu lokimi”. <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Kalaki ayahangelɛ nde kiika: “Ndjokela ngamo aiko eya Nkolo ekimi anyumola nde bohala bo yolenda byomba bikinde? Ntiyali la nguya yotya ngonda, lobondeli mpe nsɔni. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Nsweba yoomba engokelɛ emi kela kaki baonyumola nde bohala, ngobatɛ banto baangonyambe bikaabɔ.” <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Aetɛ ɔmɔɔ la ɔmɔɔ banto baayalaki la bembale beki nkolo ekinde; aubolɛ o lontondo: “Oyali la bombale booki nkolo ekimi botuya nnɔ?” <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Bonto oyali la bombale ahangɛ: “Bombale bo nkala i bohuku bonkama.” Kalaki aobelɛ: “Kɔhɔ bonkanda bokiɛ bo bombale, kiha aiko mpe kɔtɔ: nkala ntuku itano.” <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Aubolɛ bonto ɔnɛ o bape: “Bokyɛ bombale botuya nnɔ?” Aohangelɛ: “Saki i bakɔngɔ bonkama.” Kalaki aobelɛ: “Kɔhɔ bonkanda bokiɛ bo bombale, kɔtɔ: saki ntuku mwambi.” <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Nkolo atotiɛ kalaki iiko e boyanga itina i lyanya iiko ibataki nde. Banto ba bokili bɔnɛ bayali la lyanya buuke penda bana baaki lwɛya.»<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Yesu ahangyɛ: «Emi ndobela: Lotilaka lobate baninga la lokutu lo bokili, kela kaki lokutu luuko loohila, baninga baiko bangolwambe nde bikihelo bi botako. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Bonto ɔnɛ wɛli babutye byomba bi bɔkɛ, aɛli mpe abute byomba bi buuke; bonto opa la sembo nde byomba bi bɔkɛ taɛli mpe abute bi buuke. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Kaki talɔɔhɔ yobuta ikulaka iiki bokili, ongolobutya ikulaka inɛ i nhɔhɔlɔ nnɔ? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Mpe kaki taloyala sembo nde lokutu loki bonto onkina, ongolobutye lokinyo kiika nnɔ?»<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />«Bohali bɔmɔɔ apɔɔhe yohalela nkolo ipee: angooyuna ɔmɔɔ mpe aolanga ɔnɛ onkina, la mpe angooyapa la ɔnɛ o ntondo mpe aotona ɔnɛ o bapee. Talɔngɔhɔ yohalela mbala ɛmɔɔ la Ndjakomba la Bɔhɔlɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batina ba mbo bankina</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mat 11, 12-13</ref>. <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5, 31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mlk 10, 11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Bafalisaya baokaki mbo iiko inkuma mpe babɔɔlɔke nko ntɔɔlɔ, itina ibɔ balangake bɔhɔlɔ buuke. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Yesu nde ɔnɛ obabela: «Nyo loyaɛnɛke banto ba sembo nde baiho baaki banto, yaa Ndjakomba aeba betema bekinyo: yoomba ɛnɛ ɛniaka bɔnɛnɛ nde baiho baaki banto, ɛniake ingai nde baiho baaki Ndjakomba.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />«Eleko eeki bobeko booki Mose la buku iki ntepeli ehukaki eka Yowane; lombuha luuko, Nsango e Bɔlɔti eeki Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba elakama mpe bonto onkuma akela nguya kela aɔtwe mpiko. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Liko la nse ingooleka nko lyale, yaa yumola bɔkɔlɔtɔ nkya bɔmɔɔ boki bobeko ependa lyale.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />«Loondo lonkuma longotonɛ waali okinde mpe aobala waali onkina, angokelɛ iyee; mpe loondo longobalɛ buunto onga boome atonɛ, angokelɛ iyee.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bokulaka la bɔmbɔlɔ Layalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />«Eyalaki la bokulaka bɔmɔɔ bɔmbɔlɔtɔke nko bihenda bi ikulaka mpe biina benkuma aolambyake bikola bi balambo. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Bɔmbɔlɔ bɔmɔɔ, lina ikinde Lazalo, amboolalake nde lontondo lo buuho bo botumba booki bokulaka buuko, byonge binkuma nko mpota. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Ambooyalake la mpoha ale byomba biikɔ nde nse e mesa eeki bokulaka buuko, nde ndye iko mbwa bamboyake yɔmbɔlɔ mpota ikinde. <verse eid="LUK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Buuna bɔmɔɔ, bɔmbɔlɔ awɛ, bentomwa beeki Ndjakomba bayɛ yɔkɔhɔ, babotombɛ eka Abalayama. Bokulaka mpe awɛ, babokundɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Mpiko nde bokili booki baawɛ, bokulaka aɛnɛ eelo ependa. Alikɛ baiho nde liko, aɛnɛ mpeni buuli Abalayama la Lazalo akihi ntute la nde. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Bokulaka abobɛ: “Papa Abalayama, ondjokele ihɛi. Tinda Lazalo atu yobɔbya nsɔli e bohai bokinde nde bahi kela antangiele bakɔ nde lolemu. Itina anɛ nde ibeba i ntyɛ inɛ, lyale yopenda.” <verse eid="LUK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Abalayama abunoyelɛ: “Bona, wɛ ebaka mbɔ elaka eyalaki wɛ la lobiko, obataki bɔmɛngɔ buuke, Lazalo nde aɛnɛki nsuki eeki lyale. Aikekeko, nde aobata ibɔndi, wɛ oyɛ nde bɔnyɔkɔ. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Lendaka lenkina, ima ondoko eyali nso la yokita mpiko eyali nyo, ipoku imɔɔ bɔnɛnɛ itokapola, iikela mbɔ kaki banto balanga baime oondoko kela baye mpiko, tabangɔɔhɔ, ndenge ɛmɔɔ kaki bonto alanga aime mpiko eyali wɛ kela aye oondoko, tangɔɔhɔ mpe.” <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Bokulaka ahangɛ: “Papa, nkɔbɔndɛlɛ, kaki eyali ngauko, tinda Lazalo ekanso, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />itina emi ndjali la baakume la biboto bitano. Atu yobakokomya kela tabayake la ibɔ nde epoku ɛnɛ e lyale ngɔnɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Abalayama aobelɛ: “Bayali la Mose la ntepeli mpiko, babaoke.” <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Bokulaka aunɔyɛ: “Ngauko nkola, papa Abalayama. Yaa kaki bonto ɔmɔɔ anguumɛ oondoko eka banto baawɛ mpe angohulwɛ mpiko, aiko bangɔobɔngya betema.” <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Abalayama aobelɛ: “Kaki tabaoka Mose la ntepeli, ɔmbɔɛnɛkɛ bonto ɔmɔɔ angokundwɛ, tabangɔbɔngya betema.”»<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s1">Ihumu la bosabinyi</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mat 18, 6-7</ref>. <ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mlk 9, 42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yesu abelɛ bakɛndi laa nde: «Bakambo baakitya banto nde bobe bapohambake. Yaa nko ihɛi la bonto ootomba banto nde bobe. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Bɔlɔti babotungye ibɔkɔ i bolito nde nkingo mpe baboboke nde ndjale kela tatombake ɔmɔɔ oki bana baiko nde bobe. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Lɔbɔngyaka weema bookinyo.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">«Kaki bohibotonga angokokelɛ bobe, ɔbɔpɔndɔlɔkɔ; kaki mpe anguumeyɛ bobe bokelaki nde, obosabinyaka. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Eyale angokokelɛ bobe mbala nsambo nde bɔkɔlɔ bɔmɔɔ mpe anguunwɛ mbala nsambo yɔkɔbɔndɛlɛ: “Ngokelɛ bobe, ntingoyunwela”, obosabinyaka.»<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyumeya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mat 17, 20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Bɛnkɔmwa babelɛ Nkolo: «Pulya nyumeya ekinso.» <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Nkolo abaunoyelɛ: «Lopooyalaka la nyumeya ɛnkɛnkɛ nkya nga lomuma lo nsɛmbɛ e lobambo, ntiki lopoobela bokungu bɔnɛ: “Yakuma anɛ kela otu itoyaemya nde ndjale”, mpe bokoolookela.»<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bohali ayali nko bohali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />«Nga boyali nyo aiko, kaki ɔmɔɔ ayali la bohali bɔnɛ boona ngonda la bɔɔhɛndjɛlɛ bibwa, aiko ya nde aoyume nde ngonda, aɔhɔ yobobela: “Tookihe nde mesa ɔle byomba?” <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Aohamba yobobela: “Ondambele yomba, lɔɔtɔ bihenda bi bohala kela ontikele byomba nde mesa, laino emi nde, mmɛle, nkamba wɛ ɔle mpe ɔmɛle la lombuha”? <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Angoyumeya bohali buuko itina akelaki mbo inkuma ibotindaki nde akele? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Nyo mpe nko ngauko. Kaki longokelɛ inkuma ilotindaki ibɔ, lohangaka: “Toyali nko bahali. Tongokelɛ nko imbwɛlɛme tokele.”»<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu apetolɛ banto lyomu baakɔnɛ nkandi e bohale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Yesu alangaki atu Yelusalɛmɛ, alekɛ looko lo Samalia la Ngalilaya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Nko aoyɔtwe nde ehe ɛmɔɔ, banto lyomu baayalaki la nkandi e bohale baboolelɛ. Baemalɛ bona o botale la nde <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />mpe babobɛ: «Yesu Nkolo, otookele ihɛi.» <verse eid="LUK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Anɛ ebaɛnɛki Yesu, ababelɛ: «Lɔkɛndɛ loyaɛnie eka Nkanga iiki Ndjakomba.» Nko aiko yoli ibɔ, bapɛtwɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Anɛ ɛnɛki ɔmɔɔ okibɔ angobikɛ, aunwɛ, aokumiake Ndjakomba la lyoyi i nguya. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Ayakɔyɛ nde bekolo beeki Yesu, elongi tii nde babu, kela aopaaye itotya ikinde. Bonto ɔkɔ ayalaki bosamalia. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yesu aubolɛ: «Ɔkɔ wambɔ ibɔ bankuma lyomu tabapɛtwa? Yaa banɛ bankina ibwa bayali nko? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Nkola la ɔmɔɔ okibɔ onguunwɛ yototya Ndjakomba, ohunwa nko bobutu bɔnɛ?» <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Nkamba aobobela: «Emala mpe kɛndɛ, nyumeya ekiɛ engokobikyɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eyeelo eeki Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mat 24, 23-28</ref>. <ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Bafalisaya baubolɛ Yesu: «Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba bongoya lainga?» Yesu abaunoyelɛ: «Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba tabongoya nga yoomba ɛmɔɔ engwɛnie nde baiho baaki banto bankuma. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Talongooka: “Bɔkɔ bɔnɛ” la “Bɔkɔ boni”. Itina Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba bongoyɛ ekanyo.» <verse eid="LUK 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Ekɔiko abelɛ bakɛndi laa nde: «Engoyala la biina benga lolange lwɛne nkya buuna bɔmɔɔ botoo booki biina beeki Ndjakomba, yaa talɔngwɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Bangoolohangela: “Lenda nde ɔnɛ, lenda nde ɔni.” Talotake, talopuhwake mpiko. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Itina, nko nga wɛnɛkɛ nyo bokalyali anɛ yolaka bɔkɔ bokalima nde liko looko la looko, engoyala nko ngauko buuna boongoya Bona ooki bonto. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Yaa lontondo luuko, angɔɔnyɔkwa buuke mpe bangoobotona la banto baaki ekeke ɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Nko nga boyalaki nde eleko eeki Nowa, engoyala mpe nko ngauko nde eleko eeki Bona ooki bonto: <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />banto baambɔlɛke, bambɔɔmɛlɛke, beele la bainto bambooyabalake, tii buuna bɔnɛ bɔɔtwaki Nowa nde ihwa: mpela ɛkɛnɛ eyoyaka mpe yobalyaka ibɔ bankuma. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Engoyala mpe nga boyalaki nde eleko eeki Lɔti: banto bambɔɔlɛke, bambɔɔmɛlɛke, bamboohombe mpe bambɔɔtɛke, bambooyone mpe bambootonge betumba. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Yaa, buuna bɔnɛ boolaki Lɔti Sodoma, Ndjakomba alwɛyɛ mbula e ntyɛ la nhahe ilyakɛ banto bankuma. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Engoyala nko ngauko buuna bonga Bona ooki bonto ayaɛnie.»<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />«Nde buuna buuko, bonto oongoyala nde nsamba e botumba bokinde, tatilake ahulwe yɔkɔhɔ byomba bikinde; bonto mpe oongoyala nde ngonda tatilake aunwe nde botumba. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Lobopwaka lobo loolekelaki waali ooki Lɔti! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Bonto ongotila abombe lobiko lokinde angoolobungya, mpe ongobungya lokinde angoolobomba. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Ndohangela, botyo buuko, banto bape bangooyala nde ntange ɛmɔɔ: bangookɔhɔ ɔmɔɔ, baohenya onkina. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Bainto bape bangɔtɔkɔ mmuma ndye ɛmɔɔ: bangɔɔkɔhɔ ɔmɔɔ, baohenya onkina. [<verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Beele bepee bengoyala nde ngonda ɛmɔɔ: bangookɔhɔ ɔmɔɔ, baohenya onkina.» ] <verse eid="LUK 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Bakɛndi la Yesu babuubolɛ: «Nkolo, bakambo baiko bangookelama nko?» Yesu abaunoyelɛ: «Engoambeme ebembe, engohokame bibeke.»<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s1">Lwɛlya looki etuka la ntɛndi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Yesu apɛɛ bakɛndi laa nde lwɛlya lɔmɔɔ yobalaka itina iiki yɔbɔndɛlɛkɛ ngonga inkuma nkolɛmbwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Abahangelɛ: «Nde imonga imɔɔ, eyalaki la ntɛndi ɛmɔɔ epa tembokakɛ Ndjakomba bɔɔmɔ mpe nko booni booki banto. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Nko nde imonga ikɔ, eyalaki la etuka emɔɔ; ambooyakɛ yobobela: “Onseyele ikambo ikimi la bonto ɔnɛ opoyaoke la emi.” <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Ntɛndi atonaki mbala buuke yobookela. Nkamba la lombuha, ayabelɛ: “La kaki mpokake Ndjakomba bɔɔmɔ mpe mpa la booni la banto, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />anɛ eha etuka ɛnɛ apenda yotungya, mboheyele ikambo ikinde, kela taunwake yoya wɛyɔ wɛyɔ yontungya.”» <verse eid="LUK 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Nkolo ahangyɛ: «Looka iitepela ntɛndi iiko epa la bosembo. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Yaa Ndjakomba tangoheya mbo iiki banto baahɔlɛ nde kaki babolelela la waane la botyo? Akolanga abalilie? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Ndohangela ngɔnɛ: angoobabɔngyɛlɛ ikambo kwa kwa. Yaa buuna bongoya Bona ooki bonto, angootana nyumeya nde bolongo?»<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwɛlya looki bofalisayi la bɔlɛmbɔli bo mputi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Yesu apɛɛ lwɛlya lonkina itina iiki banto bayahangaka ibɔ banto ba bɔlɔti mpe batɛbɔlɔke baninga: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />«Banto bape batɛ nde Tɛmpɛlo yɔbɔndɛlɛ; ɔmɔɔ ayalaki bofalisaya, onkina botaakoli bo mputi. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Bofalisaya aemalɛ, mpe abɔndɛlɛ nde botema: “Nkolo, nkokumya itina ntiyali nga banto bankina, biiba, bakelake baninga bobe, bakɔhɔke baali baaki banto, ntiyali mpe nga botaakoli bo mputi bɔnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Nkilake byomba mbala ipe nde pɔsɔ ɛmɔɔ, mputake eteni e lyomu e byomba binkuma bibata emi.” <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Botaakoli bo mputi aemalɛ bono botale la lombuha, apolange auleye baiho nde liko, aohuniake nko elongi, nde wante: “Ah, Ndjakomba, ondjokele ihɛi, emi bonto o bahumu.” <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Ndohangela: botaakoli bo mputi aunwɛ ekande apɛtwɛ, yaa bofalisaya nkola. Itina bonto onkuma oyauleya, bangoobohuloya, mpe bonto oyahuloya bangoobuuleya.»<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atɔmɛyɛ bana bokako</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19, 13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mlk 10, 13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Banto bambootombelakɛ Yesu la balɛɛlɛngɛ kela abapie bɛbɔ. Anɛ e ɛnɛki bakɛndi laa nde ngauko, babapɛngɔlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Yesu aetɛ balɛɛlɛngɛ mpe ahangɛ: «Lohena balɛɛlɛngɛ baye ekami; talobahukake, itina Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba boyali itina iiki banto baayali nga ibɔ. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Nhɔhɔlɔ, emi ndohangela ngɔnɛ: bonto onkuma opwambe Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba nga ilɛɛlɛngɛ, tangotwa nde bɔkɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ihɛi iiki bokulaka</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19, 16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mlk 10, 17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Bokulaka bɔmɔɔ aubolɛ Yesu: «Nkumu e bɔlɔti, nkele ngamo kela mbate lobiko lo botako ?» <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesu abobelɛ: «Itina indjeta wɛ bonto o bɔlɔti nnɔ? Bonto o bɔlɔti tayali, ɔnɛ o bɔlɔti nko Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Weeba bebeko: tɔkɔhɔke waali ooki boninga, tolyakake bonto, tuubake byomba binkani, totepelake mbo i boyanga, okumyaka ihe ekiɛ la nyango ekiɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Bokulaka ahangɛ: «Ima boboha, nkelake mbo iiko inkuma.» <verse eid="LUK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Yesu abookɛ mpe abohangelɛ: «Okutwa nko yoomba ɛmɔɔ: Tɛkɛ byomba binkuma biyali la wɛ, kapela bɛmbɔlɔ, mpe ongobata bɔmɛngɔ nde liko; la lombuha luuko, wɛ yaka mpe ondjeele.» <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Anɛ yokaki bokulaka buuko ngauko, ayalɛ la ekola ihɛi, itina ayalaki la lokutu buuke. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesu abolendɛ mpe atepelɛ: «Eyali lyale itina iiki banto baayali la lokutu buuke baɔtwe nde Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Ndjɔu aɔhɔ yɔtwa nde itundu i sinani, yaa eyali lyale bokulaka aɔtwe nde Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="LUK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Banto banɛ baokaki Yesu bahangɛ: «Yaa aiko bonto ongobika nnɔ?» <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesu abaunoyelɛ: «Yomba epa banto baɔhe yokela, Ndjakomba aɔhɔ yokela.» <verse eid="LUK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Petelo atepelɛ: «Yaa nso, baahenyɛ byomba binkuma biyalaki laa nso mpe tokoyelɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Ndohangela nte nhɔhɔlɔ, bonto tangohenya botumba, waali, bahi botonga, mboti la bana baakiinde, itina iiki Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />nkobata ima lɔlɔkɔ lokutu buuke, mpe nde bileko biingoya, lobiko lo botako.»<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aebyɛ iwa la nkundwa ekinde mbala ɛnɛ ehato</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20, 17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mlk 10, 32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yesu aetɛ bɛnkɔmwa bekinde lyomu la bepe nde bokili mpe ababelɛ: «Aiko wambɔ toyoli Yelusalɛmɛ; mpe mbo inkuma ikɔtɔki ntepeli itina iiki Bona ooki bonto iyoli yokelama. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Bangoobokapa eka bapakano, bangɔɔbɔɔlɔ, bangoobotola bangɔɔbɔtwa nsɔi, <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />bangoobokula bebambo, bangoobolyaka; mpe nde bɔkɔlɔ bo behato, angookundwa.» <verse eid="LUK 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Bakɛndi la nde tababuteya itina i lobo. Lobo luuko lobombamaki mpe ibɔ tabaeba yoomba elangaki Yesu atepele.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abikiɛ bonto oboliɛ baiho</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20, 29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mlk 10, 46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Anɛ ekitaki Yesu ntute la Yeliko, bonto ɔmɔɔ oboliɛ baiho ayalaki mpe nde bokili bo ndjela yobondelaka byomba. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Aokɛ boyoko booki banto buuke baoleke mpe aubolɛ ikambo iileka. <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Babohangelɛ: «Uuko Yesu ɛnɛ e Nazalɛti ɔnɛ ooleke.» <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Abobɛ: «Yesu, Bona ooki Dawidi, ondjokele ihɛi!» <verse eid="LUK 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Banto baayaki lontondo baboangoyɛ mpe babobelɛ alipe bonya; nde aunwɛ yoboba: «Bona ooki Dawidi, ondjokele ihɛi.» <verse eid="LUK 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesu aemalɛ mpe abelɛ baayalaki aiko baboyele bonto uuko. Anɛ ekitaki nde ntute, Yesu abuubolɛ: <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />«Olanga nkele nnɔ itina ikiɛ?» Aunoyɛ: «Nkolo, ndanga nyɛne lenkina.» <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yesu abobelɛ: «Ɛnɛ. Nyumeya ekiɛ engokobikiɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />La mbala ɛmɔɔ, aunwɛ yɛnɛ mpe ayelɛ Yesu, aokumyake Ndjakomba. Anɛ yɛnɛki banto bankuma ngauko, la ibɔ mpe baokumya Ndjakomba.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu la Zakayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yesu aɔtwɛ Yeliko mpe akɛndɛ imonga lonkundu. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Bonto ɔmɔɔ, lina ikinde Zakayo, ayɛ la nde aiko. Ayalaki bonkondi booki balɛmbɔli ba mputi mpe ayalaki bokulaka. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Atilaki aɛne mpe aebe Yesu, yaa taɔhɔ yɔbɔɛnɛ itina banto bapendaki buuke, nde mpe ayalaki buube. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Apuhwɛ bona o lontondo, atɛ itokondela nde bote bɔmɔɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nde buku, bote eyali sikɔmɔlɛ, bote buuko bopali ekanso Ekonda.</char></note> kela aɛne Yesu anɛ ekoleka nde aiko. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Anɛ ekitaki Yesu nongi ɛkɔ, auleyɛ baiho nde liko mpe abobelɛ: «Zakayo, hulwa kwa; lɔlɔkɔ nkihɛ nde botumba bokiɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Zakayo ahulwɛ lobango lobango mpe aboambɛ la bohahalo bonkuma. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Anɛ e ɛnɛki banto bankuma ngauko, baumumɛ mpe bahangɛ: «Lenda, angotɛ itokiha wambɔ eka bonto o bahumu !» <verse eid="LUK 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Zakayo aemalɛ ntondo eeki Yesu mpe abohangelɛ: «Nkolo, nkapela bɛmbɔlɔ eteni e bape e byomba bikimi, mpe nga mpɔmɔlɔki bonto yomba ekinde, mbunoyela ɛkɔ mbala inɛi.» <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yesu nde ɔnɛ ootepela itina ikinde: «Lɔlɔkɔ, lobiko lɔngɔɔtwɛ nde botumba bɔnɛ, itina wambɔ bonto ɔnɛ ayali la nde bonkana ooki Abalayama. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Nhɔhɔlɔ, Bona ooki bonto ayaki yotila mpe yobikya binɛ biundjwɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwɛlya looki nkɛhi yolukola</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25, 14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Nko aiko eyalaki banto yobooka, Yesu ahangyɛ lwɛlya lɔmɔɔ itina akitaki ntute la Yelusalɛmɛ mpe banto bakambaki Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba bongoyɛnia nko nde elaka iiko. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Ahangɛ: «Bonto ɔmɔɔ obotwɛ nde bokundi booki banto ba bɔhɔlɔ, atɛ lɔkɛndɔ nde ehe ɛmɔɔ e buuli itina batu itobɔlɔtya bokopo kela aoyunwake. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Lontondo lo yota, aetɛ basali baakinde lyomu mpe akapelɛ bɔhɔlɔ bo nkɛhi lyomu, mpe ababelɛ: “Lolukola bɔhɔlɔ bɔnɛ bokimi tii enga emi nyunwe.” <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Ehe ekinde bamboobuunakɛ mpe batindɛ banto bankina batu yohanga: “Toboyi bonto uuko ale bokopo ekanso.” <verse eid="LUK 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Anɛ e inwɛ nde lombuha lo yɔɔlɛ bokopo, aetɛ basali bakɔ baheneyaki nde bɔhɔlɔ kela aebe ndenge ee luukolɛ bonto la bonto. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Bohali bo lontondo ayɛ mpe ahangɛ: “Nkolo, nkɛhi ekiɛ ebotɛ nkɛhi lyomu nde liko.” <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Nkolo abobelɛ: “Bɔlɔti, wɛ bosali bo bɔlɔti. Ongoyaɛniɛ bosali bo sembo nde byomba bi nkɛnkɛ, nkokitya bonkondi bo bamonga lyomu.” <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Bohali bo bape ayɛ mpe ahangɛ: “Nkolo, nkɛhi ekiɛ ebotɛ nkɛhi itano.” <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Nkolo abohangelɛ: “Wɛ, nkotika bonkondi bo bamonga batano.” <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Bosali bonkina ayɛ mpe ahangɛ: “Nkolo, nkɛhi ekiɛ ɛkɛnɛ, nkebombaki nde nduku. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Itina nkookaki bɔɔmɔ, wɛ oyalake bonto ɔmɔɔ o mbo boolo: ɔkɔhɔke byomba biipa wɛ tobomba mpe onikake mmuma iipa wɛ toona.” <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Nkolo abuunoyelɛ: “Bohali bo bobe, nkobuta nko la itepela wɛ mɛlɛ. Webaki ndjali bonto ɔmɔɔ o mbo boolo, nkɔhɔke byomba bipa ntibomba mpe nikake mmuma ipa ntyona. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Yaa itina iipa wɛ totika bɔhɔlɔ bokimi nde botumba bonɛ bobombaka ibɔ bɛhɔlɔ nnɔ? Ntiki nde baunwelo bakimi, mpɔkɔhɔ bɔhɔlɔ buuko la intomba.” <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />La mbuha iiko, Nkolo abelɛ banto baayalaki aiko: “Lɔbɔpɔɔmɔlɔ nkɛhi iko ekinde, lopa ɛkɔ eka bonto oyali la nkɛhi lyomu.” <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Banto baiko bayalaki aiko babobelɛ: “Nkolo, uuko ayali la nkɛhi lyomu!” <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Nkolo abaunoyelɛ: “Ndohangela: bonto oyali la byomba, bangoopoba binkina, yaa ɔnɛ opa tokati, bangɔɔbɔpɔmɔlɔ la yoomba eyali laa nde. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Nga la nyo baanyuna, banto bankuma baapa tabalanga ndjale bonkondi booki ibɔ, loyaka la ibɔ anɛ, lobapupola nkingo aiko nde baiho bakimi.”» .<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aɔkɛndɛ Yelusalɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21, 1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mlk 11, 1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yow 12, 12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Anɛ eheyaki Yesu yotepela ngauko, alekɛ lontondo kela atu Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Anɛ ekitaki nde ntute la Betipaze mpe la Betani, looko lo ngomba ɛnɛ eetaka ibɔ Ngomba e Olive, Yesu atindɛ bakɛndi laa nde bape, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />ababelɛ: «Lɔkɛndɛ nde ehe iiko eyali ibu i mboka, lokotana bona o mpunda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mpunda: nde buku akɔtɛ ano nga bopa nso tokati nyama iiko ɛkɔiko ɛkɔhɛ nso mpunda.</char></note> etungi la bokulu, mpunda epa la bonto ɔmɔɔ takondeli laino. Lotungola ɛkɔ mpe loyaka la ɛkɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Kaki bonto angoluubolɛ: “Itina iitungola nyo mpunda iiko nnɔ? ” lobohangelaka: “Nkolo ayali la mpoha la ɛkɔ.”»<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Banto batindaki Yesu batɛ mpe bataanɛ inkuma nko botindo bɔnɛ bobahangelaki nde. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Anɛ etungolaki ibɔ mpunda, bamɛlɛ baobaubola: «Itina itungola nyo mpunda nnɔ?» Ibɔ baunoyɛ <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />«Nkolo ayali la mpoha la ɛkɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Ibɔ banɛ bayotombelaka Yesu mpunda ɛkɔ, baetandelɛ bihenda nde bɔkɔngɔ, mpe bakihiɛ Yesu nde liko iiki ɛkɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Aiko yokɛnde Yesu (nde liko i mpunda), banto batandɛ bihenda biikiibɔ nde ndjela. <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Anɛ ekitaki nde ntute la Yelusalɛmɛ, nde nkitibɔngi eeki ngomba e Olive, bakɛndi laa nde bankuma bayolɛ la bosalangano, bakumyɛ Ndjakomba la lyoyi i nguya itina i mpapo inkuma inɛ yɛnɛɛ ibɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Bahangɛ: «Bokako boyale la nkumu, ɔnɛ oye nde lina iiki Nkolo. Palaa nde liko mpe lwɛya looki Ndjakomba nde lobola!» <verse eid="LUK 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Bafalisaya baayalaki nde boloy babelɛ Yesu: «Nkolo, huka bakɛndi la wɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Ndohangela, kaki ibɔ bangopilamɛ, babɔkɔ bangooboba.»<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu alelɛ itina iki Yelusalɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Anɛ eha nde akita ntute la Yelusalɛmɛ mpe eha nde aɛnɛ ɛkɔ, Yesu alelɛ itina iiki imonga ikɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />Ahangɛ: «Kaki la wɛ opoyeba lɔlɔkɔ lɔnɛ inɛ ikopaa way! Lendaka, iiko inkuma ibombamɛ nde baiho bakiɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Nhɔhɔlɔ, biina be lyale bengoya itina ikiɛ, beenga baakuuna batimole benkenga be yɔkɔhɛndjɛlɛ, bangookolinga mpe bangookomɛtɛ ndjoko inkuma; <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />bangookonyata la wɛ la banto bakiɛ bankuma; nkola la etutu ɛmɔɔ engwemala, itina wɛ tweba elaka eyaki Ndjakomba yokolenda.»<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nde Tɛmpɛlo</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21, 12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mlk 11, 15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yow 2, 13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />La lombuha luuko, Yesu aɔtwɛ nde Tɛmpɛlo mpe abangɛ yopandja banto batɛkɛkɛ byomba mpiko. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Abahangelaki: «Ɛkɔti nde bonkanda boki Ndjakomba: “Botumba bokimi bongoyala botumba bo lɔbɔndɔ; nyo lokalimɔlɛ bɔkɔ nganda eeki biibi.”» <verse eid="LUK 19:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Yesu amboolakakɛ nde Tɛmpɛlo biina benkuma. Nkanga i benkondi la balaki ba bobeko batilaki babolyake, la ibɔ la ba nkumu iiki Bayuda, <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />yaa nko tabata ndenge yokela, itina banto bankuma balangake baoke balako baakinde.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s1">Nguya eeki Yesu iima nko?</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21, 23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mlk 11, 27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Buuna bɔmɔɔ boyalaki Yesu yolaka banto nde Tɛmpɛlo mpe yoebya Nsango e bɔlɔti, nkanga i benkondi la balaki ba bobeko bɔlɔngɔ la baome ba bihe bankina bayɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Babobelɛ: «Otohangele kaki mbo iiko inkuma ikelaka wɛ, okelake ikɔ la mpapo eeki nnɔ? Bonto ookopaki mpapo iiko nnɔ?» <verse eid="LUK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yesu aobaunoyela: «Emi mpe Nduubola buubo bɔmɔɔ: <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Nyunama eeki Yowane, ɛkɔ iimaki nde liko la mpe eka banto?» <verse eid="LUK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Bayaubɔlɛ laino ibɔ la ibɔ: «Kaki tongohangɛ: “Iimaki nde liko”, akotoubola: “Itina iipa taloboumeya nnɔ?” <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Kaki mpe tongohangɛ: “Iimaki eka banto”, banto bankuma bakotolika babɔkɔ, itina ibɔ bankuma bahangake Yowane ayali ntepeli.» <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Ɛkɔiko baunoyɛ mbɔ: «bapwebe looko lɔnɛ luumaki ɛkɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yesu abaunoyelɛ: «La emi mpe ntingolohangela kaki mbo iiko ikelaka emi nkelake la mpapo eeki nnɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwɛlya looki bahali ba bobe ba elanga e vino</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21, 33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mlk 12, 1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Nkamba, abapɛ lwɛlya lɔnɛ: «Bonto ɔmɔɔ aonɛ elanga e vino, apɛɛ ɛkɔ eka bahali ba bilanga kela baputele, mpe nde kiika atɛ lɔkɛndɔ lo elie. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Anɛ ekitaki eleko yonika mmuma, atindɛ bohali bɔmɔɔ eka baaputela elanga kela baopaa ekinde ndambo e mmuma i vino. Baputeli baiko babokulɛ mpe babounɔyɛ bapombo botoo. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Bɔmɛlɛ elanga aunwɛ yotinda bohali bonkina. La nde mpe babokulɛ, babotolɛ mpe babounoyɛ nko bapombo botoo. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Bɔmɛlɛ elanga aunwɛ yotinda bonto ɔnɛ o bahato; la nde mpe babɔkɔtɛ mpe babopandjɛ nde elanga. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Bɔmɛlɛ elanga e vino ayahangelɛ: “Aiko nkele ngamo? Ntinda nko bɔna ɔnɛ okimi o loondo openda emi yolanga. Ɛmɔɔ mbala bangoobomanga.” <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Anɛ ɛnɛki baputeli elanga bona, bayabelɛ ibɔ la ibɔ: “Enda bonto oongotikala la lokutu. Tobolyake kela lokutu longotikale la nso!” <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Ngauko, baboolyɛ nde elanga e vino mpe babolyakɛ.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">«Bɔmɛlɛ elanga iiko e vino angookela la banto baiko nnɔ? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Angooya nde kiika, angoolyaka bahali baiko mpe angoopa elanga eka banto bankina.» Anɛ yokaki ibɔ ngauko, baohanga: «Nkola, ɛpɔɔhe yokelama ngauko.» <verse eid="LUK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Yesu abahihimyɛ mpe ababelɛ: «Yaa Nkɔti inɛ iiki Bonkanda bo Ndjakomba ilimbola nnɔ: “ Ikondi inɛ yee batongi ba botumba baumolake, ikinɛ yookita ikondi i ndombe ibuti botumba lonkundu.” <verse eid="LUK 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Bonto onkuma ongoyabonge la ikondi iiko, angoopupwa bimpulu bimpulu; bonto onga ikondi iiko ikɔyɛle, angooyandwa.»<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mputi eeki Kaisalo</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22, 15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mlk 12, 13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Balaki ba bobeko la nkanga i benkondi batilɛ babute Yesu elaka iko, yaa baokɛ banto bɔɔmɔ. Baebaki mbɔ lwɛlya loko loyalaki itina ikibɔ. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Ima nko aiko, babangɛ yɔlɔndɔ Yesu, babotindelɛ banɔngi baayali nga banto ba sembo. Batilaki babobateye nde mbo itepela nde kela babolobe eka ntɛndi la eka bɔndɛlɛ-mboka. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Banto baiko babuubolɛ: «Bolaki, tweba mbɔ wɛ otepelake mpe olakake mbo i semba, ɔpɔhɔlɔke bilongi mpe olakake nhɔhɔlɔ ndjela eeki Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Otohangelake, topa mputi eeki Kaisalo laa mpe tatopake?» <verse eid="LUK 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Yesu aebɛ bolenga bokibɔ mpe ababelɛ: <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />«Lɔnyɛnie mpata ɛmɔɔ. Elongi la nkɔti iiko iiki nnɔ?» Babuunoyɛ: «Iiki Kaisalo.» <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Kaki ngauko, lopaaka Kaisalo biiki Kaisalo, mpe Ndjakomba biiki Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Tabayobobateya kela babobute nde ndjela eeki bakambo baatepelaki nde ntondo eeki banto; nga mpe bohaa mbuto ekinde ebatika hukɛ, baopili nko mpilama.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Banto baawɛ bangookundwa?</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22, 23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mlk 12, 18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Ndambo e ba Saduseyo, banɛ bahangaka nkundwa teyali, bayɛ eka Yesu, babuubolɛ ngɔnɛ: <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />«Bolaki, Mose atoheneyaki bobeko bɔnɛ: “Kaki loondo lɔmɔɔ loyali la waali aowa, mpe nde la waali tababota, bohibotonga okinde akɔhɔkɔ waali uuko itina abotele bowei bana.” <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Lendaka, eyalaki la bahibotonga nsambo. Ɔnɛ o ntondo abalaki mpe awaki nko bota. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Ɔnɛ o bape akohɛ buunto ɔkɔ; <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />ɔnɛ o bahato abalɛ mpe nko buunto ɔkɔ, tii ibɔ bayaankuma nsambo, bawɛ nko bota bana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Nsuki nsuki, buunto ɔkɔ mpe awɛ la nde. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Buuna bonga banto bakundwe, buunto uuko angooyala waali ɔki nnɔ, itina ibɔ bankuma nsambo babobalaki?» <verse eid="LUK 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesu abaunoyelɛ: «Banto baayali nde bokili bɔnɛ boyali nso, bakɔhɔke baali la baome. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Yaa banto baahɔlɔmɛ yɔtwa nde bokili bɔnɛ booye mpe yokundwa nde baawɛ, ibɔ tabangobala. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Ibɔ tabangunwa yowa, itina bayɛ nga bentomwa: bayali bana baaki Ndjakomba itina iki nkundwa <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Mose aɛniaki potya mbɔ banto baawɛ bangookundwa anɛ etepelaki nde nde iholo i ibundja inɛ ipɛtɛ nko longola, ayeeta Nkolo “Ndjakomba eeki Abalayama, Ndjakomba eeki Izaka mpe Ndjakomba eeki Yakobo.” <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Wambɔ Ndjakomba tayali Ndjakomba eeki baawɛ, ayali Ndjakomba eeki banto baabika, itina nga laa nde banto baiko bankuma bayali la lobiko.» <verse eid="LUK 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Bɛɛmɔɔ balaki ba bobeko bahangɛ: «Bolaki, ongotepelɛ bɔlɔti.» <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Mpe tabaunwa lenkina yoboubola nkya lobo lɔmɔɔ.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kilito la Dawidi</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22, 41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mlk 12, 35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yesu abaubolɛ: «Ndenge nnɔ ehangaka ibɔ mbɔ Kilito ayali bona ooki Dawidi? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Dawidi nde kiika atepela nde buku e Nyembo: “Nkolo abelɛ Nkolo ekimi: Kiha nde lɔbɔ lo loome lokimi, <verse eid="LUK 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />tii enga emi nkitye baapokolange enyatelo e bakaka baakiɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Kaki Dawidi aeta Kilito Nkolo, ndenge nnɔ yɔɔhɔ nde yoyala lenkina bona okinde?»<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bihɛlɛlo bi bobe biiki balaki ba bobeko</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23, 1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mlk 12, 38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Yesu abelɛ bakɛndi laa nde ntondo eeki banto bankuma baayaki yobooka: <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />«Loyalaka la nkɛpɔ la balaki ba bobeko! Ibɔ balangake bakɛnde la benkoto be ntale; balangake banto bababekole nde ndye iiponanaka banto; balangake bakihe nde bikili bii ntondo nde betumba be lɔbɔndɔ la nde nongi i lokumu nde ntɛkɔ. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Ibɔ baibake byomba biiki bituka mpe bakelake mbɔndɔ i ntale ntale kela banto babahime. Bangoobata etumbo ekibɔ mpe engoyala e boolo.»<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s1">Ikapo iiki etuka e bɔmbɔlɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mlk 12, 41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yesu auleyɛ baiho, aɛnɛ banto batika bakapo baakiibo nde itonga. Baayalaki bekulaka. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Aɛnɛ mpe etuka ɛmɔɔ e bɔmbɔlɔ atika mpata ipe. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Ɛkɔiko abaebyɛ: «Ndobeela nte nhɔhɔlɔ mpendja, etuka iiko e bɔmbɔlɔ angopɛ penda bankuma baambotike bakapo. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Itina baiko bankuma bambɔɔkɔhe nde bɔhɔlɔ bo liko bopa ibɔ la itina, bootika nde itonga; endaka buunto uuko o etuka, opa la ibati angotikɛ bɔhɔlɔ bonkuma booyali laa nde itina yobika.»<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aebyɛ bonga Tɛmpɛlo epitane</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mlk 13, 1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Banto bankina batepelaki itina iiki Tɛmpɛlo, ndenge eyalaki ɛkɔ ilɔ, la mbɛi i babɔkɔ la mpe la byomba biipaki ibɔ bakapo. Yesu aobabela: <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />«Nde biina bɛnɛ byoye, biiko binkuma byɛnɛ nyo aiko, tengotikala nkola la ibɔkɔ imɔɔ nde liko iiki inkina: binkuma bingobulumwa.»<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakambo ba lyale la bɛnyɔkɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24, 3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mlk 13, 3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Bakɛndi la nde babuubolɛ: «Bolaki, bakambo bakɔ bangookelama lainga, mpe elembetelo engolakya mbɔ balanga bakelame nnɔ?» <verse eid="LUK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yesu abaunoyelɛ: «Lolendaka bɔlɔti mpe bonto ɔmɔɔ taloundjoyake! Itina banto buuke bangoya nde lina iikimi, bangoohanga: “Masiya wambɔ emi, ” mpe: “Elaka yoyela!” Talobayelake. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Kaki longookɛ nsango i bitumba la i boyongo, talookake bɔɔmɔ. Mbo iiko inkuma ingookelama lontondo, yaa tengoyala nko mbala ɛmɔɔ nsuki e bokili.» <verse eid="LUK 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Abahangelɛ: «Ehe ɛnɛ engomuna la ehe eni, bonkumu bɔnɛ bangoomuna la bonkumu boni. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Babu bangoobilima la nguya, mpe ndye buuke nkandi ndenge la ndenge la ndjala, bakambo ba bɔnɛnɛ bangookelama mpe bilembetelo bi bɔnɛnɛ nde liko. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Yaa, ntondo eeki bakambo baiko bankuma, bangoolobuta, bangɔɔlɔnyɔkɔlɔ; bangoololoba nde betumba be lɔbɔndɔ, bangoolotungya nde bɛlɔkɔ; bangoolotomba lontondo looki nkumu la bɛndɛlɛ-mboka itina iiki lina ikimi. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Uuko engolopa mpe epohe yotatola itina ikimi. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Taloyatungyake yotila lwebe ndenge enga lohambe. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Emi kiika ngoolopa bitumo biinga lotepele la wanya bɔmɔɔ bopa banto bapololange tabangɔhɔ yotona la yoengola. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />La ba ihe la ba nyango ikinyo, la bahibotonga la baninga baakinyo bangɔɔlɔtɛkɛ mpe bangootinda banto balyake baamɔɔ baakinyo. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Banto bankuma bangooluuna itina iiki lina iiki emi. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Nkya ngauko, la iyo imɔɔ iiki bɛtɛ bekinyo taingobunga. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Loyalaka nko la mpimba, aiko longoobata lobiko.»<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aebyɛ mbo ingokitela Yelusalɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mat 24, 15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mlk 13, 14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />«Anɛ enga lwɛne bɛlɔngɔ be bahola beolinga Yelusalɛmɛ, lwebaka wambɔ epiitanelo eeki nde yokita. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Nde elaka iiko, banto baangoyala nde Yudeya balotaka nde ngomba; baangoyale nte nde imonga i Yelusalɛmɛ baolaka; baangoyala nde ngonda tabaunuake nde imonga! <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Itina wambɔ bɛkɔlɔ biiko bengoyala bɛkɔlɔ be yohamba, bɛkɔlɔ benga mbo inkuma ikɔtɔmɔki ikokyame. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Biina biiko, engoyala ihɛi buuke itina iki bainto bangoyala la baemi la banɛ bangɔlɔmya, itina lyale ingoyala bɔnɛnɛ nde bokili lonkundu mpe nkɛlɛ eeki Ndjakomba ɛngɔkɔya itina iki banto baiko. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Bangoobalyaka la ibaka, bangoobatomba balɛngɛ nde bihe binkuma biiki babutu; bapakano bangoonyata Yelusalɛmɛ tii engokite elaka ekibɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eyeelo eeki Bona ooki bonto</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24, 29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mlk 13, 24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />«Bilembetelo bingoyɛnia nde inyɛlɛ, nde nsɔngɛ la nde baoti. Mpe nde bokili, bihe bingoyala la bɔɔmɔ mpe bingolota lokito la bonketi booki ndjale, <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />banto bangoowa la bɔɔmɔ nko la yokanela bahɛi baangɔkɔ nde bokili; itina nguya iyali nde lobola ingonyonga. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Nkamba lɔngɔyɛnɛ Bona ooki Bonto aoye nde batute la nguya enkuma mpe la lokumo. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Kaki bilembetelo biiko binkuma byobanga yɛnia, lwemalaka mpe luleyaka bilongi, itina wante lobiko lokinyo loyɛ ntute.»<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba boyɛ ntute</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24, 32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mlk 13, 28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Nkamba nde ɔnɛ obapa lwɛlya lɔnɛ: «Lolendaka bote bo figi la mpe bete bɛnɛ benkina benkuma. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Kaki biobanga yolia nkaha, lwebake nyo kiika nko la lolendo mbɔ eleko e waane bo nguya eyɛ ntute. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />La nyo mpe nko ngauko, mbɔkɔ lɔhwɛnɛ bakambo baiko bankuma baokelama, aiko loyebaka wambɔ Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba boyɛ ntute. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Ndohangela nte nhɔhɔlɔ mpendja, ekeke ɛnɛ tengoleka bakambo baiko nkokelama. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Liko la nse ingoleka, baoy baatepela emi tabangoleka.»<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Talolalake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />«Lolendaka weema bookinyo. Bɛtɛ bekinyo tabepitanake nko la ntɛkɔ, la ɛmɛlɛlo e baana mpe la mpoha e bokili, ntiki buuna bɔkɔ bo bɔntɛndi bongooya nkoeba, <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />lonsai ilonga imɔɔ; itina bongooya eka banto baayali nde bolongo bonkuma. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Talolalake, lɔbɔndɛlɛkɛ bilaka binkuma, kela longobate nguya yolonga bakambo baiko bankuma baoye, kela mpe longwebe yemala ki lontondo looki Bona ooki Bonto.»<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Yesu ambooyalake la waane nde Tɛmpɛlo emba nde alakake, nkamba la ikɔlɔ ayoli kela alekye botyo nde ngomba ɛnɛ eetaka ibo Ngomba e Olive. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Mpe la nte belonge, banto bankuma, bambooyakɛ nde Tɛmpɛlo yobooka.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Benkondi batila balyake Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mlk 14, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yow 11, 45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Ntɛkɔ ɛnɛ ɛlɛkɛ ibo mampa ipa la bote, etaka ibɔ Pasika yokita ntute. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Nkanga i benkondi la balaki ba bobeko batilɛ ndenge yolyaka Yesu, yaa baokaki banto bɔɔmɔ.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yudasi alanga atɛke Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26, 14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mlk 14, 10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Endaka, Satana aɔtwelɛ Yudasi ɛnɛ eetaka ibo Isikaliɔtɛ, ayalaki ɔmɔɔ oki bakɛndi lyomu la bape baaki Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Yudasi atɛ itoyaoka nde la nkanga i benkondi la benkondi beeki bahɛndjɛli ba Tɛmpɛlo lolenge lɔnɛ lɔɔhɔ nde yatɛkɛlɛ Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Baokɛ bɔlɔti baa mpe baokanɛ babopaa bɔhɔlɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yudasi aumeyɛ mpe atilɛ elaka e bɔlɔti kela abapa Yesu nongi epa banto tabayali.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atindɛ babɔngye elambo e Pasika</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26, 17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mlk 14, 12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yow 13, 21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Nde eleko e ntɛkɔ ɛnɛ ɛlɛkɛ ibɔ mampa ipa la bote, buuna boolyakaka ibɔ mpata kela bale Pasika bokitɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yesu atindɛ Petelo la Yowane lontondo, ababelɛ: «Lokɛndɛ lɔtɔbɔngyɛle elambo e Pasika.» <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Ibɔ babuubolɛ: «Olanga tɔbɔngye elambo ɛkɔ nko ?» <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Anɛ eka lokita nde imonga, lokooponana la loondo lɔmɔɔ aobile ibuka i bahi. Loboyelaka tii nde botumba bonga nde aɔtwe <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />mpe lohangelaka bɔmɛlɛ botumba: “Bolaki aubola: Mpuku ekaa emi ndɛ elambo e Pasika emi la bakɛndi la emi eyali nko?” <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Akɔlwɛnia nde liko, mpuku ɛmɔɔ e bɔnɛnɛ mpe eyali la byomba binkuma. Lɔtɔbɔngiɛlɛkɛ elambo aiko.» <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Batɛ, bataanɛ binkuma nko nga bobahangelaki nde, mpe babɔngyɛ elambo e Pasika.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elambo</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26, 26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mlk 14, 22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Ko 11, 23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Elaka e ilɛ yokita, Yesu akihɛ nde mesa nde la bɛnkɔmwa bekinde. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Ababelɛ: «Ndangaki buuke mpendja nde elambo ɛnɛ e Pasika emi la nyo ntondo eeki yɔnyɔkwa! <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Itina, ndobela, ntingɔlɛ lenkina elambo ɛnɛ tii nko elaka enga ndimbo eeki ɛkɔ ekokyame nde Bonkondi booki Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="LUK 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Akɔhɛ mongo, akumiɛ Ndjakomba mpe ahangɛ: «Lɔkɔhɔ mbongo ɛnɛ mpe loyakapoya. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Itina, ndohangela, ntinguunwa yɔmɛlɛ vino tii nko elaka enga Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba bokite.» <verse eid="LUK 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Nkamba, akohɛ mampa, lombuha lo yɔbɔndɛlɛ Ndjakomba, apupolɛ mampa ɛkɔ mpe apɛɛ bɛnkomwa bekinde, abahangelɛ: «Ɔnɛ eyali byonge bikimi, ngolokapelɛ. Lokelaka ngauko itina lonkanene.» <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Lombuha lo ilɛ, akelɛ ndenge ɛmɔɔ la mbongo, ahangɛ: «Onɛ mbongo e boheka bo ntɛmu nde bakila bakimi, bautumwɛ itina ikinyo.»<verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aebyɛ bonga babɔtɛke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Mat 26, 20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mlk 14, 17-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />«Lolendaka: bonto ɔngɔntɛkɛ ayali nko anɛ, alɛ byomba nde mesa ɛmɔ la emi. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Hɔlɔ, Bona ooki Bonto nde uuko ayoli nko ndenge ɛlɛmɛki. Yaa nko ihɛi buuke eka bonto ɔngɔbɔtɛkɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Mpe bentomwa beki nde bayaubola ibɔ la ibɔ ɔkɔ bonto ɔhɔ yokela ikambo ye ngauko nnɔ.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bonto oopenda baninga la nguya nnɔ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Baoyatika lɔmpɛnyɛ itina yweba ooleka baninga aiko eyali ibɔ nnɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Nkumu iiki bihe baemalake lontondo looki banto nga nkolo iikibɔ mpe benkondi balangake babaete banto baakela bɔlɔti. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Tɛɛli eyale ngauko eka nyo. Ooyali bonto o bɔnɛnɛ ekanyo, akɔhɔkɔ ndye eeki bonto o nkɛnkɛ, mpe ooyali la mpipo ayatikaka nga bosali. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Bonto openda bɔnɛnɛ oonko? Ɔnɛ okihi nde mesa laa mpe ɔnɛ osalela ookihi nde mesa? Epa ɔnɛ okihi nde mesa? Lolendaka emi ndjali ekanyo nga bonto oosalela ɔnɛ okihi nde mesa. <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Nyo wambɔ banto bayalɛ la emi biina buuke nde bɛnyɔkɔ beekimi. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Mpe, nko nga bompaki Ihe ekimi bonkondi, emi mpe ndjolopa la nyo bonkondi: <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />kela lɔngɔle mpe lɔngɔmɛle la emi mesa ɛmɔɔ nde bonkondi bokimi, longokihe nde ekili e bokopo kela lɔngɔtɛnde bakundi lyomu la bape baaki Isalaɛlɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo angooyangana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26, 31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mlk 14, 27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yow 13, 36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Nkolo abelɛ Simo Petelo: «Simo, Simo, Satana aubolaki kela alɔkɔnge nga bɔkɔngɔkɔ ibɔ bakɔngɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Emi, mbɔndɛlɛki itina ikiɛ kela nyumeya tekopitanake. Nga la wɛ, elaka enga wɛ onyunwele, okembyaka bahibotonga bakiɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Petelo abobelɛ: «Nkolo, ngumeyɛ ndjɔtwe la nde bɔlɔkɔ la mpe mbu emi la wɛ bɔlɔngɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesu abobelɛ: «Petelo, nkohangela ngɔnɛ: lɔlɔkɔ luuko, nkɔkɔ tengobeka laino kaki wɛ twangani mbala ihato wɛnte ante opondjebe.»<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɔhɔlɔ, mango la ibaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Nkamba Yesu abaubolɛ: «Anɛ e ndotindake nko bɔhɔlɔ, nko mbango, nko bikote, lokelelaki yoomba?» Baunoyɛ: «Tatokelela yoomba.» <verse eid="LUK 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Aikekeko, ooyali la bɔhɔlɔ bokinde, aɔkɔhɔkɔ bɔkɔ, ooyali ba mbango ekinde, akɔhɔkɔ ɛkɔ, oopa la ibaka, aɔtɛkɛkɛ bonkoto bo mpyɔ bokinde kela ahombe imɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Itina, ndjolohangela, iikɔtɔmɔki itina ikimi ingokelama: “Babotikaki nde botango booki balyaki banto.” Mpe iiko indenda, ingokelama.» <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Bɛnkɔmwa beeki nde batepelɛ: «Nkolo, enda babaka bape bakɔ banɛ.» Yesu ababelɛ: «Engopulɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lɔbɔndɔ loki Yesu nde ngomba e Olive</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26, 36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mlk 14, 32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yesu aolɛ mpe atɛ nde ngomba e Olive, bakɛndi laa nde mpe boyelɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Anɛ ekitaki ibɔ nde nongi ɛkɔ, abelɛ bakɛndi laa nde: «Lɔbɔndɛlɛ kela talɔkɔke nde bolengoli.» <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Nde kiika atɛ bona o lontondo. Akihɛ bakulubɔngɔ mpe abɔndɛlɛ ngɔnɛ: <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />«Papa, kaki olanga, umola mbongo ɛnɛ e lyale lontondo lokimi. Yaa, tokelake ndenge elanga emi, okelaka nko ndenge elanga wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Nko nde elaka iiko, bontomwa bɔmɔɔ booki Ndjakomba aumɛ nde lobola mpe ayɛ yobopa nguya. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Bɔɔmɔ bopenda yobobuta, Yesu aunwɛ yɔbɔndɛlɛ la nguya. Botoki bokinde bokitɛ nko nga batɔi ba bakila mpe bɔɔkɔ tii nde babu.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Anɛ eheyaki nde lɔbɔndɔ luuko, aemalɛ mpe aunwɛ looko looyalaki bakɛndi la nde, abatanɛ balaali, itina ihɛi ipendɛ yobabuta. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Abaubolɛ: «Ngamo, lolali? Lwemala mpe lɔbɔndɛlɛ kela talɔkɔke nde bolengoli.»<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babutɛ Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 26:47-55">Mat 26, 47-55</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mlk 14, 43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yow 18, 3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Nko atepela, ehoke ɛmɔɔ e banto ebaolelɛ. Lontondo lokibɔ, ɔnɛ wetaka ibɔ Yudasi, ɔmɔɔ oki bakɛndi lyomu la bape baaki Yesu. Ayahundje ntute la Yesu itina iiki abolinge ɛkɔpi. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Nko Yesu nde ɔnɛ obobela: «Ao Yudasi, ongotɛkɛ Bona ooki Bonto la ɛkɔpi?» <verse eid="LUK 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Anɛ ɛnɛki banto baayalaki la Yesu ikambo iilanga ikelame, babuubolɛ: «Nkolo, tobatɔke babaka?» <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Ɔmɔɔ okibɔ atɔkɛ bohali booki nkanga e bonkondi ibaka mpe abopupolɛ itoi i boome. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Lohenaka, engopulɛ ngauko!» Lombuha luuko, abutɛ itoi ikɔ mpe abobikiɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Nkamba Yesu abelɛ banto baayaki yobokembaka, nkanga i benkondi, benkondi beeki bahɛndjɛli ba Tɛmpɛlo bɔlɔngɔ la nkumu inkina: «Emi laa nhokita nkumu eeki banto ba boyongo ɛnɛ eha nyo loya yobuta la babaka la bɛmbɔndu nnɔ? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Anɛ emboyake emi la nyo biina benkuma nde Tɛmpɛlo, ntiɛnɛ boya nyo yombuta. Lɔlɔkɔ wambɔ elaka ekinyo mpe bokopo booki banto ba buulima.»<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo aanganɛ Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mat 26, 57-58</ref>. <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mlk 14, 53-54</ref>. <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yow 18, 12-18</ref>. <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Babutɛ Yesu, batɛ la nde mpe babɔtɛyɛ nde botumba booki Nkanga e bonkondi. Petelo ayaki yabayelaka la lombuha. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Nga bɔpɛtyaki ibɔ ibeba i ntyɛ nde ngina la ngina e lompango mpe ibɔ nkuma bakihi baɔkɔ ntyɛ ikɔ, Petelo la nde mpe akihɛ nde la ibɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Bosali bɔmɔɔ bo buunto aɛnɛ Petelo aɔkɔ ntyɛ, abohihimyɛ mpe ahangɛ: «Bonto ɔnɛ ambooyale nde la Yesu.» <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Petelo aanganɛ: «Ipoku, emi mpwebe bonto uuko.» <verse eid="LUK 22:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Lombuha luuko, bonto onkina wɛnɛki Petelo, ahangɛ: «La wɛ oyali ɔmɔɔ oki banto baiko.» Petelo aunoye: «Ntiyali ɔmɔɔ okibɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 22:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Lombuha lo ngonga ɛmɔɔ ngauko, bonto onkina aunwɛ yokobeya: «Eyali nko nhɔhɔlɔ, bonto uuko ambooyale bɔlɔngɔ la nde; la nde mpe ayali bonto o Ngalilaya.» <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Petelo aunoyɛ: «Mpwebe yoomba elanga wɛ ohange.» Nko Petelo atepela, nkɔkɔ ebekɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Nkolo aɛbwɛ, ahihimyɛ Petelo; Petelo ayabopolɛ lobo lɔnɛ lobohangelaki Yesu: «Ntondo nkɔkɔ ebeke, okonyangana mbala ihato.» <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Petelo aolɛ nde bongala mpe alelɛ buuke mpendja.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batolɛ mpe bakulɛ Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mat 26, 67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mlk 14, 65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Banto banɛ bahɛndjɛlɛ Yesu babangɛ yɔbɔɔlɔ la yobokula. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Baolipɛ elongi mpe babuubolake: «Kaki oyali ntepeli, hangaka oombokokule.» <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Mpe babotolɛ bitoli buuke.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahambɛ nde boloy bo bɔnɛnɛ booki Bayuda</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26, 59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mlk 14, 55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yow 18, 19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Anɛ eha nkɛhɛ ɛkya, nkumu iiki ehe la nkanga i benkondi la balaki ba bobeko baponanɛ mpe baangɛ baolye Yesu nde boloy bo bɔnɛnɛ booki Bayuda <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />mpe babobelɛ: «Otohangelake kaki wɛ oyali Masiya.» Yesu abaunoyelɛ: «Kaki ngolohangelɛ, talonguumeya <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />kaki mpe emi ngoluubolɛ, talongompa mbuto. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Yaa nko ima lɔlɔkɔ, Bona ooki Bonto angookihakɛ nde lɔbɔ lo loome looki Ndjakomba ɛnɛ e nguya inkuma.» <verse eid="LUK 22:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Ibɔ bankuma baoboubola: «Wɛ wambɔ oyali Bona ooki Ndjakomba ?» Yesu mpe abaunoyelɛ: «Nyo kiika longohangɛ ndjali Bona ooki Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Ibɔ bankuma bahangɛ: «Itina nnɔ itilɛ nso lenkina banto baye yotepela? Nso bamɛlɛ tongookɛ nde bonya bokinde kiika.»<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu eka Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27, 1-2</ref>. <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mlk 15, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yow 18, 28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Banto bankuma bayalaki nde ikoka baemalɛ mpe batombɛ Yesu eka Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Ibɔ banɛ babangɛ yoboloba ngɔnɛ: «Tongotanɛ bonto ɔnɛ atika isɛngɛni nde ekolo ekinso. Nde bonto ohuka banto bapute mputi iiki Kaisalo mpe ayaeta Masiya, wambɔ Nkumu.» <verse eid="LUK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Pilato aubolɛ Yesu: «Wɛ oyali bonkondi booki Bayuda?» Yesu aunoyɛ: «Wɛ ootepela ngauko.» <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Pilato nde ɔnɛ ohangela nkanga i benkondi la boloy boyalaki aiko: «Emi mpwɛne nte ikambo i bobe iinga bonto ɔnɛ akelɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Baayalaki aiko bakokomyɛ mpe bahangɛ: «Nde apa banto bɔtɛ boolo la balako baakinde baapa nde nde Yudeya lonkundu, ima nko ebangaki nde nde Ngalilaya tii anɛ»<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu eka Elode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Anɛ eha Pilato aoka ngauko, aubolɛ kaki Yesu ayali bohi Ngalilaya. <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Aokɛ mbɔ ayali bonto o ehe eyali Elode bonkondi, ekɔiko abotindɛ eka Elode ooyalaki la nde Yelusalɛmɛ biina biiko. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Anɛ ɛnɛki Elode Yesu, aokɛ bɔlɔti mpendja itina atilɛ aboɛne ima kala la wengi inɛ yoka nde batepela nde lina ikinde, mpe akambaki Yesu angoobokelela mpapo ɛmɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Abuubolɛ biibo buuke, Yesu tabopa la mbuto ɛmɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Nkanga i benkondi la balaki ba bobeko bayalaki aiko mpe batepelɛ nko mbo i bobe itina iiki bakoye Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Elode la bahola baakinde baɔlɛ Yesu mpe babɔtɛbɔlɛ. Ibɔ banɛ babɔlɔɔtyɛ mbɛy e bonkoto mpe babuunoyɛ eka Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Endaka buuna buuko, Elode la Pilato bakitɛ baninga, ibɔ baapa tambɔkɛndɛkɛ!<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bangokatelɛ Yesu etumbo e iwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27, 15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mlk 15, 6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yow 18, 39-19, 16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Aiko ɛkɔ, Pilato aetɛ nkanga i benkondi, baome ba bihe la banto bankuma, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />mpe abahangelɛ: «Londjelaki bonto ɔnɛ mpe lohangɛ nde bonto otika isɛngɛni. Emi ngobuubolɛ bakambo buuke nde baiho baakinyo, ntiɛnɛ la ikambo imɔɔ yɛɛli la etumbo nde bakambo bankuma babolobaki nyo. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />La Elode mpe tabobata la ikambo i bobe, ɛkɔiko emba nde abunoye ekami. Elimbola wambɔ bonto ɔnɛ apa la ikambo imɔɔ ikelɛ nde mpe itinda abate etumbo e iwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Ekɔiko ndanga babokule nko mpimbo, nkamba mbohene atu.» <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />[Nde ntɛkɔ inkuma, Pilato amboobaolyelakɛ bonto ɔmɔɔ oyali nde bɔlɔkɔ.] <verse eid="LUK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Banto bankuma baayalaki aiko babobɛ la nguya: «Lyaka bonto uuko mpe otoolyele Balanabasi!» <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Balabasi atungamaki nde bɔlɔkɔ itina atikaki boyongo nde imonga (i Yelusalɛmɛ) mpe alyakaki bonto. <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Nga boyalaki nde la mpoha ahene Yesu, Pilato aunwɛ yobaubola. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Ibɔ mpe baunwɛ yobola: «Baka nde nde ekulusu! Baka nde nde ekulusu!» <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Pilato abaubolɛ mbale ɛnɛ e ehato: «Ikambo nte i bobe ikelɛ nde nnɔ? Emi ntibobata la ikambo i bobe la imɔɔ yɛɛli abate etumbo e iwa. Ɛkɔiko babokule nko mpimbo, nkamba mbohene.» <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Nga la ibɔ, baunwɛ nko yoboba mpe batingamɛ nko babake Yesu nde ekulusu, mpe nde nsuki, oolekaki nko botingama bookiibɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Pilato nde ɔnɛ ooyaka yɔkɔhɔ meko bakele ndenge eelangaki ibɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Abaolyelɛ ɔnɛ we babutake nde bɔlɔkɔ itina i boyongo la yolyaka bonto, mpe apɛɛ Yesu kela bakele la ndenge eelangaki ibɔ.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babakɛ Yesu nde ekulusu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27, 32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mlk 15, 21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yow 19, 17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Aiko etombaki ibɔ Yesu, baponanɛ la Simo ɛnɛ e Silɛnɛ, aoyume nde ngonda. Babobilyɛ ekulusu lombuha looki Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Banto buuke bayelaki Yesu, la bainto baolelake mpe baoyahabake itina ikinde. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yesu abaɛbwɛlɛ mpe ababelɛ: «Bainto ba Yelusalɛmɛ, talolelake itina ikimi, lolela itina ikinyo bamɛlɛ la iiki bana baakinyo. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Itina nde biina bɛnɛ byoye, bangoohanga: “Ɛmɛngɔ la bikomba mpe la bainto baapa tababota mpe tabalɔmya bana babɛlɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Nde biina biiko, bangoohangela ngomba: “Lɔtɔkɔyɛle” mpe bangoohangela byɔngɔ: “Lotokuke.” <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Itina kaki bote bɔnɛ bo boyoyo bolongola, engoyala ngamo itina iiki bote bonɛ boomɛ ?» <verse eid="LUK 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Batombaki mpe banto bankina bape ba boyongo, kela batu itobalyaka ibɔ la Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Anɛ ekitaki ibɔ nde ndye ɛnɛ etaka ibɔ Lɔbɛkɛ, bahola babakɛ Yesu nde ekulusu la nsɛtɛ nde nɔnge ɛkɔ, bɔlɔngɔ la banto bape ba boyongo, ɔmɔɔ nde lɔbɔ lo loome, ɔmɔɔ nde lɔbɔ lo lwali. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Yesu ahangɛ: «Papa, obasabinye, itina bapwebe mbo ikela ibɔ.» Mpe babɛtɛ bɛbɛlɛ kela bakape bihenda bikinde. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Banto ba ehe bayalaki aiko, balenda inkuma ikelama; baome ba bihe, ibɔ, babɔɔlɛ nko ntɔɔlɔ, bahangɛ: «Nde abikyɛ banto buuke, ayabikyake nde kiika kaki ayali mpendja Masiya, bonto ɔnɛ ɔhɔlɔki Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Bahola mpe babɔɔlɛ nko ntɔɔlɔ; batutamɛ la nde kela babopaa baana ba bokai mpe babobelɛ: <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />«Kaki wɛ oyali nkumu eeki Bayuda, yabikyaka wɛ kiika.» <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Nde liko i bɔtɛ booki Yesu, bakɔtɛ: «Bonto ɔnɛ ayali Nkumu eeki Bayuda.» <verse eid="LUK 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Bonto ɔmɔɔ nde baiko bape ba boyongo babakemaki la Yesu nde bikulusu, abotolɛ: «Wɛ toyali Masiya? Yabikyaka wɛ kiika mpe otobikye la nso.» <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Yaa ɔnɛ ɔmɔɔ apɔndɔlɛ boninga mpe abobelɛ: «Wɛ opomange la Ndjakomba, nkya bonga wɛ obatɛ etumbo ndenge ɛmɔɔ la nde! <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Ekinso etumbo eyali nde ndjela: ɛɛli la besala be bobe beekinso; yaa nde apa la la lobo lɔmɔɔ lo bobe lokelɛ nde.» <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />La lombuha luuko ahangɛ: «Yesu, onkanenaka elaka engokita wɛ nde Bonkumu bokiɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu abounoyelɛ: «Nhɔhɔlɔ nkobela, lɔlɔkɔ, okoyala la emi nde Paladisu.»<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iwa iiki Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27, 45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mlk 15, 33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yow 19, 28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Ntute la ngina la ngina e buuna, la nkatala e waane, buulima bɔtwɛ nde bokili lonkundu tii nde ngonga ehato e ikɔlɔ, <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />inyɛlɛ tayunwa yɛnia. Nde elaka iiko, ehenda iiko e mpipa eyalaka nde Tɛmpɛlo eatwɛ nde ngina la ngina. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yesu aulɛ ekola e waandje, abɔndɛlɛ: «Papa, nguunoyɛ bolimo bokimi nde bɛbɔ beekiɛ.» Mpe nko aoheye yotepela ngauko, akomɛ botema. <verse eid="LUK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Anɛ e ɛnɛ bonkondi booki bahola baaki Loma bakambo bankuma balekaki, atotyɛ Ndjakomba mpe atepelɛ: «Hɔlɔ, bonto ɔnɛ ayalaki mpendja sembo.» <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Banto bankuma bahokamaki aiko yolenda bakambo baaleka, anɛ e ɛnɛki ibɔ inkuma, bakulɛ nko bakoto mpe bayaunoyɛ la ihɛi nde betema. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Banto bankuma baebaki Yesu la mpe bainto baambobayelakɛ ima Ngalilaya, baemalaki ekabɔ botale, balendake inkuma ileka.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakundɛ Yesu nde lyombo</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27, 57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mlk 15, 42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yow 19, 38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Aiko ɛkɔ, nde boloy bo ba baome ba bihe baaki Bayuda, eyalaki la bonto ɔmɔɔ, lina ikinde Yosepu, bonto ɔmɔɔ o bɔlɔti mpe o sembo. <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />Nde taimeya la meko la bikela biiki boloy buuko. Bohi Alimateyo, imonga imɔɔ iki Bayuda, mpe amboolilake eyeelo eeki Bonkondi booki Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Atɛ eka Pilato mpe abuubolɛ ebembe eeki Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Nde ɔnɛ ohuloyɛ ebembe nde ekulusu, akelingɛ nde mendja ɛmɔɔ mpe aketikɛ nde ipoku iitondolaki ibɔ nde ibɔkɔ, ipa tabakundi la bonto ɔmɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Eyalaki mputu e sabata mpe sabata eko eyɛ ntute. <verse eid="LUK 23:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Bainto baambooyelakɛ Yesu ima Ngalilaya bayelɛ Yosepu; baɛnɛ ipoku la mpe ndenge ebombaki ibɔ ebembe. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Ibɔ banɛ baunuɛ ekabɔ mpe babongyɛ behuku be mpimbo la balahi. Buuna bo sabata, ibɔ banɛ baitiɛ, ndenge ɛnɛ etinda bobeko.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s1">Nkundwa eeki Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat 28, 1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mlk 16, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yow 20, 1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />La nte belonge, bɔkɔlɔ bontondo booki pɔsɔ, bainto batɛ nde ipoku, batombɛ behuku be mpimbo bɛɛbɔngyaki ibɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Bataanɛ ibɔkɔ ilipaki ipoku nde bokili. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Anɛ yɔtwɛ, tabaɛnɛ ebembe eeki Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Nko aiko eyatungya ibɔ la ikambo ikɔ, banto bape babaolelɛ, balɔti bihenda bipa lweya lɔmɔɔ lo nguya. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />La bɔɔmɔ bonkuma, bahuloyɛ bilongi nde nse. Banto baiko bape babaubɔlɛ: «Itina iitila nyo eka bawɛi bonto oobika nnɔ? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Tayali anɛ, angokundwɛ. Lokanena ndenge elohangelaki nde elaka eyaki nde laino Ngalilaya. <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />Ahangaki: “Etindama nko bakape Bona ooki Bonto nde bɛbɔ beeki banto ba bahumu, bangoobobaka nde ekulusu mpe nde buuna bo ehato, angookundwa.”»<verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Ibɔ banɛ bakanenɛ baoyi batepelaki Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Baumɛ nde ipoku; batɛ itohangela bɛnkomwa lyomu la ɔmɔɔ la ekambi enkuma eyalaki la ibɔ bakambo baiko bankuma. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Bainto baayalaki aiko: Balia Bangandala, Yaane, Balia nyango eeki Yakobo la banɛ bankina bayalaki la ibɔ bahangelaki bɛnkɔmwa nko ndenge ɛmɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Lendaka bentomwa baɛnɛki mbo iiko ibahangelaki bainto baiko nko nga bitepela-tepela, mpe tababaumeya. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Nkoka ngauko, Petelo aemalɛ mpe apuhwɛ lobango tii nde ipoku, ahunamɛ mpe aɛnɛ nko bitate bi bihenda biibolingaki ibɔ. Nkamba, ayaunoyɛ ekande, nko la nkimo nde iiko ilekaki.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aolelɛ baataki Emausu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mlk 16, 12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Lolendaka, nko buuna buuko, bakɛndi la Yesu bape bataki ehe ɛmɔɔ lina Emausu, botale la Yelusalɛmɛ bo enga ngonga ipe i lɔkendɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Bayaki yotepelaka mbo inkuma yoyume yoleka. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Nko aiko etepela ibɔ mpe ewa ibɔ la lɔmpɛnyɛ itina iiki bakambo bakɔ, Yesu ababatɛ mpe bahambolɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Babɔɛnɛ, yaa yomba ɛmɔ yahuya tabunwake yoweba. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yesu nde ɔnɛ obaubolɛ: «Ikɔ yaa nyo lowe lɔmpɛnyɛ booli boboko nnɔ?» Baemalɛ la ihɛi inkuma. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Ɔmɔɔ okibɔ, lina ikinde Keleopasi, abounoyelɛ: «Nde banto banɛ bankuma bakihi Yelusalɛmɛ, wambɔ nko wɛ bonto opwebe bakambo banɛ baoyume yoleka biina bɛnɛ?» <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Yesu abaubolɛ: «Bakambo nnɔ?» Babohangelɛ: «Bakambo baalenda Yesu bohi Nazalɛti, ooyalaki ntepeli ɛmɔɔ e nguya, la nde byango la nde bitepelelo, ntondo eeki Ndjakomba mpe ntondo eeki banto bankuma, <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />botindo bɔnɛ boookapɛ nkanga i benkondi la nkumu ikinso kela babopaa etumbo e iwa mpe botindo bɔnɛ bobakaki ibɔ nde ekulusu. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Nso, tokambaki wambɔ nde bonto ongobikya Isalaɛlɛ. Lendaka, la iko inkuma, lɔlɔkɔ buuna bo behato ima elekɛ bakambo bakɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Yaa, bainto bankina bayalaka la nso bangotohahimolɛ mpendja: bambootu la nkɛhɛ e belonge nde ipoku, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />mpe tabaɛnɛ ebembe ekinde, bangoyɛ yohanga mbɔ bangwɛnɛ bentomwa beeki Ndjakomba mpe bangobahangelɛ abika. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Baninga baakinso bankina bambootu la ibɔ nde ipoku mpe iimbaa bataane yɛli la iimba bainto bahange; Yaa nde tababoɛne!» <verse eid="LUK 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Lopa mpendja la lyanya mpe betema beekinyo bepuumeye kwa bakambo baahangaki ntepeli. <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Tɛɛlɛmɛ mbɔ Masiya anyokwame ngauko kela aɔtwe nde lokumo lokinde?» <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Nkamba Yesu nde ɔnɛ oyobalimboyaka nde Bonkanda bo Ndjakomba inkuma yoolenda nde, ima nko Mose tii ntepeli inkuma.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Bakitɛ ntute la ehe etaki ibɔ, Yesu akelɛ lonsai bonto olanga atu botale. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Ibɔ banɛ babɔbɔndɛlɛ buuke, bahangɛ: «Yaka tokihe, itina ikɔlɔ yolinga mpe buuna bohula.» Ɛkɔiko eyaki Yesu yɔɔtwa kela bakihe. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Anɛ ekihaki nde la ibɔ nde mesa kela bale, Yesu ɔkɔhɛ mampa, abɔndɛlɛ lɔbɔndɔ lo bokako; apupolɛ mampa mpe abakapelɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Mbala ɛmɔ, baiho baakiibɔ balipwɛ mpe baunwɛ yoboeba, mpe nko aiko alimwɛ nde baiho baakiibɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Bayaubolɛ: «Betema beekinso tabeyala ntyɛ ntyɛ anɛ eyaki nde yototepeyaka mpe yotolimboyelaka Benkanda beeki Ndjakomba?»<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Nko nde elaka iiko, baemalɛ mpe baunwɛ Yelusalɛmɛ; bataanɛ bakɛndi la Yesu lyomu la ɔmɔɔ bakihi nongi ɛmɔɔ ibɔ la baninga baakiibɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />Babahangelɛ: «Hɔlɔ, Nkolo angokundwɛ, angoolelɛ Simo.» <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Ibɔ bape mpe baobahangela bakambo bankuma balekaki elaka eyalaki ibɔ nde ndjela mpe ndenge eyaki ibɔ yoboeba anɛ epupolaki nde mampa.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aolelɛ bakɛndi la nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28, 16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mlk 16, 14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yow 20, 19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Bes 1, 6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Nko batepela, Yesu nde ɔnɛ ohwemala nde ngina la ngina ekiibɔ mpe ababelɛ: «Bɔlɔti booki Ndjakomba boyale la nyo.» <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Baokɛ nte bɔɔmɔ itina bakambaki bangwɛnɛ elima. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Itina nnɔ yoka nyo bɔɔmɔ? Itina mpe iyali nyo la lɔmpɛnyɛ nde betema bekinyo nnɔ? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Lolenda bakata la bekolo beekimi: emi nde ɔnɛ. Lombute mpe lolende; elima apoyalake la behuni, apoyalake la beehe, nga wɛnɛ nyo emi ndjali la bɛkɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Aiko etepela nde, abaɛniɛ bakata la bekolo beekinde. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Nga bopa tabɔhɔ laino yumeya lobo lo e ngauko mpe bayalaki la ibulwako imɔɔ bɔnɛnɛ mpe bakulaki bakoto. Yesu abaubolɛ: «Loyali la bona o yoomba yɔlɛ anɛ?» <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Babopɛ empulu e nsi e nkalanga. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Akɔhɛ ɛkɔ mpe alɛ nde baiho baakiibɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Lombuha luuko ababelɛ: «Lolenda bakambo baalohangelaki emi elaka eyalaki emi laino la nyo: Bakambo bankuma bakɔtɔmɔki itina ikimi nde Bobeko booki Mose, nde benkanda beeki ntepeli mpe nde Nyembo, ɛlɛmɛki bakokyame.» <verse eid="LUK 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Ngauko, abalipolɛ lyanya kela baebe yotingola mbo iikɔti nde Benkanda beeki Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Ababelɛ: «Bakɔtɔki ngɔnɛ: “Masiya angɔɔnyɔkwa mpe angookundwa buuna bo behato, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />mpe, nde lina ikinde, bangoolaka banto ba bikolo binkuma babɔngye betema kela babate boliboli bo bahumu, ima nko nde Yelusalɛmɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Nyo wambɔ loyali nyɛni iiki bakambo baiko. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Emi ngolotindela ɔnɛ ololakoyaki Ihe ekimi. Nga la nyo, loyalaka nko nde imonga i Yelusalɛmɛ tii enga lobate nguya enguuma nde liko.»<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aulelɛ nde liko</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mlk 16, 19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Bes 1, 9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Nkamba Yesu abatombɛ ntute la imonga i Betani; bakite mpiko, aileyɛ bɛbɔ mpe abatɔmɛyɛ bokako. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Nko aiko ebatɔmeya nde bokako, akapwɛ nde la ibɔ mpe babouleyɛ tii nde liko. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Ibɔ, babokumamelɛ mpe baunwɛ Yelusalɛmɛ, la ibulwako imɔɔ i bɔnɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Mpe mpiko, bambooyalake mbala la mbala nde Tɛmpɛlo yototya Ndjakomba.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>